{"time": 1761394740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699686453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（赛丽亚不知道.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761394751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133115568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...似乎可以把讨厌的人定住...我也不太清楚怎么放出来的。\""}
{"time": 1761394763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075233389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=736276386](那肯定不提啊)"}
{"time": 1761394784, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874542649", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"还能...用一些雾的力量?舒茉不清楚...\""}
{"time": 1761394927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1697344119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=329813771]“这话应该换我来说，多亏了舒茉..我才能活下去”"}
{"time": 1761395103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962002010", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……突然获得的力量？”赛丽亚有点没料到你会在这个时候问这个“很少见的情况诶”"}
{"time": 1761395196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1821819079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯....突然就...自己可以放出来...\"更主要的细节决定隐瞒下来，\"赛丽亚姐姐，我这是...怎么了?\""}
{"time": 1761395262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258576795", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "感觉有点开心，这样的话，舒茉就没有理由和自己分开了...."}
{"time": 1761395466, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593063195", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然少见……但也不是没有先例。大陆上偶尔会有人后天觉醒特殊的力量。契机因人而异……有的是和血脉有关，有的是被什么更超然的存在注视或者赐福”"}
{"time": 1761395505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922438635", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...那赛丽亚小姐知道我身上是什么原因吗？\""}
{"time": 1761395565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122448117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她摇摇头“我只是知道有这种事，但是我并不会魔法，也看不出来”"}
{"time": 1761395749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "172817814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...伊恩，你身体好些了吗？\""}
{"time": 1761395926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1389777065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "隐隐作痛.jpg"}
{"time": 1761395929, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1858221656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "但是隐隐"}
{"time": 1761396159, "type": "recv", "message_id": "836510094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像好了不少了...不怎么疼了，好神奇，明明那么严重的伤，没想到居然好的这么快”"}
{"time": 1761396250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742613240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉呢..你感觉怎么样了”"}
{"time": 1761396266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633430844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"摸着小肚子，揉一揉"}
{"time": 1761396723, "type": "recv", "message_id": "962273621", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉以后打算做什么呢”唐突提问，实在是不想和她分开"}
{"time": 1761396903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555982192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...就算这么问，现在我也没什么想法...好突然...\""}
{"time": 1761396967, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081541397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“因为舒茉....已经不“普通”了吧”虽然自己从来没有觉得舒茉普通过，不过舒茉自己倒是这样说过"}
{"time": 1761397134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "363919629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"一时之间完全不知道该说什么，\"舒茉....舒茉真的不普通吗？都是...日记本的功劳...\""}
{"time": 1761397195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667728143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但是日记本是舒茉的，日记本的力量不就是舒茉的力量吗...”"}
{"time": 1761397498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96016782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不能算吧...其他人拿着...也会有一样的力量。\"想到这种可能也说了出来，有些失落感"}
{"time": 1761397540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525868860", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉可以把日记本借给我一下吗..”"}
{"time": 1761397866, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1499745104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在散步）"}
{"time": 1761398478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203834117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1525868860]\"嗯...\"把怀里的日记本递给伊恩"}
{"time": 1761398515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650641542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"那股力量是怎么用的呢？\"感受日记本的魔力，试图调动"}
{"time": 1761398644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "522707189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你能感觉到日记本中有朦胧的魔力，但是无法交互"}
{"time": 1761398717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1140504887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"怎么样?伊恩。\""}
{"time": 1761398791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530308068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "摇摇头，但是很开心\"不行...看样子这股魔力只有舒茉可以使用啦，所以舒茉一点也不普通\""}
{"time": 1761399331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016636825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只有我?\"摇摇手，\"不可能不可能...伊恩都能感觉到魔力...所以肯定不是我特别啦...\"自己说出来感觉没什么说服力"}
{"time": 1761399688, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675199145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好了舒茉....这肯定算是你的力量啦，除非你打算不要这本日记，而且本身能调动魔力就已经不是普通人了...”"}
{"time": 1761400160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1577019186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=675199145]\"不对吧...伊恩不要说这种话...普通人...舒茉怎么可能不是...\"一直以为的世界观有种崩塌的感觉，一时陷入了混乱，语无伦次"}
{"time": 1761400415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844788977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉要重新规划一下自己的未来了.”"}
{"time": 1761400496, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179427594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉如果认为自己是普通人的话...那我应该也是了”"}
{"time": 1761400592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1049403626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊啊...我搞不懂啦。\"捂着脑袋，\"伊恩就算这么说...舒茉也完全不明白。\""}
{"time": 1761400855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1082001705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉也该想想之前对我说的话了..最终籍籍无名，一辈子在这种小村子里.....”"}
{"time": 1761401113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1609620092", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1082001705]没想到这种时候回旋镖打在自己身上，\"呃...\"低下头，自己也没有做过相应的规划，\"对不起...我没想过...现在要去做什么...\""}
{"time": 1761401184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668280354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好啦..时间还很长不是么...至于现在的话，还是在养养伤吧..舒茉要是无聊的话，我们出去逛逛？”"}
{"time": 1761401597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717330207", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...不对...现在应该休息吧...\""}
{"time": 1761401624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928810958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那就...休息吧...”"}
{"time": 1761401635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373858157", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看赛丽亚还在吗"}
{"time": 1761401848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499554594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还在啊）"}
{"time": 1761402176, "type": "recv", "message_id": "902726869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...伊恩，今天就好好休息吧...\"看向赛丽亚，\"赛丽亚小姐能帮我联系一下妈妈吗？让她不要担心...\""}
{"time": 1761402729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803987410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...好吧，先好好养伤”"}
{"time": 1761406348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1644667281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=902726869]“嗯，我也打算这么做。舒茉觉得怎么说比较好？”"}
{"time": 1761406460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "330620023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"顺利到达了前线...路上也没有发生什么，妈妈不用担心。\"斟酌着开口，\"这么说就好了...赛丽亚姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1761406486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "593696987", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，万一阿姨也看到了信号弹....”"}
{"time": 1761406588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594858117", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（万一？）"}
{"time": 1761406626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "230514175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我的意思是阿姨看到了，就知道舒茉在说谎了）"}
{"time": 1761406635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1206387694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，如果阿姨也看到了信号弹....”"}
{"time": 1761406638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1623285371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我的意思是）"}
{"time": 1761406640, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726692441", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一万！）"}
{"time": 1761406644, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138109237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1761418948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2136481320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1206387694]\"嗯...希望妈妈没有看到吧。\"自己也有些没底，\"我担心她会找过来...要不我们回去?\""}
{"time": 1761418996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1344073770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也可以吧,至少某种意义上我们的目的也达成了....”"}
{"time": 1761419169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1451327127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们的目的?\""}
{"time": 1761419273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507906255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“因为舒茉也不普通吧...能知道未来可以和舒茉一直在一起，我已经别无所求了”"}
{"time": 1761419277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078239151", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"是什么...\""}
{"time": 1761419396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "884570149", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1507906255]\"...\"无奈地叹口气，\"我真是败给你了...伊恩...\""}
{"time": 1761419611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063039376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样，我还能说什么...\"低声"}
{"time": 1761419620, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195120513", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会期待舒茉的回答的，关于未来...”"}
{"time": 1761420028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299285073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\""}
{"time": 1761420179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "772578736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“赛丽亚姐姐准备怎么联系阿姨”有些好奇"}
{"time": 1761420488, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914307843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是现在...我不能给伊恩答案呢...\"眯着眼，轻轻勾着嘴角，\"要听到我的回答...伊恩可要慢慢等呢～\""}
{"time": 1761420507, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1133160684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“反正时间还很多呢”"}
{"time": 1761420514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1286913887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=772578736]（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] ）"}
{"time": 1761420534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1923198992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=772578736]“只有加急的马车了”"}
{"time": 1761420608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "924154802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们可以跟着一起回去吗？\""}
{"time": 1761420621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021046651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊...话说赛丽亚姐姐，你知道在前线工作的话..待遇怎么样吗”"}
{"time": 1761420693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "381636533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=924154802]“嗯，不打算在这边停留的话，可以的”"}
{"time": 1761420762, "type": "recv", "message_id": "415866467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...赛丽亚姐姐，这边的费用怎么结算?然后...麻烦姐姐帮我把行李带过来...联系车。。。\""}
{"time": 1761420818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443898739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好快的回去）"}
{"time": 1761420976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258664442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩?\""}
{"time": 1761420989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934642381", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1761421083, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143571489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"你暂时留在这边吗...\""}
{"time": 1761421101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069173024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我只是问问.....”"}
{"time": 1761421256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625741366", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=443898739]（话说5连射好像是10级技能，也就是5级才能拿到，5级技能是个什么掌）"}
{"time": 1761421343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098931732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我倒是希望伊恩能留在这边呢...\"犹豫着，\"...嗯...\""}
{"time": 1761421392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168864223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....舒茉一个人回去吗..”"}
{"time": 1761421460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "920466241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=415866467]“费用嘛……处理伤口确实麻烦了一会墨离。但是米哈伊尔先生帮忙付过了”"}
{"time": 1761421512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1543141733", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些想跟着回去，但想想自己的积蓄，也许确实应该先留在这里待一段时间攒点钱...."}
{"time": 1761421533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712406200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....嗯...”"}
{"time": 1761421636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621872593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那就麻烦赛丽亚姐姐了...\"看着她，深深低头，\"这次真的谢谢姐姐了...\""}
{"time": 1761421707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1397745202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我应该会留下来的....”"}
{"time": 1761421744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1022351043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我真的没做什么，不用谢我的”她摇摇头“我也是承蒙大家的照顾是”"}
{"time": 1761421848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412499021", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩要是，嗯...想跟着一起回去的话...要不一起?\"慢慢开口"}
{"time": 1761421916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1971823444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我想看看在前线能做点什么...攒点钱再回去”"}
{"time": 1761422033, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081004051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...嗯，但是可能...很久不能见面了。\"语气里带着些不易察觉的失落。"}
{"time": 1761422165, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2069412076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉一起留下....”舒茉和自己不一样，她还有家人在等着她回去...“算了，没什么...”"}
{"time": 1761422183, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2021046651]（）"}
{"time": 1761422302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "426443110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2021046651]（那不是看你打算干什么）"}
{"time": 1761422351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1863330140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果做好决定了...\""}
{"time": 1761422476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1934170245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我应该已经想好了..回去的时候大概就舒茉一个人了”"}
{"time": 1761422560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2083012729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"如果...伊恩做好了很久不见面的准备的话...\"偏过头，他真的答应的话...自己反而是难受的那个，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1761422602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "743102067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不一定会很久...我也不知道...自己能坚持多长时间”"}
{"time": 1761422911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423604350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我...我果然还是...还是...\"嗫嚅着，用被子盖住脸，\"算了...\""}
{"time": 1761423014, "type": "recv", "message_id": "584465087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到她的样子，瞬间对之前做的决定有些后悔...回去找些零工做做也可以，说不定等舒茉想好了，到时候就可以和她一起再次来了“算了，我又改变主意了，我们一起回去吧”"}
{"time": 1761423501, "type": "recv", "message_id": "209156736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是...伊恩不是说要留在这边吗？\"咬着嘴唇，\"真的要和我一起回去吗？\"从被子里伸出脑袋，但是眼神里似乎有星星"}
{"time": 1761423665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "400269941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我们一起回去吧...”不想让舒茉伤心，让舒茉伤心的话，自己规划一切就没意义了“我回去之后再慢慢想吧”"}
{"time": 1761423852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295056589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1761423956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1323094424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"谢谢伊恩...赛丽亚姐姐...我们去哪里上车?\""}
{"time": 1761424233, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1852861763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要出发的话，倒是很快能帮你们联系。”"}
{"time": 1761424250, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1023461553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“拜托赛丽亚姐姐了”"}
{"time": 1761424326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2018430018", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯，麻烦了。\""}
{"time": 1761425682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "473699747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡着了？）"}
{"time": 1761446430, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868498937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=52D469F7D4F855418AD528AC1CE4BE83.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRHucTbCnDHTxOtMeRq_qHAtaNJKRiQcSD_CiiE8dKl68CQAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhCMyF8KWrO_Rgy4LMoBZHClegIxVYIBAm5q&amp;rkey=CAMSMPE7FpHUCPhmq-Zg_DV10lUCZ59RanTeSnxb6IOoRFQV8xuCsUZmerUM6RPWA7ekzA,file_size=14480]"}
{"time": 1761456169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "854514470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那龙哥睡醒了吗？）"}
{"time": 1761456408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820607767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] [CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1761456426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1070585617", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1761456429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224294158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还没睡）"}
{"time": 1761456448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "248055355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（厉害，伊神怎么说自己已经睡了（）"}
{"time": 1761456493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1498429292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=473699747]（但是下来不是赛丽亚去联系么，好像也轮不着我动啊（）"}
{"time": 1761456582, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1486646372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(表态?)"}
{"time": 1761456596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028653562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没有）"}
{"time": 1761456607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1202494492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（只是打完一局问问你睡没睡）"}
{"time": 1761456835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672409613", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那我们重新开始战斗吧（）"}
{"time": 1761456876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1798201904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在吃饭）"}
{"time": 1761457707, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1873495231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来你们归心似箭呐”她点点头“现在动的了吗？”"}
{"time": 1761457837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "317124251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉没问题....伊恩应该还要再躺一段时间?\""}
{"time": 1761458018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1819058404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我好的也差不多了”坐起身来"}
{"time": 1761458119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17646229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“墨离医生的医术真的厉害...”"}
{"time": 1761458206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830751164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那我去帮你们预约。快的话，半小时后就行……啊，不过你们换下来的衣服破的比较厉害……”"}
{"time": 1761458231, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1896073632", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我还有带其他衣服...”"}
{"time": 1761458375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "603037136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊，那我去帮你们顺便把包裹取来……晚些见？”*她走到门边"}
{"time": 1761458418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "192695011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我带的换洗衣服...都在手提箱里。\"本来准备试着下床，听了她的话作罢，\"那就麻烦姐姐了。\""}
{"time": 1761458455, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635533905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "赛丽亚出了门，房间里只剩下你们两个"}
{"time": 1761458639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1354061525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在姐姐回来之前好好休息一会吧，伊恩。\"说完自己先躺下去，合上眼。"}
{"time": 1761458740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600532233", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“.... 话说，舒茉”忽然想起了什么"}
{"time": 1761458761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1357435337", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们这是不是算睡在一个房间了”开玩笑的说到"}
{"time": 1761458837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "256741555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1761458888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585537878", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"不想回复，拉起被子遮住半张脸，翻了个身背对着他。"}
{"time": 1761459104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574259785", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "见舒茉不理自己，也不多说什么了，怕她真的生气，也闭眼休息了"}
{"time": 1761459156, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2144302756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（传奇冷场王）"}
{"time": 1761459809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1703611912", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，没过多久，赛丽亚一手一个提着你们的行李箱和包又回来了"}
{"time": 1761459936, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511941594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢赛丽亚姐姐”起身下床接过"}
{"time": 1761460009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2122187764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "听见动静，挪了一下身子，\"...\"箱子回到手边总算是心安下来，\"谢谢姐姐，我们换好衣服就回去。\"停顿了一下，\"...伊恩出去换。\""}
{"time": 1761460103, "type": "recv", "message_id": "454225514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯..”没什么异议，带着衣服去卫生间换吧"}
{"time": 1761460245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489547202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "卷起病号服的下摆，看看小腹那块现在是什么样，当时的爪痕...现在想来还觉得触目惊心。"}
{"time": 1761460268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "95467830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我猜是绷带）"}
{"time": 1761460376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "968306430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "还有些瘙痒和轻微幻痛，新生的部分能看出有些色差，不过看不出能被称为“伤口”的东西"}
{"time": 1761460473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856897015", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=454225514]也看看自己的伤口"}
{"time": 1761460659, "type": "recv", "message_id": "850268710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你被撕下的不止表层的皮肉，还有些许肌肉组织。因此尽管表皮也有新生皮替代，你的左右肋看起来还是有些不对称"}
{"time": 1761460678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1328646234", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真厉害...\"不由得感叹一句，利索地换好衣服，把破掉的衣服包起来塞进行李箱。推开门出去，\"赛丽亚姐姐，舒茉准备好了。\""}
{"time": 1761460885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059398591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到舒茉好了，自己换好衣服也跟上出去"}
{"time": 1761461416, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882266529", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不行了）"}
{"time": 1761461418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791316052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（昏迷）"}
{"time": 1761461505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001245316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡吧)"}
