{"time": 1761490806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111443433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没事，我画一下等外卖到)"}
{"time": 1761490821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "113520669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你别点了，我点了两份)"}
{"time": 1761491819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411076637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好的，请跟我来。你们这应该是第一次到这边来吧？”她给你们领着路，树屋在埃尔文不算个例，你们在的病房也不是最大的那棵。有些是将大树的树干镂空，也有些是将临近的树枝编织成竹篓般的屋顶。\n驿站不远，不过规模倒是不小。光是站台就能停下七八架马车"}
{"time": 1761493052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028657454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好壮观...”毕竟是第一次从未白村那样的小村字出来，看见一切都觉得惊奇"}
{"time": 1761494105, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611575416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"树屋...?\"感觉十分新奇，\"虽然知道前线是建在树上的...不过亲眼看见果然还是，会震惊呢\""}
{"time": 1761494397, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629614422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这些屋子，算是精灵们的遗产吧？”赛丽亚也仰头，“有些是他们种的，有些是他们做的……后面人们做的也是学习了他们的办法。”"}
{"time": 1761494472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217573379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过车站说到底也就是个四面漏风的棚子，现在里头只有一辆马车"}
{"time": 1761494513, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198391727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...”仔细欣赏一下前代遗留的树屋遗产，“怎么看都觉得精妙呢...不知道长期住在里面是什么感觉...”"}
{"time": 1761494533, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2078722611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（长期宿室）"}
{"time": 1761494730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788161143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "细看之下，虬结的树干间还有细密但透亮的能量流过"}
{"time": 1761494780, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195073886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"赛丽亚姐姐，那些能量流是什么?\"伸出手指着那些肉眼可见的部分"}
{"time": 1761495018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "368818982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“索西雅姐姐和我说，那是这些树的生命力……之类的东西，我也不太明白”*她摇摇头“不过那些枝叶已经干枯的树屋上确实没有这些东西”"}
{"time": 1761495124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855685397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"精灵看来为这个世界...留下了很多东西呢...\"心里不由得对这个神秘的种族更加好奇，不过眼下肯定见不到啦，\"我们就在这个车站等吗？姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1761495180, "type": "recv", "message_id": "275096542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那辆车就是了”她指向唯一停着的车“今天没有别的车了”"}
{"time": 1761495237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800923788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那，赛丽亚姐姐，再见了”"}
{"time": 1761495452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92964177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"在前线这里，麻烦赛丽亚姐姐了...\"郑重向她鞠躬，\"没有姐姐和大叔在的话...不知道这次会变成什么样...\""}
{"time": 1761495775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "19153670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我在想活）"}
{"time": 1761495791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553551783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（回去再被袭击一下？）"}
{"time": 1761495794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "445347615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
