{"time": 1761495818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "868238598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我们在回去的路上，不小心遇到了帝国的实验）"}
{"time": 1761495823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2076336127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（把我们转移走了（）"}
{"time": 1761495960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "807262231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（帝国哪有这种东西）"}
{"time": 1761495975, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1519728775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有的，你去看女鬼剑士背景）"}
{"time": 1761496088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "247513034", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=CA3BAA35A5723B3ADF3E4F249723A081.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhReE8bKLKgM3UYHCMFzBRtqSzvdIhibqQ4g_wootrqZpKTCkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQeVcK0bwW27xUIiD0APV_K3oC-2KCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAQSMAsj9moSikcKVtW37BKSsmGWSpCsJdNrtlIuIVhIpm8PxgGrPhlAjWOzRtJ2Asi0IQ,file_size=234651]"}
{"time": 1761496126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1496380527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1761496511, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688638501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "此时已是半下午，你们还没来得及感受防线的气氛，没见到身着盔甲手持钢枪的卫兵。只是远远听见操练场里的喝声。\n“不用这么严肃，大家只是在做该做的事”她摇摇头“回去的路，卫队们应该好好清理过了。”"}
{"time": 1761496516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "849695589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（帝国是帝国）"}
{"time": 1761496523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "798402987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（埃尔文在贝尔玛尔公国）"}
{"time": 1761496526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470330586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不在一个地方（）"}
{"time": 1761496540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812205983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（艾尔文防线离边境很近的）"}
{"time": 1761496552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "527458798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那也是外交事件啊）"}
{"time": 1761496558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "22721000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（其次那个实验场地也离艾尔文不是很远）"}
{"time": 1761496623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339433951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...相信应该不会出事了。\"轻轻叹口气，\"这几天出门一直不太顺利，不过还是希望防线这边加强一下管理...吗？\""}
{"time": 1761496651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1845078402", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像没有教育……来着？）"}
{"time": 1761496655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1414981257", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦有的）"}
{"time": 1761496660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412993767", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"最近总是会遇到这种事...\"甩甩头发，拎着自己的箱子准备上车"}
{"time": 1761496662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1650788246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你可以过一个，教育（）"}
{"time": 1761496682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1187382963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“希望不是什么大事的前兆...”"}
{"time": 1761496697, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180106552", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+1"}
