{"time": 1761496714, "type": "reply", "message_id": "14553237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[莉维娅]演奏出: 1D20+1={2}+1=3"}
{"time": 1761496868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "989424118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "伊恩知道，卡赞症是一种几乎没有前兆且会随机发生在任何人身上的罕见病症。一旦转变完全，则没有扭转的方法，只有少数意志强大且病症较轻的个体有戴上抑制器的机会"}
{"time": 1761496962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1979188959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以之前那个怪物，是有人突发卡赞症了吗”"}
{"time": 1761497036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080164472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这个……调查的人没有和我说过，不过米哈伊尔先生是这么判断的”"}
{"time": 1761497062, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1406511231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎...运气好差”"}
{"time": 1761497065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325538028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“实在是……无妄之灾”"}
{"time": 1761497182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "769600346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...”自己不怎么了解，在这里也就没有插嘴，思考了一会，最后才开口，“那个？也就是说...还是随时有可能发生这种事？”"}
{"time": 1761497237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434213776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该是吧...毕竟那种病没有前兆”"}
{"time": 1761497478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2128158970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”希望不会再遇见吧，“唉...”叹口气，拖着箱子上车。"}
{"time": 1761497478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171213814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她一时语塞，有点不知道该怎么回答你。想了一会，对你们和马夫说到“那个……稍微等我一会”"}
{"time": 1761497541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "549149330", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了，赛丽亚姐姐？”"}
{"time": 1761497595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482838690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她转身，朝着附近一间明显大得多的树屋走去"}
{"time": 1761497774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "981988364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...嗯?\"不太懂赛丽亚想做什么，但是先把东西搬上车"}
{"time": 1761497793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1431283395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "帮舒茉搬"}
{"time": 1761497977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1277632748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我来帮舒茉吧”"}
{"time": 1761497992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453597014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "接过她的箱子，往上搬"}
{"time": 1761498002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465069469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后下来等赛丽亚姐姐"}
{"time": 1761498124, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977535200", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没有等多久，她便去而复返，撩开车后的帘子，双手里抓着什么东西"}
{"time": 1761498134, "type": "recv", "message_id": "745339844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦你们还没上去）"}
{"time": 1761498181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "198468730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "没有等多久，她便去而复返，双手里抓着什么东西"}
{"time": 1761498196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1086455726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？这是什么，赛丽亚姐姐”"}
{"time": 1761498267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "942498968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"既然伊恩已经开了口，自己也就不多问，等待回答。"}
{"time": 1761498407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811437638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这个是……墨离小姐教我做的，她很会处理这些”她摊开手掌，手心上各自躺着一枚圆润的琥珀般的薄球。浅褐色的树脂内封着一片圆润柔和，规整到宛如画作的四叶草。\n“虽然……可能只是个安慰，不过我希望它们可以让你们安心一些”"}
{"time": 1761498502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "368104366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢赛丽亚姐姐”接过她送的礼物“看起来好漂亮，赛丽亚姐姐真厉害”"}
{"time": 1761498698, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1400819626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...\"看起来就很漂亮，迟疑地摆摆手，\"姐姐...这个太贵重了...舒茉不能收...\""}
{"time": 1761498738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288934730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（树脂贵重在哪.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761498800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1745163949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不对，舒茉。这样的东西放在我自己这里，才是一文不值”她摇摇头"}
{"time": 1761498928, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130961763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...既然姐姐这么说...\"小心翼翼地接过来握在手心里，\"下次见面...我也要送姐姐舒茉亲手做的东西。\""}
{"time": 1761499142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "344751567", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "入手没有珠宝常有的冰凉手感，反倒带着些许暖意。赛丽亚双掌合拢，放在脸侧，面带招牌笑容“嗯，我会心怀期待的。那，后会有期？”"}
{"time": 1761499235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669785100", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...姐姐再见!\"跟着她露出笑容，长舒一口气，上车。"}
{"time": 1761499370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1408160323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“姐姐再见”妥善收起"}
{"time": 1761499378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1574025819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=368104366]“没什么大不了的，只要愿意花功夫，这是谁都能学会的”她摇摇头“一路顺风”"}
{"time": 1761499400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182685812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...拜拜”"}
{"time": 1761499487, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1253380356", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有点困）"}
{"time": 1761499585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1545778575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=C0FF99A425E39D4AEB180251ECAEE892.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRQNNPZXVwYal6b0tNhdbP4Xc8_JhilXiD_Cijpg4OoscKQAzIEcHJvZFCAvaMBWhD2COq7oAU6xqzmpwd425_yegL9i4IBAmd6&amp;rkey=CAQSMFZBxmsDHLCf3H6FyxuuYv2_16-KewjpiKIUcjidCvmnE3blT4tLs78tSqF6sqNksA,file_size=12069]"}
{"time": 1761499600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411885677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那就睡）"}
{"time": 1761499669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1428124413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那就睡呗)"}
{"time": 1761499675, "type": "recv", "message_id": "503088902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你只要说一声就行了)"}
{"time": 1761499774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1930746975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "马蹄踢踏起来，车轮缓缓转动。车帘外，赛丽亚的身形越来越小，越来越远，随后前哨站也一样"}
{"time": 1761499945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1387568223", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "此刻不免有些归心似箭，暗暗握紧拳头，靠着马车的车厢壁，\"妈妈...\"小声嘀咕，\"舒茉很快回来...\"翻开日记本，打算仔细看看现在有没有什么变化"}
{"time": 1761499990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1305804586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我要是说这是技能书是不是有点不解风情）"}
{"time": 1761500045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1402180009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些累，静静的坐在舒茉身边...不管在哪，只要有舒茉就感觉很安心..."}
{"time": 1761500269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970910167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩...嗯...你也一起看看这本书。\"把书摊开放在自己的腿上，\"伊恩在魔法这方面是专家吧？\"侧过头看看他"}
{"time": 1761500355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042024172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎可以吗....不过专家什么的也太过了，我现在是个只比舒茉熟练一点点的新手啦”"}
{"time": 1761500398, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226658479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "日记本的最后一面，依然是那颗闪着银光的星星。此外，靠前的几面终于出现了有意义的内容，那是用银色线条勾勒的人像，没那么写实，连姿势都偏向你印象中的模样。包含你的父母，伊恩，赛丽亚，以及村中其他与你来往密切的人\n但第一面，依旧一片空白"}
{"time": 1761500462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1131915438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这个是我吗？是舒茉画的吗”"}
{"time": 1761500508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529465718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...除了神官姐姐和伊恩，我也没见过其他人用魔法啦...\"看回日记本，\"嗯...我没有画过这些人像诶...\"有些奇怪，手指拂过构成人像的线条，\"怎么回事...\""}
{"time": 1761500740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1940915505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩能看出原因吗？\"停在这一页。"}
{"time": 1761500804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "913120652", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样情况，我也不是很懂啦”自己只是懂一些魔力的运用，涉及到原理之类的就一窍不通了“我对魔法的理解还是更偏实用一些...抱歉，舒茉”"}
{"time": 1761500920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098880964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...我试试别的...\"当然也不会追问下去，沉下心，回想之前的感觉，试着从日记中引导出雾气"}
{"time": 1761501018, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522653164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "书本中冒出一小团雾气，没有当初遇险时的那么大阵仗，在车内的这点空间内，不仔细看甚至注意不到"}
{"time": 1761501173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664882648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"有些高兴地拿手指点点这团雾，\"伊恩看见了吗？舒茉好像...和这些小家伙很有缘。\""}
{"time": 1761501408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "534287126", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好可爱的感觉....”"}
{"time": 1761501453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "494141016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不愧是舒茉，好厉害啊”"}
{"time": 1761501624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276426915", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"厉害在哪啦...\"虽然这么说，不过肉眼可见心情很好，双手小心地捧住这一小团雾气，用自己的脸颊蹭一蹭，\"呼...我什么时候能有伊恩这么厉害...伊恩才能说这种话。\""}
{"time": 1761501853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1084445192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉就是很厉害啊...这次我们能平安无事都是多亏了舒茉啦，舒茉是我的救命恩人，我无以为报，只能...”看舒茉这么精神，心情也愉悦起来，又有心思去开玩笑了"}
{"time": 1761501968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1728727543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只能?\"顺着话说，\"嗯哼?\""}
{"time": 1761502019, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445705540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“以身相许吧，书里都是这么说的”"}
{"time": 1761502218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356836430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是...\"其实在意料之内，但是真的听到了还是有些害羞，\"真是的，伊恩什么时候这么厚脸皮了?\"合上书，拿书脊轻轻敲敲他的脑袋。"}
{"time": 1761502543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "524616266", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "倒也不是很痛...如果可以一直这样就好了，这样想着，不禁笑了出来“我脸皮一直都不是很薄吧”"}
{"time": 1761502577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "328599556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（真睡了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761502626, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040549852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"看向车窗外，\"还是想想怎么和妈妈交代吧...\""}
{"time": 1761526999, "type": "recv", "message_id": "563754131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（无奖竞猜）"}
{"time": 1761527007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975089067", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（猜什么）"}
{"time": 1761527020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "346874976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来都醒了）"}
{"time": 1761527279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142354693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(无奖竞猜我什么时候醒?)"}
{"time": 1761527333, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582194415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（本来是猜翔哥）"}
{"time": 1761527475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "127442897", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥半个小时前就在指导新人优化了)"}
{"time": 1761527598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "543517374", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1761528260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558466487", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "窗外是你们经过过，却依旧陌生的林地。车速比寻常快些，被车窗框住的风景因此有些颠簸，却还不至于模糊。这趟的旅客仅你们两人，过了快一小时，窗外的画面突然有了些既视感"}
{"time": 1761528295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1646321569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm。其实离得好像也没有想象的那么远”"}
{"time": 1761528336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1810304869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（既视感指的是）"}
{"time": 1761528341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1982772645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（出事的地方（））"}
{"time": 1761528385, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681013091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（出事的地方离村子感觉大概也就1个小时吧）"}
{"time": 1761528400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944365892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是）"}
{"time": 1761528465, "type": "recv", "message_id": "295901622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "倾倒的车厢和尸体们已经不见，血腥气已经散去。曾经鲜明得吓人的血迹也被草草掩埋"}
{"time": 1761528543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828630058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "收回视线，\"...原来这么近吗？\""}
{"time": 1761528572, "type": "recv", "message_id": "80854202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过这辆马车毕竟是加急的。可能跑的快一些？”"}
{"time": 1761528657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291808641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "对那段记忆倒是没多少恐惧，更多的是感觉到能活下去还是太幸运了，以后做决策一定要冷静一些....."}
{"time": 1761528776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "250988196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”在这么近的地方发了那种信号弹...实在不知道妈妈看见之后会是什么反应，深呼吸，“太近了...妈妈肯定看见了吧...那个信号弹。”"}
{"time": 1761528855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203146750", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们不是没出什么大事么...只要快点见到阿姨，就好了”"}
{"time": 1761528863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "367501509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（全程也就不到20km，笑）"}
{"time": 1761529122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941854970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"心里升腾起担忧，再快一点，再快一点，\"每次出门都感觉不怎么顺利呢....难道说是不适合出门的体质?\""}
{"time": 1761529160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475155644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“额.....舒茉可不要变成宅女啊”"}
{"time": 1761529561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530305068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"只是不出远门啦...\"没好气地看一眼伊恩，\"你这说的什么话。\""}
{"time": 1761529629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1816254265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（比已经埋了的顺利）"}
{"time": 1761530066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "869291387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唉，倒也不是不想出门啦...嗯...至少要能够应对可能发生的坏事，才可以。\"拉上车窗，越靠近越有些紧张。"}
{"time": 1761530126, "type": "recv", "message_id": "92516671", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"嗯...舒茉说的也对，我们现在还是太弱小了\""}
{"time": 1761530373, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556050068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是舒茉完全不懂怎么变强啦。\"叹口气，看着自己的手心，\"虽然平凡也没什么不好...但是真的握着这种力量的时候...总忍不住想去保护身边的人呢。\""}
{"time": 1761530471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "140533639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"按我的经验来说...大概是实战吧，之前我经常一个人锻炼，也没锻炼出什么所以然，但是上次击败那个卡赞症患者之后...我感觉自己对魔力的理解似乎提升了一些\""}
{"time": 1761530733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228006127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊?好残酷的说法诶...\"捂着脸苦笑，\"之后再说吧，果然我还是没做好决定...也没有这种决心。\""}
{"time": 1761530830, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2129014843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然杀“人”的滋味不怎么好受，但如果是为了保护重要的人的话...“舒茉慢慢想好了，反正也不急”"}
{"time": 1761530943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "801689595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有伊恩在的话...我倒是也很安心啦。\"掀开帘子看看到哪了。"}
{"time": 1761531066, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902089981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "谈话间已经过了令人胆寒的部分，后续便是熟悉的道路，树木逐渐稀疏，已经快能看到村落"}
{"time": 1761531136, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370937377", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“距离确实不是很远呢....”"}
{"time": 1761531206, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688178294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉有些紧张...\"一只手拉着帘子看着窗外，另一只手紧紧握成拳，呼吸得很慢"}
{"time": 1761531766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119670546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "此刻日薄西山，空气凉了下来。村中陆续有灯火点亮"}
{"time": 1761531817, "type": "recv", "message_id": "770338069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我会陪着舒茉的.....”"}
{"time": 1761531945, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712052659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"拿起手提箱，做好下车的准备，\"我会以最快速度跑回去的...\""}
{"time": 1761532119, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1418215868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "车停在熟悉的路口，你前天早上才来这里买过东西"}
{"time": 1761532175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163364063", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还是我来帮舒茉拿吧，这样舒茉跑的可以快点”"}
{"time": 1761532181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "51299087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抢过行李箱"}
{"time": 1761532343, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1448164623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"不过事已至此，\"那就麻烦伊恩了，我先跑回去。\"下了车一路向家的方向狂奔，心里只求再快点"}
{"time": 1761532366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1919647044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在后面跟着了，不过自己拿了很多东西，自然会慢一些"}
{"time": 1761532699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286413568", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "很快就到了家门口，好在是烟囱有在正常冒烟"}
{"time": 1761532793, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177897727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在门口有些犹豫，妈妈要是没看见的话，自己这样是不是就不打自招了...停下脚步，慢慢整理自己的衣服，平稳剧烈运动之后急促的呼吸，擦掉额头的汗珠。咬咬牙，摸出钥匙开门"}
{"time": 1761533039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1997634814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "门顺遂地打开，厨房里的舒蕾听到动静走出来，看到你的时候不免愣了愣，随后舒了口气，摘下袖套走到你跟前“舒茉？怎么这么快就回来了。伊恩呢？他怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1761533184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109635200", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事没事...他就在后面一点。\"走上前转个圈，\"我没出事啦，妈妈。\"总感觉有点不打自招，\"一点事都没有。\""}
{"time": 1761533269, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52152983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就，有没有可能，就算她没看到（））"}
{"time": 1761533283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562365299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（两边都会派人救援的对吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761533472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1998889546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那肯定还是希望她没看见啦。)"}
{"time": 1761533621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "660305524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“真是的……”她伸手把你搂进怀里，轻抚你的头发“怎么好像在怕我一样。没事就好没事就好……卫队的人和我说过了，还好离得不远”"}
{"time": 1761533873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105709647", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈都知道了？\"泄了气，一直以来的担忧消散，紧紧抱住她，声音也变得哽咽起来，\"舒茉...舒茉...真的很怕，呜呜...没想到会出，这种事...\""}
{"time": 1761534209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937031305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我好不擅长安慰人）"}
{"time": 1761534436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "822450449", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(翔哥在骑马的路上吗)"}
{"time": 1761534479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "360867686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，好难说）"}
{"time": 1761534486, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448285898", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总不能说大难不死必有后福）"}
{"time": 1761534624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152253837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=822450449]（是的）"}
{"time": 1761534775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "583451562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不怕不怕……”她的言语也有些干瘪，只能继续安抚着你“那种事，肯定不会再发生的……”"}
{"time": 1761535149, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2075906442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"深深吸了一口气，\"不过也有一些...好事啦。\""}
{"time": 1761535248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1838299265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之伊恩也到了.jpg。这俩人也没关门"}
{"time": 1761535290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961493720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2075906442]“嗯？是什么？”谈话间，你们都刻意地避开了另一车上发生的事"}
{"time": 1761535386, "type": "recv", "message_id": "678273659", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩，嗯...这个事情，能帮我说一下吗？\"把自己的日记本拿出来，看向伊恩。"}
{"time": 1761535525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008047800", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（变成魔法少女了）"}
{"time": 1761535545, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1912464375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“阿姨..舒茉也会使用魔法了”"}
{"time": 1761535657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948640969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说起来舒茉没有问过这日记本哪里来的吗）"}
{"time": 1761535785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067532013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还真没有吧)"}
{"time": 1761535795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "801954174", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1761535796, "type": "recv", "message_id": "493527409", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“魔法？真的？”她松开你，转而搭着你的肩膀“我就说，舒茉肯定比妈妈厉害……啊，真是的，怎么能让伊恩帮你提东西……快进来~”"}
{"time": 1761535976, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470024841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"伸手打算从伊恩手里把自己的手提箱拿过来，\"我也不清楚啦...感觉有点像魔法...也不一定就是...\""}
{"time": 1761536255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1124244209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...妈，这个日记是从哪里来的?\"之前一直没意识到这个问题，\"舒茉应该没买过这种东西吧？\""}
{"time": 1761536315, "type": "recv", "message_id": "729683001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（这么多年后才想起来问.jpg）"}
