{"time": 1761536826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1171574674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1124244209]“这个？”她眨眨眼“你小时候，我和你爸爸去赫顿玛尔，请人给你准备了一圈东西，让你抓周。那时候你选的就是这本日记本”"}
{"time": 1761537076, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961317907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=663581195]（but）"}
{"time": 1761537137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181184976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1171574674]\"诶...那么有缘分吗？\"把日记翻开，递给妈妈，\"妈妈看看这里面的画像?舒茉不记得自己画过诶。\""}
{"time": 1761537197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "565908118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1482921934]说完转身去厨房倒三杯水，端出来放在茶几上，\"伊恩，先别喝哦，小心烫。 \""}
{"time": 1761537565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1166289639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1181184976]“我也不知道诶”她轻咳一声“我没翻过它”"}
{"time": 1761537993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2041548510", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好吧...虽然舒茉也完全不明白，不过这次多亏了它。”端起自己的杯子轻轻抿一口，“嘶...要不是它的话，舒茉说不定见不到妈妈了。”"}
{"time": 1761538100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "677305426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃个饭）"}
{"time": 1761538311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "356052551", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2041548510]“是嘛……当时我还以为舒茉长大了会是个作家或者记者之类的”她坐在你旁边，突然又站起来“喔遭了，我火还架着呢”"}
{"time": 1761538530, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1220337053", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=356052551]“妈妈快点啦。”咯咯笑，“舒茉现在，想好好吃一顿妈妈做的午餐呢。”站起身跟着一起进厨房，“我也来帮忙。”"}
{"time": 1761538542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1470617004", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（已经是晚餐了.jpg）"}
