{"time": 1761538560, "type": "recv", "message_id": "597136675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=356052551] “妈妈快点啦。”咯咯笑，“舒茉现在，想好好吃一顿妈妈做的晚餐呢。”站起身跟着一起进厨房，“我也来帮忙。”"}
{"time": 1761538971, "type": "recv", "message_id": "38624571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "锅里是收汁受得有些过头的烧茄子，最底下的部分已经有些糊，她赶紧起锅装盘，好在都还能吃“今晚……可以小庆一次？再加几个菜好了。舒茉喜欢什么？”"}
{"time": 1761539133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "710605349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也来帮忙”"}
{"time": 1761539171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "429346120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我看到两个没点厨艺的人要帮忙）"}
{"time": 1761539194, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935084343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我可以干其他的事情）"}
{"time": 1761539299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1751617384", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...想吃南瓜。”"}
{"time": 1761539335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665779841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“伊恩会削南瓜皮吗？”端起茄子的餐盘送到外面的桌上。"}
{"time": 1761539433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1581027816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我可以试试...”"}
{"time": 1761539683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373907608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"家里有南瓜吗？\"鼓了鼓脸颊，再用手指戳破，\"没有的话...嗯...想吃甜。\""}
{"time": 1761539779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "359427562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有有有”厨房的角落里就放着两颗你单臂刚好能圈住的小南瓜，一餐吃起来没什么负担"}
{"time": 1761539843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2052513614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那交给我吧”抱起南瓜去洗一下"}
{"time": 1761539962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1087030726", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘿嘿...那我负责加很多很多糖。\"感觉轻松无比，语气都染上轻快，\"唔...还要炒点什么菜吗？妈。\""}
{"time": 1761539986, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370353933", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后洗完把南瓜放在案板上"}
{"time": 1761540021, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499666299", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拿起菜刀，虽然应该是第一次拿刀，但剥皮应该不难吧"}
{"time": 1761540034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1142503865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] 我拿起剑了（bushj）"}
{"time": 1761540092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461677806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶?\"看见伊恩拿起菜刀，\"等等，削南瓜皮是用菜刀吗？\""}
{"time": 1761540098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32321399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“很多糖的话……就做成焦糖南瓜派好了，啊啊，现在不用，切开就好了，削了皮就不好蒸了。嗯……炖菜好像来不及了”"}
{"time": 1761540130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1767358586", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那，我们今晚在院子里做烧烤吧？”"}
