{"time": 1761552993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "605486194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1452422067]肉铺还开着门，深处亮着灯火，离案板稍远，显得案板上的冷肉颜色更暗了些。一只毛发蓝白相间、长得有些像狼的幼兽伏在板子上，一边打哈欠一边甩动扫把般的尾巴驱赶蚊蝇……有时候很难说苍蝇和兽毛哪个比较讨人厌"}
{"time": 1761553045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1855745052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"这.....\"有些不好评价"}
{"time": 1761553510, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1299258457", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么，不喜欢哈基米？）"}
{"time": 1761553568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "833546316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(狼不是狗么"}
{"time": 1761553574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945719426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] ）"}
{"time": 1761553593, "type": "recv", "message_id": "922909807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（长得像狼的哈基米）"}
{"time": 1761553613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650397927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（北风狼王.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761553729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448407855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(长得像狗的猫"}
{"time": 1761553752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758740527", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呃...这是什么?\"俯下身子看着这家伙"}
{"time": 1761553765, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1360995475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"老板在吗？\"弱弱地问一句"}
{"time": 1761553881, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167527949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我是不是应该先和你们说，不是第一次见（））"}
{"time": 1761553926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537424884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是这样的)"}
{"time": 1761554354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "106763173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "阿拉德大路上的奇妙物种远比想象的多，眼前这只……叫不出种族的小家伙也是其中之一，据说是老板三十年前从林子里捡到的。嗜睡、乖巧、亲人而柔软是它几乎全部的特质，不过神秘之处是，你们小时候看它，感觉就是这么大，十来年过去，它还是这么大，但怎么看都还没长开\n不过如果不考虑种族，只问个体名字的话，它叫小鲍比……也有人叫它老鲍比"}
{"time": 1761554449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999278824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"小鲍比?老板在吗？\"伸手摸摸对方的脑袋"}
{"time": 1761554476, "type": "recv", "message_id": "276800766", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（听起来是哥哥的宠物）"}
{"time": 1761554563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1150968271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "老板是个快五十岁、两鬓斑白但依旧和牛一样能干的汉子。里间应了一声，他便穿着那身标志性的，沾着血脂的围裙走了出来“小舒茉？稀客啊，怎么这个点来？”"}
{"time": 1761554669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1226214061", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "小鲍比用细密得可以和鸟类相比的绒毛蹭了蹭你的手掌，随后站了起来，在来得及挑块边角料下嘴之前被店长抱了下去"}
{"time": 1761554689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1568074541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们去了趟前线，刚刚回来”"}
{"time": 1761554735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102793231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈打算弄烧烤，我来看看有没有合适的肉啦。\"有些可惜地看着被抱走的猫，\"唔...能做成串的那种，是不是要肥瘦相间的好一点?\""}
{"time": 1761555167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "704095186", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，出远门了”他点点头，抓起案板上的尖刀，一个个指给你们看“花肉卖得紧啊，留不到这个点。现在还剩的就是这些，鸡胗，板筋，油膜……哦，还剩块梅头肉”"}
{"time": 1761555327, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621277026", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩怎么看?\"不太懂大部分肉的区别，询问一旁的伊恩。\"舒茉不太懂诶...\""}
{"time": 1761555412, "type": "recv", "message_id": "457839570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他吃的肉说不定真的比你多）"}
{"time": 1761555446, "type": "recv", "message_id": "746748443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“鸡胗...舒茉喜欢吃吗”由于是内脏不太感兴趣"}
{"time": 1761555474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910303637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过这个听说烤着挺好吃的”"}
{"time": 1761555509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "555616719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不一样都要一些吧”"}
{"time": 1761555585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300902393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样吗？伊恩不介意的话...大叔一样帮我切一点吧。\"笑着看向老板，\"我们一家加上伊恩，份量大叔看着来就行。\""}
{"time": 1761555616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228630688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "从衣服口袋里摸出自己的小钱袋，准备结账。"}
{"time": 1761555649, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683338304", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我来好了...”"}
{"time": 1761555673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498676525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "先掏出30个银币"}
{"time": 1761555870, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2123329758", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“算内脏里最好烤的了。梅头肉偏瘦，本来适合煎着，不过裹上油膜的话就不一样了”他说着动起手来，尖刀如水中游鱼，利落滑动，挑着卖相还过得去的部位给梅头肉切成条，索性用网膜先包上再装进纸袋，掂量着也有快两斤“一共18银”"}
{"time": 1761555900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189923199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "迅速把钱递给他"}
{"time": 1761555947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1934596469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这是我家做饭啦。\"用手臂挡住伊恩，但是慢了一步，语气有些无奈，\"伊恩抢着付这个钱干嘛...\""}
{"time": 1761555972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999098543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"大叔，别收他的。\"从钱袋里摸出银钱递给老板。"}
{"time": 1761556005, "type": "recv", "message_id": "5547620", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“算感谢舒茉吧”"}
{"time": 1761556075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28448343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他看热闹不嫌事大，不过自然是手慢无，接过了伊恩给出的银币“好嘞”"}
{"time": 1761556118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1640799391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且今天很特殊吧...我也想做点什么”"}
{"time": 1761556300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1981899270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今天哪有什么特殊的。\"无奈地收回银钱，\"伊恩花钱大手大脚。\"语气里带着些责备。"}
{"time": 1761556363, "type": "recv", "message_id": "611457053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"天天感谢我，我又没做什么...\"摇摇头，\"不能老是用这种理由啦...\""}
{"time": 1761556419, "type": "recv", "message_id": "952671491", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“今天还不特殊吗...舒茉可是学会了魔法”当然后半句声音很小"}
{"time": 1761556493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135912265", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没事，哈基米早晚也会会魔法的）"}
{"time": 1761556599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1107580637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那也...\"手指一直卷着自己垂下来的发丝，\"算了，由着你了。\"蹲下身子对着桌下的鲍比拍拍手"}
{"time": 1761556683, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1934438144", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "鲍比晃着尾巴就过来蹭你了，不知道和你手上沾的油腥气有没有关系"}
{"time": 1761557171, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935092866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"有些不舍地放下手里的猫，\"大叔拜拜。\"回过身看着伊恩，摊开手，\"舒茉虽然不讨厌啦，不过伊恩是不是把我的活都抢光了？\""}
{"time": 1761558023, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948763016", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（该吃饭了）"}
{"time": 1761558558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459911957", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“没关系啦..”"}
{"time": 1761558738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "806781562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉轻轻松松，开开心心，我就很满足了”"}
{"time": 1761558855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "410943955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"所以我才说不了你什么啦...\""}
{"time": 1761558940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1189288654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好了，我们快点回去吧。\""}
{"time": 1761558969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1213449359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=635A73E8493EE7C6D0C3A3D25EC500D5.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRBoLDrRaaRAIWcrHszTGOTVSC_yBiXuwgg_wooj52_xI7EkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ_fX0FNdsgwiyKSv_uUWkTHoCN8eCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAQSMC12HlBfiQ6zNuuVCojfScoYyvKOC_rr6fXye3JFikmhc8lPhgfBE_1O99yRO0fqrQ,file_size=138647]"}
{"time": 1761558977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2062367046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（啊呀，骇死我了）"}
{"time": 1761559164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "767772308", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，走吧”提着肉回去"}
{"time": 1761559196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237699653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "跟在他身后，在村子里总是安心很多。"}
{"time": 1761582278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1367825369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说）"}
