{"time": 1761585238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2010653614", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“伊恩，待会帮我布置一下院子...处理就不需要专门弄了。”"}
{"time": 1761585345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1575796431", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"行，那我们从哪开始，你知道烧烤用的炉子放在哪里吗\""}
{"time": 1761585590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2047517196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"问问妈妈吧...\"想到爸爸可能回来了，一时间也不知该怎么面对。总之先看看家里面什么个情况"}
{"time": 1761585736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1077548670", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=629639466]（[CQ:at,qq=825734198] ）"}
