{"time": 1761586025, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554891236", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去厨房放肉的同时“emm，阿姨，炉子在哪里，我先给搬到院子去”"}
