{"time": 1761586098, "type": "recv", "message_id": "472592107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我来串一下肉吧，嗯...青椒也不能少。\""}
{"time": 1761586179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1062223812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=844013569]（公国会抓吗）"}
{"time": 1761586236, "type": "recv", "message_id": "545218899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾已经备好了签子，穿好了不少素菜，放在木盘里。此外自然还有调料要准备。父亲还没到家，厨房和沙发上都没有熟悉的影子"}
{"time": 1761586266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "366257951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1062223812]（还是会的吧）"}
{"time": 1761586345, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742689225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛...\"毕竟大叔已经切好了肉，过一遍水，拿调味料腌制一下，拿个小凳子坐到厨房里熟练地串肉，\"伊恩，来这边搬一下烤架。\""}
{"time": 1761586624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804121834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说魔界人找上门好像也有点，old school）"}
{"time": 1761586642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "723518615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没事，事件也是好搞的）"}
{"time": 1761586652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "691280203", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我习惯祸不及家人（）"}
