{"time": 1761586831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801569120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1742689225][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “来了....”"}
{"time": 1761586858, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269034817", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然自己力气也不是很大，但烤架应该大概也搬得动吧...."}
{"time": 1761586878, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2021277309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把烤架搬到院子里"}
{"time": 1761587016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2131698244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后回去看看还能做什么"}
{"time": 1761587024, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1417971813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我也来帮忙穿串吧”"}
{"time": 1761587035, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127114134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "无非是个薄金属槽和一个架子，搬起来不算费劲，父亲也终于姗姗来迟。原本脸上有些忧愁，在见到你们的时候便烟消云散"}
{"time": 1761587181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1145829626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么了，叔叔，你看起来好像不太开心的样子”"}
{"time": 1761587192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "899017807", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"爸爸，舒茉没事...\"放下手中的活计，\"诶...发生什么了吗？\""}
{"time": 1761587625, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1358629353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，没什么。下班前村委的人来了一趟”他蹲下来摸了摸你们两人的脑袋“说前线那边传来消息，最近袭击的魔物规模变大了，我本来还在担心你们留在那边会不会有危险……不过怎么这么快就回来了？”"}
{"time": 1761587700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1025564501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等着舒茉来解释吧，害怕自己说错什么"}
{"time": 1761587753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1169476964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...突然想家了嘛，那边有点危险，在路上收到前线的通知，叫我们作家不要过去...\"对着妈妈眨眨眼，\"所以赶紧掉头回来啦。\""}
{"time": 1761587800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "338256626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“今晚特意准备了烧烤呢，爸爸过来帮着把东西都搬出去，呼呼...”"}
{"time": 1761588029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "249595194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦哦，这样……有点可惜，不过安全要紧”他点点头，看起来心情轻松了不少，虽然话一如既往地不多“今晚是派对时间？”"}
{"time": 1761588199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1176046666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯嗯，今晚伊恩也在这边。正好办一个派对嘛。”笑眯眯地看着伊恩，“伊恩要不今晚留在我家睡吧？”"}
{"time": 1761588204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874064496", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，好了，叔叔，我们一起来搬东西吧，话说舒茉，要不要搬张桌子到外面串呢，外面晚风吹着还蛮舒服的”"}
{"time": 1761588278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1739982564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1176046666][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 说到一半听到这话瞬间咽住了，如果自己在喝水的话肯定会全吐出来“？还有多余的房间吗？”"}
{"time": 1761588311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1122768376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1739982564]强装镇定的问道，舒茉肯定不是那个意思，别想歪了"}
{"time": 1761588526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "662956651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯哼?\"看向爸爸妈妈，\"多余的房间有吗...?\""}
{"time": 1761588568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063431812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你不知道吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761588584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "252127645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得这个问出来就挺变态的）"}
{"time": 1761588637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364551886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（还好吧，我诚心发问）"}
{"time": 1761588682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939870873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd2 有无"}
{"time": 1761588682, "type": "reply", "message_id": "939870873", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊芙]使用[有无]演奏出:[1D2=2]"}
{"time": 1761588718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645831385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "显然，没有。设计之初就没有这方面的考量，家里也找不出第三张床"}
{"time": 1761588806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1492325119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...好像没有多余的房间呢...”仔细想了一下，“抱歉啦，伊恩。”说完帮着把需要的东西搬到院子，“把东西搬出去串吧，晚风吹一吹感觉会头脑清醒一些。”"}
{"time": 1761588908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442886924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“如果舒茉真的想让我留下来的话.....”"}
{"time": 1761588917, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1745768690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我可以睡沙发上”"}
{"time": 1761588961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126596776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嘛...”抬头看看妈妈的意思"}
{"time": 1761589170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1125202870", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然我是不介意……但是伊恩现在有新房子的吧？”她有些无奈"}
{"time": 1761589235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "538763238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...确实也是呢...伊恩想回新家的话...”话停在这里。"}
{"time": 1761589320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "578234544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我是无所谓啦...”"}
{"time": 1761589362, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539278032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过...”在思考明天要不要去找些临时工做做“舒茉明天有什么安排吗”"}
{"time": 1761589426, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787054142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“好啦，我们先把串串好，办一场派对啦。”中断这个话题，接上话，“我的话...明天照旧吧...去镇上的图书室看看。”"}
{"time": 1761589741, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631833987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“伊恩打算去哪里找临时工？我其实挺闲的，可以跟着一起看看。”"}
{"time": 1761589763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2115590035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明天在村子里看看吧”"}
{"time": 1761589800, "type": "recv", "message_id": "420959709", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯。”"}
{"time": 1761589824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1866868591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "先搬东西吧"}
{"time": 1761589833, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1250583181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（什么时候拉壮丁）"}
{"time": 1761589852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442892225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你好想抓壮丁）"}
{"time": 1761589880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1856733387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（什么时候抓壮丁）"}
{"time": 1761590055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "715300645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "东西本就不多，折腾一番后，星与月也彻底占据了天空木炭燃起，薄灰色的、匹练般的烟雾升腾"}
{"time": 1761590203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337734557", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "挥挥手坐下，往火炉里添炭，点燃，“我能不能只负责吃啦？”看着身边的人，自己也许称得上幸福？"}
{"time": 1761590306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394389118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽然也很想帮忙烤，但是不知道怎么掌控火候，于是坐在舒茉的身旁...不过看看还有没有自己可以做的事情"}
{"time": 1761590320, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1364341501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要自己动手才会有乐趣的嘛，我是闲不下手。这种时候，是不是应该，要说些祝词？”舒蕾把串分到两个盘，在你们间和他们间各放一份"}
{"time": 1761590387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1313447849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“祝词？不太懂诶，妈妈先演示一下？”不过听话地拿起自己串好的鸡胗串放在烤架上，\"呼呼...\""}
{"time": 1761590773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638765083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（坏了，我也不会）"}
{"time": 1761590777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935298588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥会吗）"}
{"time": 1761590790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "734363", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“伊恩呢？嗯...”"}
{"time": 1761590864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162336941", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我来说祝词吗...”完全没有接触过的领域“.....抱歉，我也不怎么会”"}
{"time": 1761590894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1727332054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我只记得是要说什么，为了明天啦，或者，向未来祝福...”"}
{"time": 1761590959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1632675148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那种东西好宽泛嘛……”舒蕾摇摇头“在这个时候，按理应该会有感而发？还是说，因为手上少了些喝的？”"}
{"time": 1761591071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555246069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶...就是不太说得出来啦。”抬起头看向天空，“嗯...真要说的话，我要为了能够和家人们在一起吧。”低下头笑了笑，对着伊恩眨眨眼，“也要好好感谢关键时刻帮了我的雾大人呢。”"}
{"time": 1761591366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938945830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“伊恩呢？”说完之后缓了一会，其实有点不好意思。"}
{"time": 1761591370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179568573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "家人....不自觉的有些脸红，感觉舒茉的笑容十分的迷人...一定要守护好舒茉的笑容"}
{"time": 1761591428, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695826539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，我吗”思绪忽然被打断“那我就希望舒茉可以永远幸福吧....”"}
{"time": 1761591568, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088843824", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“诶...”听到的回答让自己有些脸红，.“好...”声音有点小，“嗯...谢谢...”捂着脸，露出眼睛看向父母，“爸爸...妈妈...呢？”"}
