{"time": 1761615580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690606019", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦哦，我知道在哪。还没喝完吗？\"从座位上蹭蹭站起来，\"伊恩在这坐一会吧？我去拿。\"话音未落一路小跑进了屋。"}
{"time": 1761615597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1195783012", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(因为氢太厉害了)"}
{"time": 1761615689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266592954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只剩最后一瓶了，明天得买新的咯”"}
{"time": 1761615732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105111665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1195783012]（）"}
{"time": 1761615764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415193481", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就重新坐下吧，等舒茉回来"}
{"time": 1761615855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "245731622", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "厨房的柜子里立着一瓶瓶口裹着锡箔纸的暗色玻璃瓶，看起来就是了，尚未开封"}
{"time": 1761616016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "203803282", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "拿出来，再找四个玻璃杯。深吸一口气，抱着这些东西回院子，\"妈，舒茉真的能喝酒吗？\"在桌子上摆好杯子，把苹果酒放在正中，\"不会还要重新说一遍祝词吧...\"鼓着脸颊。"}
{"time": 1761616317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123624383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这个没什么酒味，小孩子也可以喝的。”她拆开锡纸，拔下瓶塞“那当然……是看你有没有想说的？不过干杯肯定要重新说一遍啦”"}
{"time": 1761616417, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072601032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "近乎澄清的酒液带着微量气泡和浓郁的果香落入你们的杯中，闻起来带有些许酸涩"}
{"time": 1761616524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "916180931", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着自己的杯子，\"反正...敬明天，敬过去，敬自己，嘛...感谢奇迹?\"语速很快，一通讲讲，端起杯子，有些跃跃欲试。"}
{"time": 1761616876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "676702305", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥呢）"}
{"time": 1761616882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6160003", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不干杯吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761616883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215423133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "举起杯子“那敬明天？”"}
{"time": 1761616992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "343236959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎参考文献）"}
