{"time": 1761617926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705225289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（以及你怎么还不加冰）"}
{"time": 1761618050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "947977219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"差不多...差不多吧？\"捂着嘴，感觉喉咙里有些辣辣的，\"唔...这点怎么会喝饱，又不是喝水...我看伊恩才是晕了吧。\""}
