{"time": 1761619618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "548793794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不知道啊）"}
{"time": 1761619761, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072109683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=271026574]火光附近，雾气难以真正凝聚起来。不过周围确实多了些朦胧的质感\n“对了对了，你爸还不知道……孩她爸，咱家女儿出趟门，回来就会魔法咯”舒蕾靠在家主身上，咯咯笑着"}
{"time": 1761619880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "314204899", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯!舒茉现在也会一点简单的法术，不过只有凝聚一点点雾气这种程度啦...\"看向伊恩，\"不像伊恩...可以这么厉害...\""}
{"time": 1761620089, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742875917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉明明也很厉害啦...”"}
{"time": 1761620109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558311993", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（魔弹连射\n消耗20+5x，发射x枚飞弹（最多5），每颗造成x+1点固定伤害。cd3t\n推掌\n消耗20+5x，将敌人击退x格（最多4），造成3dx+3点伤害。撞上其他敌人时对副目标造成2dx+2点伤害。cd4t）"}
{"time": 1761620122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "159874842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（听起来终于要开始用地图了）"}
{"time": 1761620256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501837808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸手挑开周围的薄雾，\"舒茉要学的还有很多...不过，应该还有很久很久时间?\"看向伊恩的眼睛很亮，像是装着星星，\"对吧?\""}
{"time": 1761620361, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456627293", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=314204899]“嗯，嗯嗯……”他点着头，穿过雾气看着你“今天真是个好日子。舒茉要成为很闪亮的女孩了啊，和你妈妈当年一样”"}
{"time": 1761620379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1322878160", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...时间还很长呢”"}
{"time": 1761620668, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111517694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "等待吃饭"}
{"time": 1761620715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "590160763", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（自己动手.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761620739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128409123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...还是妈妈更好啦。\"一边说一边喝着苹果酒，\"我要是像妈妈一样，什么都会就好了。\"看看自己的鸡胗有没有烤好，往上面撒点调味料。"}
{"time": 1761620895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116872048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"伊恩，尝尝?\"把一开始就放上去的几串鸡胗拿下来，\"虽然是内脏，不过烤好了之后脆脆的，也没有腥味。\""}
{"time": 1761620907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "64889238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "鸡胗上刷的油脂轻轻冒泡，看起来倒是恰到好处"}
{"time": 1761620960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1480240847", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“...”有点想拒绝，但毕竟是舒茉的请求“那我尝一点点吧...”接过来一串 有点如临大敌"}
