{"time": 1761626166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "977783184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那么)"}
{"time": 1761626189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1517603438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也不是我动……吗？）"}
{"time": 1761626237, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533621338", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“这是吃迷糊了……舒茉，要不你先回房间休息？”舒蕾目光没离开过这边"}
{"time": 1761626365, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212168789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"看向母亲的目光有些迷离，\"只是有一点不舒服...还没散场...舒茉肯定要坐在这啦...\""}
{"time": 1761626449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860234530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了好了……不能轻松的话就不是派对了”"}
{"time": 1761626624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1976706578", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”揉揉自己的眉心，捂着肚子的手似乎触碰到了伤处，幻痛的感觉有些厉害，不由得倒吸了一口凉气，呲了呲牙，“伊恩呢...？”"}
{"time": 1761626764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903558344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我扶舒茉回去吧”"}
{"time": 1761626934, "type": "recv", "message_id": "623794474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然很想答应，但是...用还剩下的清醒等待母亲的话语"}
{"time": 1761626981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "626353217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（等咩）"}
{"time": 1761627034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1495050448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……”伊恩似乎看到舒蕾的眼底闪过些不悦，随后站起身来“我来我来，你再吃点吧”"}
{"time": 1761627063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "149598462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”又重新坐下来，乖乖吃饭"}
{"time": 1761627092, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494925930", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“明天见，舒茉”"}
{"time": 1761627181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "379347115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "侧头耷拉着眼皮看着伊恩，轻轻嗯了一身，转过身看向母亲的方向，呼出口气，感觉全是酒精的味道，对着母亲张开双手。"}
{"time": 1761627249, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225571831", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（才喝了几口（）"}
{"time": 1761627263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876877189", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（让我想到我有个朋友，喝鸡尾酒差点喝醉了）"}
{"time": 1761627276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "405298684", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（酒量不好的人喝啤酒都会醉）"}
{"time": 1761627282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "188143329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（彬彬？）"}
{"time": 1761627295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "475948951", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（有年我在朋友家招待一个河南人）"}
{"time": 1761627308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291326808", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（喝了一罐啤酒躺床上去了）"}
{"time": 1761627326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1294120118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（打电话给自己女朋友说我超勇超会喝，给我笑得不行）"}
{"time": 1761627498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1200461507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=379347115]她的胳膊环过你的腋下，随后发力把你整个抱了起来，一只手顺势托住你的臀部。明明没有比你高多少，抱得却轻轻松松"}
{"time": 1761627633, "type": "recv", "message_id": "581379983", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "可能这就是劳动人民的体力"}
{"time": 1761627682, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100450029", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那就再吃点吧"}
{"time": 1761627736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622449601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...”脑袋软绵绵地搭在她的肩膀上轻轻蹭，“妈~待会帮我看看...肚子...感觉有点疼。”语气软糯，全然放下了自己的顾忌和担忧，在母亲的怀里，唯余下温暖和心安。"}
{"time": 1761627915, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104750298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好，好……”她对你耳语着，走进了你的房间，把你慢慢放在床上"}
{"time": 1761627974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1481248509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=100450029]或许是舒茉没吃多少，你这边还剩了些。你突然想起来还有南瓜挞"}
{"time": 1761628080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558892231", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=104750298]几乎不自觉地闭上眼，卷起小腹上的衣服，\"胃里...不舒服...还疼...\""}
{"time": 1761628095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088583362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"emmm，结果舒茉一口没吃啊\""}
