{"time": 1761648803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "715611123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1261998049][CQ:at,qq=825734198] “好的，叔叔”虽然这么说，但也不能太放肆了"}
{"time": 1761648825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093695079", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过此刻又不知道该和舒茉父亲聊点什么"}
{"time": 1761649056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2024226406", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1140742370]\"肯定是肚子上的伤口的原因...\"听到妈妈这么说，撇了撇嘴，对她伸出手，\"抱...\""}
{"time": 1761649617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "719546467", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2024226406]“嗯，都怪伤口”她顺着你说，给你掖好被子，抱住你的脑袋“一会喝点茶汤吧，暖和点……然后尝尝南瓜馅饼？”"}
{"time": 1761649714, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481942386", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸手抱住她，\"唔...那，妈妈待会带进来...舒茉有点晕...\""}
{"time": 1761649716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "645623413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1093695079]他也不是会主动发起话题的类型，又陷入诡异的沉默，只有柴火的噼啪声"}
{"time": 1761650121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073608514", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=481942386]“嗯嗯……一会别睡太沉了”她轻轻拍着你，不过怎么想都像要往睡着了拍"}
{"time": 1761650258, "type": "recv", "message_id": "589549942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好...\"虽然想要保持住清醒的意识，不过怎么想都不可能，在酒精和母亲的安睡下很快就沉沉地睡了过去。"}
