{"time": 1761653390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78588362", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=875237789]“不用你……在沙发上休息就好了，你不知道要放去哪”舒蕾摆了摆手"}
{"time": 1761653494, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560770237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有一部分是自己搬出去的，为什么会不知道放哪...不过阿姨都这样说，也不好反驳，去拿书吧"}
{"time": 1761653713, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081515425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不去房间偷看?)"}
{"time": 1761653736, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1553041373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "书就在书架上，封皮是《家庭菜谱收录&amp;烹饪进阶》里头涵盖了从食材挑选处理到几乎可以开店的大部分烹饪技法"}
{"time": 1761653746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1163725000", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1081515425]（不想被打死）"}
{"time": 1761653754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2130013911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我挂机10分钟先，骑个车）"}
{"time": 1761654532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375440561", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "睡这里感觉还是有点怪怪的，拿起书找叔叔阿姨告别“晚上我还是回去吧，叔叔阿姨再见”"}
{"time": 1761654914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768834877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，行”家主点点头，舒蕾在往洗干净的架子上涂油防锈"}
{"time": 1761654987, "type": "recv", "message_id": "932078783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "灶台似乎又燃起了火，不知道在煮什么"}
{"time": 1761655055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656191435", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "抱着书回家了"}
{"time": 1761655121, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337248606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "暖光被你抛在后面，你步入昏暗的前半夜。被冷风一吹，残留的酒意惹得你打了个激灵"}
{"time": 1761655215, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1209281706", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把包放在身前试图抵挡冷风“看样子得换厚点的衣服了”"}
{"time": 1761655232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448920857", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "快步回去"}
