{"time": 1761656295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364021252", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那很没醉了）"}
{"time": 1761656566, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2140332719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "你感觉身上多少有点不清爽，沾着的气息确实有点多，睡得很浅。而半梦半醒之间，有人在轻轻呼唤你"}
{"time": 1761656685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "199768218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"迷迷糊糊睁开眼，\"嗯...妈?\""}
{"time": 1761657316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1559747425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉...舒茉没怎么醉啦...现在，感觉清醒得不行。\""}
{"time": 1761657357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114464927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（很忙）"}
{"time": 1761659405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064763163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=199768218]“可惜，是爸爸”他手里端着个冒着薄烟的碗。一种清甜的香气沁人心脾"}
{"time": 1761664926, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1311954725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1064763163]睁开眼，感觉喉咙有些干，\"唔...\"手臂撑着自己起身靠着床头，\"渴...\"看着父亲手里的茶碗，\"不过我没醉啦...妈妈做醒酒茶了吗？\""}
{"time": 1761664931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417023791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我回来了，翔哥。)"}
{"time": 1761666439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "634032820", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1311954725]“还是可惜，这是我唯一会炖的东西咯”他吹吹汤面，隐约有股红枣枸杞的味道"}
{"time": 1761667763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "318256114", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=634032820]“诶...”晚上确实没怎么吃东西，肚子有点饿，但是这个看上去好没味道...稍微迟疑了一下，“唔...”伸手打算接过碗，“爸爸能拿点辣子进来吗？”"}
{"time": 1761668022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1295564306", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
