{"time": 1761679737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096628281", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "听不清楚，不过隐约能听到你自己的名字"}
{"time": 1761679772, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1625434316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"爸爸妈妈怎么还在说我的事?不是说睡觉了吗？本来准备推门而入，想了想还是敲敲门"}
{"time": 1761679795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507662533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（休息了指躺下了.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761679827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547694825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "里头的声音停了一小会，随后舒蕾的声音响起“舒茉？怎么了？”"}
{"time": 1761679837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "47992083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还难受吗？”"}
{"time": 1761679919, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1069165472", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...想和妈妈一起...\"声音不大，有些抖，感觉是冻的。"}
{"time": 1761680053, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1705515471", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦……”你听见被子响动，随后门开，她牵着你往你房间去，手掌暖乎乎的“怎么了？这两天都……”"}
{"time": 1761680204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251634425", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1705515471]\"不和妈妈一起，睡不着...\"靠近一些她，\"爸爸妈妈刚刚在说什么?\"倒也没很感兴趣，但是既然提到自己那就随口问一问。"}
{"time": 1761680409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1842616556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊，听到了？那，正好问问你。既然舒茉有魔法的天赋……想不想多学一些？”"}
{"time": 1761680481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1633238119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"多学一些...?什么...\"有些不太懂，但是现在脚底板冰凉，跑到她身前要抱抱，\"冷...\""}
{"time": 1761680580, "type": "recv", "message_id": "929352942", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她很轻松地就把你拦腰抱起“魔法啦，虽然村里没有专门研究这个的”"}
{"time": 1761680673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999044183", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "靠在她怀里，\"这种也没有多学一些的办法吧...舒茉的话...虽然想多掌握一些...保护爸爸妈妈...\""}
{"time": 1761680794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "79503868", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有人领着的话，总会少走些弯路。我看舒茉不是挺喜欢自己的魔法的？”她推开门，和你一起躺在你的小床上"}
{"time": 1761680882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573380776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"缩在她的怀里，呼吸均匀，\"妈妈说这么多...是不是想把舒茉丢掉啦...\"咯咯笑，\"好啦...妈妈想让我去哪?\""}
{"time": 1761681009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911390770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么会？”她敲敲你的额头“一天到晚的，不知道想什么……去不去还两说，不过妈妈确实认识这方面的人”"}
{"time": 1761681070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768022564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...在哪?\"已经泛起了些困意，\"妈妈认识的人肯定不坏...\""}
{"time": 1761681275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "258674376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我会说）"}
{"time": 1761681279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "478987980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我没想好）"}
{"time": 1761681396, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1549954344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“在西海岸，舒茉在地图上见过吗？”"}
{"time": 1761681467, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179037927", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好远诶...\"此刻思维有些停滞，\"妈妈...要是想的话...舒茉...当然可以...\"沉浸在她的怀中，身上的温度逐渐回归正常，沉沉睡了过去。"}
{"time": 1761681483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380734697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(intp，出动。)"}
