{"time": 1761719980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604259248", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1761720022, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1710288372", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1849545882]当然还是有的，一碗浮着油花的汤放在台面上。把一旁的干面涮进去即可"}
{"time": 1761720095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205500115", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "仔细回忆昨天书中的内容，但俗话说纸上谈兵，油加的有点少，温度也不够高，鸡蛋直接粘在锅底，还糊了，最后成品只是一堆黑黄夹杂的块状物体...."}
{"time": 1761720157, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649360443", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "也不好意思端给舒茉，只能偷偷吃掉...好苦，好难吃"}
{"time": 1761720179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383943259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(刚想让你倒掉)"}
{"time": 1761720200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689482002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不过，俗话说，一回生二回熟，把锅擦干净，这次一定成功!"}
{"time": 1761720208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694699143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd-4"}
{"time": 1761720208, "type": "reply", "message_id": "694699143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊恩]演奏出: 1D20-4={15}-4=11"}
{"time": 1761720260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1648951062", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "功夫不负有心人，吸取之前的教训，总算煎出来一个看的过去的鸡蛋，放在盘子里，撒点盐 给舒茉端过去"}
{"time": 1761720267, "type": "recv", "message_id": "142259720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "端着自己的碗，倒也没想吃太多，取了一半面添进汤中，坐在客厅的桌子边。"}
{"time": 1761720289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1029396553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“快来尝尝看怎么样..”"}
{"time": 1761720462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1455312332", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"看上去倒是没什么问题，拿筷子夹起来泡在汤汁里，过一会低头小小咬一口"}
{"time": 1761720685, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954454076", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些期待的看着舒茉想要得到她的回应"}
{"time": 1761720834, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614821292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（啊煎完撒盐吗）"}
{"time": 1761720894, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561441379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"汤汁泡过之后倒是味道不错，\"嗯...伊恩真的是第一次做吗？很好吃。\""}
{"time": 1761720965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "9126479", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=614821292]（是啊，一点点）"}
{"time": 1761720978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "15756880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（不撒盐也行）"}
{"time": 1761721075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1002593788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“是吗，谢谢舒茉”抛开刚刚失败的那次不谈，这就是第一次了，好开心，自己的厨艺得到了他人的肯定，而且还是舒茉的...心里感觉甜甜的，比昨晚吃的南瓜派还甜"}
{"time": 1761721170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853541181", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "非要说，就是新人常见的问题——不敢生大火，不敢多放油。鸡蛋有些沾着，但还算完整"}
{"time": 1761721214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733431911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看一眼自己的房间，妈妈好像还没出来，小口吃着面，\"伊恩怎么突然对做饭感兴趣?唔唔...昨晚我没说什么奇怪的话吧？\"后半句压低了些声音"}
{"time": 1761721255, "type": "recv", "message_id": "196240516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我还真，没怎么在煎蛋的时候放过盐）"}
{"time": 1761721273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622217055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一般都是起锅加生抽）"}
{"time": 1761721317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1167579905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm,没有吧，舒茉不就说了自己没有醉之类的话么”"}
{"time": 1761721474, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304879764", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=733431911]她坐在床沿，这个点她总是有些困倦。不过还是抬起头来问了你一嘴“你们中午打算怎么安排？”"}
{"time": 1761721509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1420857796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1761721519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2109634989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1761721528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "526839880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来没进去？）"}
{"time": 1761721532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1176634710", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那就当我没说）"}
{"time": 1761721549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078251654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果进去了就是这个画面）"}
{"time": 1761721558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1168961965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"本来就没醉啦...\"反正嘴上咬死"}
{"time": 1761721636, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1714257440", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉还问我干嘛”看她的样子有些想笑"}
{"time": 1761721744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1876425841", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...嘛，想看看伊恩是不是记性不好，毕竟你想嘛...年纪越大记性越差。\"慢悠悠地小口吃面，\"伊恩说不定是活了几百上千岁的老东西了。\""}
{"time": 1761721801, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540097243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？我这样子怎么也不像几百上千次吧，而且要是我是老家伙，还只会这种程度的魔法，岂不是太丢脸了”"}
{"time": 1761721832, "type": "recv", "message_id": "479029909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（毕竟30岁就会火球术了？）"}
{"time": 1761722028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608877730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "咯咯笑，\"那可说不准。\"解决完最后剩下的一点，\"我去跟妈妈说一声。\"回自己的房间"}
{"time": 1761722110, "type": "recv", "message_id": "331506953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=304879764]（）"}
{"time": 1761722301, "type": "recv", "message_id": "431027653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"应该不回来吃饭?\"走上前弯腰抱抱她，\"妈妈再睡一会吧。\""}
{"time": 1761722451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "126037219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……到时候临时打算回来也没饭吃了喔”她打个哈欠“我去……回个笼”说完她就打算回自己房间去"}
{"time": 1761722595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074906681", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，跟在她身后出房门，等母亲进了房间，再开口，\"伊恩，走吧。\""}
{"time": 1761722771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1615319542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，走吧”"}
{"time": 1761722802, "type": "recv", "message_id": "181326826", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"今天有好好穿上厚衣服吗？\"搓了搓手心，推开家门"}
{"time": 1761722820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638362598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在熟悉的路上往图书室走去"}
{"time": 1761722840, "type": "recv", "message_id": "954260405", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“话说舒茉去图书馆是要去看什么书”"}
{"time": 1761722944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "4051732", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我也想问）"}
{"time": 1761722950, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051893213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且bydQQ又自动更新）"}
{"time": 1761722963, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699753547", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（ui又丑了一点）"}
{"time": 1761722992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1661388609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(是这样的，不过我已经看习惯了)"}
{"time": 1761723045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751855217", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说出来不会笑我吧？\""}
{"time": 1761723067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1926784992", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我只是想找些新出的小说或者还没看过的...\""}
{"time": 1761723145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "690541801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这有什么好笑的...我也挺喜欢看那种的”"}
{"time": 1761723273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260622436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"配上一杯牛奶或者可可就能坐一天。\"伸展伸展四肢，\"尤其是冬天点火炉的时候。\""}
{"time": 1761723450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "889401146", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过不知道图书馆会不会有一些很厉害的书，比如讲魔法之类的”"}
