{"time": 1761764444, "type": "reply", "message_id": "110384893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[莉维娅]演奏出: 1D20-3={6}-3=3"}
{"time": 1761764715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791169890", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "餐厅自然是谈天说地的场所，在哪都不例外。伊恩听到一些让人在意的消息\n“听说了吗，今年天气冷的这么早是有原因的，不是气候问题”\n“哦，好像是有这么回事。听说，和森林里的魔物有关？哎，我也只是猜的……但是这两天几乎天天有运兵车从我们这边中转”"}
{"time": 1761764739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1817982473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(原来是那个女人)"}
{"time": 1761764788, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790649792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉听见了吗，今年这么冷好像是因为魔物哎”和舒茉分享听来的情报"}
{"time": 1761764896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "520639952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...希望不会波及到我们这里...\"对这种遥远的事情不太关心，总有人会去处理的。"}
{"time": 1761764918, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1147984524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯..希望如此吧”"}
{"time": 1761764952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907402855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看着炖着自己点的菜的小锅，捧着脸颊一脸期待。"}
{"time": 1761764983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "780649133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过能够影响天气的魔物...想想就感觉有点恐怖，那得有多厉害啊”"}
{"time": 1761765174, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973104577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"稍微思考了一下，最后摇摇头，\"想不出来，我也不想见到。\""}
{"time": 1761765208, "type": "recv", "message_id": "610570364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“听说有条件的，已经陆续有暂时搬走的了”\n“想那么多有的没的，咱们就这一亩三分地……”\n他们的声音小了下去，而沸腾的咕嘟声大了起来。单调却百吃不厌的经典搭配揭开了锅"}
{"time": 1761765225, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63436426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...希望离得越远越好，不过为什么有种立flag的感觉”"}
{"time": 1761765266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "694051162", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "底层有些恰到好处的焦糊，肉香更进一步地激发出来"}
{"time": 1761765274, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604738869", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“啊？舒茉，他们说好多人因为这件事都搬走了，不会真的会出什么事吧”有点不安"}
{"time": 1761765463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139923505", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"如果到这种地方，要不要让爸妈也搬走呢...\"啊，开锅了，好香好香。"}
{"time": 1761765500, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050794259", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“确实啊...不管来多少次，都感觉好香”"}
{"time": 1761765705, "type": "recv", "message_id": "558232089", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"先吃饭吧，待会回去我问问妈妈，她肯定比我们清楚...估计早就想好了。\"动起筷子"}
{"time": 1761765730, "type": "recv", "message_id": "885734634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“也是”"}
{"time": 1761765748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1742414722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（有筷子吗（忽然好奇）"}
{"time": 1761765798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283771946", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "用勺子舀一下汤汁倒在米饭上，然后美美吃一口“好好吃”"}
{"time": 1761765807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1239378285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有的吧）"}
{"time": 1761765969, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580365581", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后就专心美美吃饭"}
{"time": 1761765985, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118047881", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "美美吃上午餐，不过总是有些想知道家里的意思，昨晚还说了那种话...吃了八分饱，\"伊恩，我吃好了。\""}
{"time": 1761766012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1809729828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "共计27银"}
{"time": 1761766015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556868022", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那种话是什么，oh去学魔法是吧）"}
{"time": 1761766043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "232691035", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "擦擦嘴“嗯，我也饱了，感觉就算天天吃也吃不腻啊”"}
{"time": 1761766054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1973510118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“下来怎么说”"}
{"time": 1761766133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1548310289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉打算回家，这个事情...嗯...要问问妈妈。\""}
{"time": 1761766150, "type": "recv", "message_id": "560495854", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "结好账，等伊恩说话"}
{"time": 1761766179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1398266903", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊，那我就不跟着舒茉了，下午我想去做会临时工”"}
{"time": 1761766408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "775450793", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"点点头，\"晚上会来找我吗？\""}
{"time": 1761766583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1682821742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(回去小猫咪找妈妈了)"}
{"time": 1761766597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1080175438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“吃完饭我去找你吧”"}
{"time": 1761766740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "782326858", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，回家看看妈妈在不在。"}
{"time": 1761766764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1868929540", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去平常常去的店打工了.jpg"}
{"time": 1761766771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "730623041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我这边就跳过吧）"}
{"time": 1761766825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078690699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我倒是确实想知道你平时打什么工）"}
{"time": 1761766827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045053153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是该睡觉了）"}
{"time": 1761766842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "228925803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我没意见，明天早点起。)"}
{"time": 1761766865, "type": "recv", "message_id": "697636772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1078690699]（图书馆整理（）"}
