{"time": 1761786733, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265286926", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "当然还在，正在后院收衣服"}
{"time": 1761786758, "type": "recv", "message_id": "212375628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1868929540]（那我觉得可能是bakery）"}
{"time": 1761786952, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1911984768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "急匆匆地小跑过去，但是由于刚吃完饭，肚子里有些上上下下，好在没吃太多，\"妈...\"停下脚步的时候一只手捂着肚子，\"你听说最近的传闻了吗？\""}
{"time": 1761787068, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1525420564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“传闻？”她停下手里的动作“传闻天天有，舒茉说哪个？”"}
{"time": 1761787175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1456952277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"就是，就是，今年这么冷...有好厉害好厉害的魔物在靠近这里...\"帮着收衣服，\"好多人都跑了...\""}
{"time": 1761787490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1033924272", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“魔物……”她喃喃着“这么一说的话，好像有点印象……雷恩昨天说是要去走亲戚，结果全家带着大包小包走了，我还以为是什么……”"}
{"time": 1761787635, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790989351", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈...我们要不要也走...\"停下手看着她，\"万一真的来了...\""}
{"time": 1761787835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "323279655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“走……”她考虑了一番“也可以。往西边去？我和你爸在这边，倒算是无牵无挂”"}
{"time": 1761788095, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1201143445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...\"使劲点头，\"要是真的有那种东西，还是先走吧...\"抓着她的手臂摇摇，\"不知道为什么，舒茉总觉得不太安心。\""}
{"time": 1761788256, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531370399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那等他……嘛，要不现在出发，直接去店里找他？要走的话，还得收拾东西……哦，还得挤车……”舒蕾盘算着“不知道会不会很多人”"}
{"time": 1761788441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "187096810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"现在收拾吧，我去跟爸爸说。\"停了一下，\"嗯...东西也不用全部带走?我马上回来。\"看见妈妈点了头，连忙跑着去找父亲。"}
{"time": 1761788864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749285", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行。记得去驿站看看最近的车次安排”她的声音追过来\n父亲的店离得并不算远，选址的时候就考虑到了从木材厂搬运原料的需求。门口总是挂着一串木头雕成的花瓣"}
{"time": 1761788907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359293601", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他平时就坐在前台，一边忙着手上的工艺一边等客人来访"}
{"time": 1761788974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857125173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "看看店里有没有客人，没有就走进店门，\"爸!\""}
{"time": 1761788996, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260965616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎有一说一哦）"}
{"time": 1761789001, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766874225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们要搬家了，妈妈让我们现在收拾收拾。\""}
{"time": 1761789017, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792569949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 如果你平时有常打工的店，为什么你不是和那家的孩子关系好）"}
