{"time": 1761790602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106183436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=972527354]（我会说你那边当然也会有）"}
{"time": 1761790724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "63563560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "前往店里的路上，你发现商道上停着三辆印着区级行政区标志的金属支架马车。陆续有大兵裹挟着一脸不情愿的居民上了车……大多数男性"}
{"time": 1761790753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128189894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶.....这是在做什么”"}
{"time": 1761790779, "type": "recv", "message_id": "163232365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有种非常非常非常非常不妙的感觉"}
{"time": 1761790876, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1432828749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=499811283]“……真不是时候”父亲把你护在身后，不过士兵没什么介入的意愿，但显然你也没有让他们离开的面子"}
{"time": 1761791036, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1106344027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "此刻也不知道自己能做什么，安安静静地躲在父亲身后。"}
{"time": 1761791104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "243021884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=163232365]不管了，先去打工再说"}
{"time": 1761791181, "type": "recv", "message_id": "669904886", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“先生，大家都一样。我们没法特别为谁网开一面。”看起来为首的那个瞥了你一眼“就当是为了孩子们”"}
{"time": 1761791308, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035141849", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "心中升腾起不安，抬手抓着父亲的衣袖。"}
{"time": 1761791351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842539889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=243021884]那么显然，你平时打工的店面也是相近的处境。两个军装男人对女店主出示着公告"}
{"time": 1761791519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281296876", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到征兵感觉非常不安，话说自己这种会被直接拉走吗"}
{"time": 1761791592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "83532609", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1035141849]“我这样手无缚鸡之力的人，能做什么呢？”他叹气“钱……可以付钱么？一定比我本人更能派上用场”"}
{"time": 1761791609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1731956164", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=281296876]无人在意你，暂时"}
{"time": 1761791700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1157618123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=83532609]深知自己这种时候不能插话，躲在父亲身后，降低存在感。"}
{"time": 1761791709, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533405249", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=83532609] “每个人都这么想的话，前线就会和竹篓一样。”士兵最后解释一遍“况且这是有偿的，没人要你们的钱”"}
{"time": 1761791735, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1160204715", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1731956164]看起来，是以建筑物为单位排查的"}
{"time": 1761791874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "52773379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "舒茉会怎么样...去她家里找她，害怕她出什么事情"}
{"time": 1761791910, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143213727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=533405249]“……哎”他又叹了口气，拍了拍你的肩膀“……舒茉，回去找你妈妈吧。”"}
{"time": 1761791989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528034789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"爸爸...?\"抓着他不松手，小声\"我们都准备...走了...\"声音压得更低，\"你不能去前线...\""}
{"time": 1761792169, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695050682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=528034789]“有她就够了。”他摸摸你的脑袋“……又能怎么办呢？”"}
{"time": 1761792299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1045870920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...舒茉去...\"下定决心，\"爸爸和妈妈都不能，去危险的地方...\""}
{"time": 1761792309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088974313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=52773379]就当你到了.jpg"}
{"time": 1761792321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1251140917", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至少，看起来还没征到居民区来"}
{"time": 1761792369, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1445105475", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "敲敲门"}
