{"time": 1761792516, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502325559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1445105475]舒茉给你开了门“哦，伊恩？”她没跟你客套再多，而是很快折返回房间，看起来有事在忙"}
