{"time": 1761792810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1131985559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“征……怎么这么快”她折返的动作僵住了“见鬼……她这时候在她爸店里”"}
