{"time": 1761792900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537685648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这魔法，是为了保护家人。)"}
{"time": 1761792900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1722342474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "往舒茉所在的地方跑"}
{"time": 1761793145, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037067619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=466997407]“你？”士兵稍微正眼看了你一眼“你多大了？拿得动矛，还是搬得动拒马？”"}
{"time": 1761793287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979543823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"抿着唇，\"我...舒茉会魔法...\"声音很低"}
{"time": 1761793331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1256807580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1722342474]你在街上奔跑起来，经过曾经路过过上千遍的街道。那间古典、时常飘着茶香的木匠小屋近在咫尺"}
{"time": 1761793658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605839998", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=979543823]“魔法，你？”卫兵本没有什么兴趣，但……父亲忙不迭捂住你的嘴巴“没有的事……她胡说的”"}
{"time": 1761793667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499634724", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "气喘吁吁的跑进去"}
{"time": 1761793860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1655528719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"被捂住嘴，只能发出唔唔的声音，想要说什么但又感觉浑身无力，也许自己本来也..."}
{"time": 1761793863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2133314096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "一进去就听见再说什么魔法之类的事情..."}
{"time": 1761793874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481620753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1605839998]“魔法，展示给我们看看吧”卫兵看到他这般反应，反倒把目光聚焦在你身上"}
{"time": 1761794002, "type": "recv", "message_id": "639407697", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "舒茉被抓走这种事，绝对不能接受“别带走我妹妹...”挡在舒茉面前“一家不是只用征一个人么，带走我就好了”"}
{"time": 1761794143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1436033830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"伊恩...他怎么来这了？震惊，紧接着升腾起不行...绝对不行的心情，抬起手，手心翻腾出雾气...眼睛看向卫兵"}
{"time": 1761794191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1282022802", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你是？”卫兵的注意被突然闯入的伊恩短暂吸引"}
{"time": 1761794253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "312940800", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把她的手压下去“我是她哥哥,这是我爸爸”指着伊恩的父亲，虽然在说谎，但脸不红心不跳"}
{"time": 1761794263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461806816", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“比起他们来说，我去更合适吧”"}
{"time": 1761794278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1073119032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把她的手压下去“我是她哥哥,这是我爸爸”指着舒茉的父亲，虽然在说谎，但脸不红心不跳"}
{"time": 1761794283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "860049317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“比起他们来说，我去更合适吧”"}
{"time": 1761794316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "123180383", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且....”伸出手，在手中凝聚元素"}
{"time": 1761794499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1116238178", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不错”卫兵颇感兴趣地点点头“你自愿的话，倒是省功夫了”"}
{"time": 1761794522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589126889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不是...\"想要说出不是的话但是嘴被死死捂住，抬头看向父亲，爸爸快说点什么，明明不是的...手也被压住，这样下去的话...焦急感蔓延全身，好难受"}
{"time": 1761794665, "type": "recv", "message_id": "265320118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“现在就出发吗....”"}
{"time": 1761794831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998896071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1589126889]他在犹豫，你能感觉到他的手在颤抖。他的脖颈上血管凸起，另一只手抬起到一半"}
{"time": 1761794935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1708533080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“需要签什么吗，可以让我和家里人在告个别吗...”"}
{"time": 1761794974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860526279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"既然手被伊恩压着，那自然...反手用力狠狠捏着他的手掌，尝试在心中呼唤雾气"}
{"time": 1761795111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "61944698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1860526279]（要干嘛）"}
{"time": 1761795148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "965545434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(想逃跑)"}
{"time": 1761795177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "844716046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“别闹”小声对舒茉说到"}
{"time": 1761795319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904384627", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1708533080]“这里，签你的名字”他在纸上空白处点了点\n“不……”父亲的手终于抬到伊恩身前，像只老母鸡。他的话说到一半，却被门外的女生突然打断\n“轮得到你们吗？净添乱……”"}
{"time": 1761795410, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1396647516", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"瞪大眼睛，抬起头看向门外"}
{"time": 1761795529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "961161027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看向声音的来源，不会是舒蕾阿姨吧"}
{"time": 1761795542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1833219990", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来是女声）"}
{"time": 1761795547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2118585786", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（无所谓，不重要）"}
{"time": 1761795826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "310947788", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾额头上绑了根白色的扎带，右手手指挂着一对挂在一起的、手套般的物件，随意地搭在右肩，看起来比手套多了些硬质物件。她皱着眉，从外往内看着屋里这帮人，居然有种居高临下的感觉"}
{"time": 1761795914, "type": "recv", "message_id": "862869110", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈...\"挣开父亲，跑到她身边，语气有些抖\"妈?\""}
{"time": 1761796079, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608301197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“干嘛，没到认不出来的地步吧”她点点你的额头“你们三个文职在这里抢来抢去是要干什么？”"}
{"time": 1761796090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2012530665", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“妈...”做戏做全套，跟着喊一声"}
{"time": 1761796229, "type": "recv", "message_id": "260069473", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不行...\"伸手挡在她面前，面朝她，\"妈妈绝对不行，妈妈去的话..我也去..\""}
{"time": 1761796314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25209359", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她给你们翻了个白眼“干嘛，看不起我？去跟你爸打听打听我以前是干什么的”"}
{"time": 1761796477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "559821485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不是看不起妈妈...\"小声，想了想直接抱住她，\"舒茉...不和妈妈在一起...不行的...\""}
{"time": 1761796671, "type": "recv", "message_id": "790690404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不要争了...我去就好了”准备在纸上签名"}
{"time": 1761796808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "655221654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好了好了，签字就行？”她蛮不讲理地把你们轻松拎起来放到身侧，来到台前“想去的先打过我再说”"}
{"time": 1761796965, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1051909772", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "早知道会这样，当时就应该...但是依然坚持自己的话，\"妈妈去的话，舒茉也要去。\""}
{"time": 1761797029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "749208108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我去不就很皆大欢喜了么.....”"}
{"time": 1761797061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393723968", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1051909772]“是不是傻？”她找卫兵接过了笔“我去就是为了你们不去。而且你在爸爸面前说这个好伤人的诶”"}
{"time": 1761797271, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1933217275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有亚运会金牌能不能免除兵役（）"}
{"time": 1761797280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752448880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可以)"}
{"time": 1761797280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1119445373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1761797309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225563485", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(拼命打亚运会金牌，只为免除韩国兵役)"}
{"time": 1761797318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017434096", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(重生之我是ruler)"}
{"time": 1761797437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1888226536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可惜只有联赛冠军）"}
{"time": 1761797475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1823553880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"一时不知道该怎么说，\"都不去不就好了...\"心里的雾气翻腾起来，掌心笼罩着薄雾，隐隐约约把目标锁定到几个卫兵身上"}
{"time": 1761797551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288340437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（能过侦查不能）"}
{"time": 1761797565, "type": "recv", "message_id": "217211648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（看舒茉的动作）"}
{"time": 1761797672, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1161352653", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么，你们要进战斗轮？）"}
{"time": 1761797684, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127942985", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我要拦她啊）"}
{"time": 1761797740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1832835780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你能过的话卫兵也能）"}
{"time": 1761797884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1567121887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不能过的话我就动手了)"}
{"time": 1761797955, "type": "recv", "message_id": "164500678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（行为导向）"}
