{"time": 1761810242, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695656224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“叔叔阿姨，你们带着舒茉离开吧...希望我们还能再见面”"}
{"time": 1761810439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "537958549", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拿过那张征兵状"}
{"time": 1761810598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "171116129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“做点什么也轮不到你”舒蕾把舒茉接到怀里，探个脑袋出门左顾右盼“你那点魔法根本不够看的，海选都进不去的水平吧。”"}
{"time": 1761810690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1466618539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“还有好多没有魔法的人都去了.....”"}
{"time": 1761810778, "type": "recv", "message_id": "497417520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且，就算我这里不签，他们迟早还是会找上我的，不如我正好帮你们顶一下....这样什么事都没有了”"}
{"time": 1761810961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "910891017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（搬家没道理带上我的，到时候还是会被征）"}
{"time": 1761810981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "329867463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我会跟你说有道理）"}
{"time": 1761811000, "type": "recv", "message_id": "705489296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且你没成年，怎么征你）"}
