{"time": 1761811058, "type": "recv", "message_id": "41748779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=7D191123216E9DABB1AACF49C4BDF12E.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRzdz0kp5wcrwSbLWOEi7S7Vph9KBjJjAEg_woot8_t0bnLkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQ5QL-AnusbljdjHi_LzJ-lHoCJI-CAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAQSMLaIX-Ez5isrDT01jdgfAL0VNTqzt-LZ5VIgWCynjvM21ihDkwysfksVuba41MC5xA,file_size=17993]"}
{"time": 1761811172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1629437743", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1466618539]（你现在肯定打不过同等级战士的）"}
{"time": 1761811406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81593407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=497417520]“说过了，轮不到你来。”舒蕾扛起舒茉，随手就把征兵令又扯了回去“而且，你刚刚都叫我妈了”"}
{"time": 1761811437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1298792777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这....”"}
{"time": 1761811618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1850351718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“刚刚我不是想的是...骗那个士兵我们是一家人么...”没什么底气"}
{"time": 1761812224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664215365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(这要是你们再去，那不是白努力了。)"}
{"time": 1761812282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1628469643", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然不知道发生了什么。但是先试试能不能瞒天过海吧”舒蕾抿了抿嘴"}
{"time": 1761812451, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1807897753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好...好吧”"}
{"time": 1761812544, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2146102058", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“病人应该有豁免权……不，一般也没人会把舒茉这样的拉去前线……”她有点犹豫“但是不能不管”"}
{"time": 1761812721, "type": "recv", "message_id": "892734418", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不是立刻步行出境?)"}
{"time": 1761812750, "type": "recv", "message_id": "104625376", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你晕成这个样子）"}
{"time": 1761812757, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498950135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（敢赌吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761812786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "413787631", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以现在怎么做...”"}
{"time": 1761812837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "921412907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉，但是晕之前都说快走了)"}
{"time": 1761812861, "type": "recv", "message_id": "147763477", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那其实留在店里等到排查结束不就好了)"}
{"time": 1761812880, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1582649608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又不是只有那三个人）"}
{"time": 1761812972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "25595570", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(可惜，那其实还是赶紧跑为上)"}
{"time": 1761813197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1148081078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“虽然有点对不起她们……去一趟医院吧，我们。汉斯，我在家已经收好了东西……”"}
{"time": 1761813276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78469794", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“算了，也还是我去吧。你在这先躲会”"}
{"time": 1761813296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "122138907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我和阿姨一起去吧”"}
{"time": 1761813380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1818336780", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，起码我们三个走在街上也不至于被拦下来”她把头带解下来，没戴上过的臂铠扔给你“走吧”"}
{"time": 1761813561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2288629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”把她拿着那些东西，然后跟着她一起去医院"}
{"time": 1761813561, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1681418455", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "说罢，她背起舒茉。临走前回头看了一眼汉斯“……如果我回来没看到你，我就去前线找你”"}
{"time": 1761813747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205786413", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1148081078]（怎么不问为什么对不起（））"}
{"time": 1761813864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1758268690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呃，耽误了她们的逃跑进度？）"}
{"time": 1761813898, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423713879", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "汉斯点点头，转身上了阁楼。你们三人走在街上，虽然不至于和世界末日一样，但每家少一个人，对这村庄的安定依旧是不小的冲击"}
{"time": 1761813911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "724568678", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "尽管如此，也没见到几个暴力抗征的"}
{"time": 1761813943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1683517911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1758268690]（因为这是家园保卫战，但是最能打的人之一要当逃兵）"}
{"time": 1761814067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1522512593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "总之，很快就到了医院了"}
{"time": 1761814177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2043611140", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1683517911]（好的）"}
{"time": 1761814202, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080493095", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=724568678]（感觉我走怎么都怪怪的）"}
{"time": 1761814228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2050286677", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为还是本地人居多吧）"}
{"time": 1761814253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800664806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（乡土情节很多的）"}
{"time": 1761814263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499178132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且要走也得有途径啊）"}
{"time": 1761814282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614092101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（本地人帮了我那么多，我直接跑好不善良）"}
{"time": 1761814331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1339976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1522512593]医院里现在仅有牧师一人坐诊。医生暂时不知去向"}
{"time": 1761814346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1678458813", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“牧师姐姐，舒茉晕了，你帮她看看吧”"}
{"time": 1761814434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "939552619", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“啊……哦好”她看起来有点心事，被你叫了才猛回过神“好的，把她放下来吧……”"}
{"time": 1761814538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "970618687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾照做，牧师随后把手搭在舒茉的额头上“诶……有魔力？好像是她自己的……不过好少，不应该……”"}
{"time": 1761814630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1615505683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她把另一只手搭在经卷上，金光顺着她的手臂传输到舒茉身上，柔和地包裹住舒茉的体表"}
{"time": 1761814712, "type": "recv", "message_id": "516344587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "淡淡的魔力波动扩散开，伊恩也能感受到，舒茉的魔力正在快速得到补充"}
{"time": 1761814746, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1074035209", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“牧师姐姐.. 舒茉的情况怎么样...”"}
{"time": 1761814853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909117459", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“空乏……但是不止于此”她有些迟疑“她的魔力耗尽了，会比较虚弱，但是补充完也没有完全好转”"}
{"time": 1761814984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178256056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“怎么会这样.....”"}
{"time": 1761815065, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1895840375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我也不知道”她摇头“姐姐在的话，也许能看出来。不过，要我说的话……和精神力有关……吧，不过应该不是很严重”"}
{"time": 1761815182, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010941242", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到不是很严重总算松了一口气“那牧师姐姐的姐姐现在在哪”"}
