{"time": 1761822116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1394875576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1363343402]“嗯，我这边准备得差不多了”她轻声说着，轻轻抱住舒茉“你那边呢？”"}
{"time": 1761822359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907403674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"直接走就好了...\"但是自己也没什么指责的立场，毕竟事情本身就是自己挑起来的...\"我没事...多亏了牧师姐姐。\""}
{"time": 1761822375, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53352394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实问的是伊恩）"}
