{"time": 1761824210, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871624779", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你一个人怎么走呢我问你）"}
{"time": 1761824260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1579981799", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且一个人为什么要走，我看你也不是很怕死）"}
{"time": 1761824285, "type": "recv", "message_id": "510463692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=871624779]（舒茉不是要走么）"}
{"time": 1761824295, "type": "recv", "message_id": "143359153", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我线程已经被卡死了）"}
{"time": 1761824300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "383089155", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（后面的话都听不见）"}
{"time": 1761824309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1478201006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你是鼓掌机器人？）"}
{"time": 1761824389, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515640606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（是的）"}
{"time": 1761824418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2033536888", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现在人家要留下）"}
{"time": 1761824422, "type": "recv", "message_id": "291028437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你还走？）"}
{"time": 1761824567, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1894155600", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（没听到，得舒茉来打断我的思考了）"}
{"time": 1761824587, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1542734041", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在等着妈妈的看法)"}
{"time": 1761824616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "115597420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=97491834]“……哎，那就走”舒蕾最终下定决心“我们离开，往西边去”"}
{"time": 1761824754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "682502055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"虽然有些亏欠这片生活了许久的土地，但是，\"私心...舒茉不后悔...\"扭头看向伊恩，\"伊恩?\"轻声唤他，\"决定好了么？\""}
{"time": 1761825009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043631564", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "咬咬牙握紧拳头...“对不起，我果然..还是想留下来..舒茉准备去哪,等这边的事情结束了，我就去找你...”"}
{"time": 1761825189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1005567361", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道，得看情况吧。理想一点，会去西海岸”舒蕾看着你，似乎也在纠结什么"}
{"time": 1761825245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1867899028", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我不知道...伊恩..”偏过头闭上眼，“不用那么执着的...之后果然还是忘了舒茉吧...”小声喃喃，“其实舒茉果然是自私的孩子...”停了下来，等着母亲发话。"}
{"time": 1761825330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "432582024", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不发话）"}
{"time": 1761825427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498089044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....我不会也不可能忘记舒茉的...等这边的事结束,如果我还活着的话，我一定会去找舒茉的...不管舒茉在哪里”"}
{"time": 1761825514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1441519156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“等到那时候...说不定我也已经可以独当一面了...”"}
{"time": 1761825518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2113342835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...”不知道该如何作答，靠在母亲怀里，身体微微有点颤，咬着嘴唇，一声不吭，自己已经没有立场再说什么了。"}
{"time": 1761825850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267086197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但...假如...假如这边的事情已经平定了好久，我改没有去找舒茉的话...舒茉就忘了我吧”"}
{"time": 1761825974, "type": "recv", "message_id": "925581571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不回话，只是吸了吸鼻子，眯着眼睛努力噙着快要掉下来的眼泪，眼眶周围倒是红了一小圈，脑袋更偏向母亲一侧，这种时候，绝对不能露出脆弱的一面。"}
{"time": 1761826184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1307001940", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "行过通向舒茉家的最后一段路——没人知道这是不是最后一次。舒蕾悠悠地叹了口气“哎，又是何必呢？”"}
{"time": 1761826448, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1536378712", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你，你可有何话说？）"}
{"time": 1761826464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640833748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（你，你可有何话说？）"}
{"time": 1761826478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "5027072", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "再无话说...."}
{"time": 1761826482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "804902672", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=D0913CB1797B4D1303E18A95DD11066D.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhS3CbENzlh3ulqPOLAfJBpyovI9vBiD4wUg_woozYrZjPPLkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQmyg5-KqrXN0aqpYE7WYcCXoCOhGCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAESMLq6dnsE6b8ucz0s83S8PK7L_b4f7bKe0T2byM4dy8MKxN0bOugVXPOVpM9zF_JFJQ,file_size=94595]"}
{"time": 1761826502, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987918702", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(你不能没话说，哭都哭了)"}
{"time": 1761826655, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573595867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1307001940]“你离开，或者只是在村里等着。没有人会说你什么”"}
{"time": 1761826805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074634404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我心里过不了那道坎....”声音已经有些哽咽了“再见了阿姨...我就先走了吧”拍拍舒茉的肩膀“还有舒茉，我一定会去找你的....只要我还有一口气在....”迅速转身准备离开，害怕再多说一句，眼泪就会落下，害怕自己的心意会忍不住改变，也害怕影响舒茉的决定"}
{"time": 1761827050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153940167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd+8+4"}
{"time": 1761827050, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1153940167", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊芙]演奏出: d+8+4={5}+8+4=17"}
{"time": 1761827061, "type": "recv", "message_id": "647357911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（骗你的，自动成功）"}
{"time": 1761827069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "800126046", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（这是什么东西）"}
{"time": 1761827228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1608647313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"眼泪流下些许，但是没说拒绝的话"}
{"time": 1761827272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1811692584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾的左手闪电般抬起，在伊恩转过来的后颈上一捏一扭。你只听见一阵风声，随后脖子一疼，随后麻感遍布全身，晕了过去\n“哎呀，职业病职业病。看到没防备的脖子就忍不住折一下嘛”她随手接住昏迷的伊恩"}
{"time": 1761827617, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2088032387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"捂住嘴，不由得惊呼出声，\"妈?\""}
{"time": 1761827666, "type": "recv", "message_id": "499894399", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哎，真是……怎么是我来做这个”她摇摇头，一边把他拖进门一边对你说“想让他走，怎么自己不动手？”"}
{"time": 1761828050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "668516633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"抓着母亲的肩膀，不知道该说什么，眼眶还是红着的，\"对不起...妈妈...\""}
{"time": 1761828071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1461151546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能是打不过）"}
{"time": 1761828138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "401387962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（可能是打不过）"}
{"time": 1761828151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1601073722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（并非打不过，我菜的离谱）"}
{"time": 1761828185, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1281549725", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……老实说，我也不知道这么做对不对”舒蕾把收拾好的东西归拢好，看起来在思考要不要把伊恩塞进行李箱里“但是看不下去你们两个那副样子。也许该道歉的是我”"}
{"time": 1761828310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1921610553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...果然还是我的错...如果不是舒茉任性...\""}
{"time": 1761828331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "353101120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是...那个时候，情绪...控制不住。\"擦着眼睛"}
{"time": 1761828439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1336329309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1601073722]（她现在lv1）"}
{"time": 1761828443, "type": "recv", "message_id": "71075225", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（真打不过吗）"}
{"time": 1761828456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1237581723", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1761828475, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909551336", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=353101120]“好了，不说这些，还是想想怎么走吧”"}
{"time": 1761828691, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1694901783", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我不清楚...妈妈有什么想法吗？现在似乎只能步行...\""}
{"time": 1761828749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1999656698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我也不知道）"}
{"time": 1761828755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "65052134", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你可以发挥一下你的主观能动性）"}
