{"time": 1761846090, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1221886840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（现在应该坐不了马车？不知道舒茉家有没有养马（）"}
{"time": 1761846908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570315185", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还没想好吗（）"}
