{"time": 1761847436, "type": "recv", "message_id": "853653002", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"仔细思考一切可行性，伊恩晕过去的现在，没有代步工具肯定不行...但是...去哪里能拿到代步工具?"}
{"time": 1761847571, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1968086963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（扛着（））"}
{"time": 1761847573, "type": "recv", "message_id": "596371145", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "思考不清楚，\"妈妈...哪里能拿到马?\""}
{"time": 1761847586, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1874529492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1968086963]（还有行李呢）"}
{"time": 1761847875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812746442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没有载具肯定是不行的...\""}
{"time": 1761847998, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911188027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在肯定还是有正常交通的……但是多半会有例行检查”"}
{"time": 1761848007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1869808821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“如果能藏起来，或者找到合适的借口……”"}
{"time": 1761848167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780298923", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那样的话会很麻烦吧...\"摇摇头，\"我们能步行离开吗？"}
{"time": 1761848984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1335298757", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1761849127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "635193339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1761849133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "263750796", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1761849167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "874402416", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“步行……去下一个村子，也许一晚上就够了”"}
{"time": 1761849226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990460656", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...事到如今只能这么做了。”点点头，“我们先去找爸爸...然后就离开吧。”"}
{"time": 1761849292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072585747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……”她扛起行李，看了看天色。此刻已经渐想昏黑"}
{"time": 1761849405, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1795548778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "帮着拿行李，但是晕过去的伊恩...\"塞行李箱里?\"指着"}
{"time": 1761849473, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1667650851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（装进洗衣机里（）"}
{"time": 1761849514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1094970895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……背着也行，就说去求医”"}
{"time": 1761849609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587060588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“到时候得看演技了。这么说来最该进行李箱的可能是你爸爸……”"}
{"time": 1761849650, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145254720", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...如果行李箱够大的话...\"其实已经在找合适的箱子，但是最后还是作罢，\"好吧...我们出发吧。嗯...东西也不能拿太多，不能太像逃难的...\"提着东西出发"}
{"time": 1761849820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "239914462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯”她最后环视了一周，感觉重要的东西都带了“要不要做真一点？画点疹子？开个口子？”"}
{"time": 1761849935, "type": "recv", "message_id": "45901197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"当然没有意见，拿红笔给伊恩点点点，然后伸出自己的右手，露出手腕，\"妈...下手轻点...\""}
{"time": 1761850075, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412204436", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……你得留点力气，就别了。我去弄点动物血……”"}
{"time": 1761850175, "type": "recv", "message_id": "848459083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“比起外伤，果然还是……嘴里吐出来比较像？”她钻进厨房，捞出前一天刚买的活鱼"}
{"time": 1761850193, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1104232704", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"总有种紧张，\"好吧...妈妈快一点...\""}
{"time": 1761850330, "type": "recv", "message_id": "60184871", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她在鱼鳃落下一刀，用瓶子接了小半瓶腥气十足的鱼血，再把死鱼往后院一丢，等哪个猫猫狗狗叼走“一会如果要过卡，就往他嘴里灌……别灌多了，呛醒了就麻烦了”"}
{"time": 1761850391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148928663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"接过小瓶子放在衣襟里，带着自己要带的东西跟着妈妈出门"}
{"time": 1761850431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "286301206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉，也许，该考验你的幸运了）"}
{"time": 1761850505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642665064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉，每次我都)"}
{"time": 1761850508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177095526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(运气很背)"}
{"time": 1761850509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1627133682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd"}
{"time": 1761850509, "type": "reply", "message_id": "1627133682", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[莉维娅]演奏出: 1D20=13"}
{"time": 1761850518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "987940693", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还可以）"}
{"time": 1761850522, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066552213", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还可以）"}
{"time": 1761850589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "679222017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "这个时间，即使是征兵队也要暂休了。路上连巡逻的都没怎么碰见，就回到了木匠店"}
{"time": 1761850651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "698197301", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "试探地推开门，轻声喊，\"爸爸?\""}
{"time": 1761850667, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1723574216", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“あなた？”进了店，舒蕾对着空荡漆黑的门店轻呼"}
{"time": 1761850687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2145011052", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（还有日本人）"}
{"time": 1761850708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1631599093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为不想喊老公）"}
{"time": 1761850764, "type": "recv", "message_id": "982498801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不敢让你们久等，阁楼的暗格响动，随后一架折叠梯放了下来"}
{"time": 1761850818, "type": "recv", "message_id": "762857582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(anata?)"}
{"time": 1761850827, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450835371", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“都准备好了？”他轻手轻脚走下来，怀里还抱着罐压缩饼干"}
{"time": 1761850838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1562993007", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "松了口气，点点头，\"我们走吧...\""}
{"time": 1761850948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128085896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯”他自然没有异议，，随后看向昏迷的伊恩“这是？”"}
{"time": 1761850992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1057377493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊哈哈...\"打个哈哈，不知道该怎么说，\"总之带上了。\""}
{"time": 1761851109, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1109443719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“省的留在这里让人一直安不下心。”舒蕾解释“……我们是妇孺，一会要是被拦住了还能解释。你……”"}
{"time": 1761851151, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1059522158", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我有没有说过舒蕾什么发色来着）"}
{"time": 1761851158, "type": "recv", "message_id": "934582698", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没有哦)"}
{"time": 1761851166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893506910", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(没有哦)"}
{"time": 1761851170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274574798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（总之显然不会是蓝色）"}
{"time": 1761851177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1503345773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(好的)"}
{"time": 1761851197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119688055", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...爸爸有什么好点子吗？我和妈妈在想把你装进行李箱。\""}
{"time": 1761851278, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675742969", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行李箱……”他的表情有点一言难尽“也……行吧，我试试……”"}
{"time": 1761851354, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2054285044", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"忍着笑，但是有点忍不住，咳嗽了两声。"}
{"time": 1761851384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1497646312", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他打开行李箱，抱着膝盖，试图以理想中婴儿般的姿态蜷缩进去"}
{"time": 1761851400, "type": "recv", "message_id": "820076192", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我觉得该让小雅决定了）"}
{"time": 1761851423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "216688327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "。rd100 小于五十"}
{"time": 1761851423, "type": "reply", "message_id": "216688327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": 2875548981, "name": "小雅"}, "message": "[伊芙]使用[小于五十]演奏出:[1D100=65]"}
{"time": 1761851482, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2081782532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "的确有那么一小会，他的身体能勉强保持在框架内，不过面色肉眼可见地涨红起来"}
{"time": 1761851547, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507906190", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不……不行，咳……”他最后放弃了，坐在地上喘气起来“真是……空有副骨头架子，结果去前线和逃跑都做不好”"}
{"time": 1761851553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441756576", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这样肯定不行啦...\"这种情况确实有点没办法，\"爸爸能从小路先出去吗？我们在半道上汇合...\""}
{"time": 1761851742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1971166460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“小路……好像只能赌一赌了”他叹了口气“真被抓到了……就别等我了，他们本来就答应了我只做后勤也可以”"}
{"time": 1761851842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1983546470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"虽然这么说，但总觉得不太放心，看向妈妈。"}
{"time": 1761851959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "551530974", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“……这叫我怎么说？大家都这么想”她摇摇头“那就只能……我们等天黑透了，走山里走吧”"}
{"time": 1761852009, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644940417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"往村边的小路上靠"}
{"time": 1761852088, "type": "recv", "message_id": "407552584", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "西边的红色一点一点退却，天空也像铁一般，温度散去之后，就只剩沉重的黑"}
{"time": 1761852189, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799775828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "压低呼吸，跟着家人走上小路。"}
{"time": 1761852204, "type": "recv", "message_id": "865204937", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "因此大地上的人接过照明的重任。商道被火光照亮，马车也动了起来，载着不知道几根支柱，往那前线去"}
{"time": 1761852371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1698915542", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "山有多大，进山的路就有多少条。只要想绕，总能找得到不设防的方向——何况本来就没那么多人手"}
{"time": 1761852449, "type": "recv", "message_id": "350286688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "回头最后看一眼这片土地和其上的灯火，居住了十六年的感情...最后只能徒然闭上眼，默念一句对不起，\"我是自私的人...\"，转身离开。"}
{"time": 1761852485, "type": "recv", "message_id": "670768175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我会说舒蕾没锁门）"}
{"time": 1761852498, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1078297104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不过显然已经无所谓了，就是因为这个才不锁）"}
{"time": 1761852524, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2098247722", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(因为什么)"}
{"time": 1761852546, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395920686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（回不来了，索性把house共享康乐）"}
{"time": 1761852711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1075661909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈...舒茉是不是胡闹...又任性...\"快步赶上妈妈，亦步亦趋地跟着，\"总觉得自己做错了...但是舒茉真的...不知道能做什么...\""}
{"time": 1761852810, "type": "recv", "message_id": "56656241", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾没说什么，不过也没法一头不回。她扭头，最后看向那栋想起来应该比你还要大的房子，随后目光收回，放在你身上，想来你就是那光阴的寄托“……年轻的时候都是这样的”她叹了口气“不公平的都要等着我来，我只要我想要的……”"}
{"time": 1761852837, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197691151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那种事……偶尔也想再看看，再做做”"}
{"time": 1761853006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922520378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"咬咬嘴唇，\"明明前几天舒茉才说自己长大了...但是一想到会失去爸爸妈妈...舒茉就控制不住...\"长长的停顿，\"之前在路上被怪物袭击的时候也是...明明应该长大了...不能这样的...情绪...\""}
{"time": 1761853519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78930433", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不行了）"}
{"time": 1761853526, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1929216240", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "水"}
{"time": 1761853528, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1126189316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "睡"}
{"time": 1761853549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1465225165", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(睡)"}
{"time": 1761873307, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2074790420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（翔哥不知道醒没醒）"}
{"time": 1761873314, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1690308883", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是伊恩没醒）"}
{"time": 1761873380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "795265569", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还真是，笑了)"}
{"time": 1761873860, "type": "recv", "message_id": "202087606", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1922520378]“我也干了”她耸耸肩“说不定我其实也没长大。”\n她牵着你的手，能称得上光源的东西只剩天上的星星，你连她的轮廓都看不清，但手上的温度无比实在。父亲走到现在也稍带些喘，但也因此有逃出生天的实感"}
{"time": 1761874170, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1769401342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "很是贪恋她手心的余温，手握得很紧，\"明明是妈妈在给舒茉的任性买单吧...\"顺着握着的手靠在她的肩膀上，\"舒茉会努力成长的...成长到能保护大家...\""}
{"time": 1761874532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "15449862", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] 可以过个体力.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761875199, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094296291", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...去了下一个村子真的会没事吗？\"虽然但是，有些疑问，\"这附近的村子应该都差不多吧...?\""}
{"time": 1761875214, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609925129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你发现了）"}
{"time": 1761875243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267903156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(呃呃)"}
{"time": 1761875316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281100792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有点晚了（））"}
{"time": 1761875340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585513106", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也还好吧，又没有到下一个村子)"}
{"time": 1761875359, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580114463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(而且，不是那边的人还能征我不成)"}
{"time": 1761875382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "373312453", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然是这么说.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761875549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415572630", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，只要我们没被通缉，住旅店的话应该……通缉也应该没我们跑得快才对”"}
{"time": 1761875743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1965598624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"至少...得有马车才行...\"到这里才有了些逃难的实感，靠步行...真的能到自己想去的地方吗？抬起头看看夜空，叹口气，\"如果真被抓住了...舒茉会认罪的...\""}
{"time": 1761876403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1765494960", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，得有马车才行……希望这些年攒的钱够用。不过你爸还是很能干的”她点点头“只要能安定下来，生活很快会和以前一样的”"}
{"time": 1761876687, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071176080", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（过个幸运？遇事不决）"}
{"time": 1761876751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119475623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我没意见)"}
