{"time": 1761877740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "725929626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(不可能是什么画风邪恶的蝙蝠多打人)"}
{"time": 1761877756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "803167001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎dnf真的有药剂师）"}
{"time": 1761878356, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014964310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不过，是不是太黑了点”舒蕾把伊恩往背上又抖了抖“该带把开山刀的……”\n真的走入夜晚的山林，你才理解为什么连哨卡都不愿往这边安插，每走一步，都会撞上不知道从哪伸过来的枝叶和不知道从哪飞来的小飞虫。你们必须时刻手拉着手才不会一脚踩进某个石洞扭断腿。鸟兽刮擦草木的声音都像窃窃私语，好在这附近没有猎人，否则捕兽夹可以轻易夹断你们任何一人的小腿"}
{"time": 1761878575, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1948639636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾戴上右手的臂铠，左手依然直接牵着你"}
{"time": 1761878669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1198757206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"轻轻呼出口气，现在的自己还不知道能不能再动用雾气...但好歹要尝试一下，集中精神，尝试让雾气笼罩四周一小片区域。"}
{"time": 1761878717, "type": "recv", "message_id": "675004357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（然后呢）"}
{"time": 1761878868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1718131360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我在想)"}
{"time": 1761878877, "type": "recv", "message_id": "13775023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(雾能作为触须感知四周吗)"}
{"time": 1761878890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1489990132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不能）"}
{"time": 1761878948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "553235112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "虽然可能没什么用，但也算图一个心安，让还算温暖的雾气跟上自己的移动，一直笼罩在四周。"}
{"time": 1761879115, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1668355437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": ".rd+2"}
