{"time": 1761879230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291771036", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我也醒的很快）"}
{"time": 1761879298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1482129716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "意识逐渐清醒了过来，好像在移动？脖子好痛，慢慢睁开眼睛，我.......这是在哪？"}
{"time": 1761879408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "992591154", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "此刻已是几乎无光的深夜。月亮在枝叶间碎得不比星星大多少。体感来看，你应该在一个人的背上"}
{"time": 1761879463, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1724744948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "默不作声，先环绕四周确认一下情况"}
