{"time": 1761886338, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101431691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "蛇最终隐没在石草的缝隙和阴影中。鳞片的摩擦声消失了。但视觉中仍有移动的东西。是那摇曳的火投下的影子，还是风吹动的枝条？不，不对……"}
{"time": 1761886341, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1932219896", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "并没有风"}
{"time": 1761886423, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1841937986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "雾气似乎没能起到遮挡的作用，这样下去只会遮挡自己的视线，挥挥手解消掉周遭的雾"}
{"time": 1761886553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1014764039", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "是那枝条，在无风自动"}
{"time": 1761886598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1774790727", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（树精是？"}
