{"time": 1761886686, "type": "recv", "message_id": "721727468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哈哈）"}
{"time": 1761886744, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1430419329", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "有些奇怪，又有些好奇，但是不太敢靠近，拉着妈妈后退，”绕...绕开吧...\""}
{"time": 1761886977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733289446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "噼啪声连串响起，树林像是活了过来，挨个舒张自己的筋骨，枝条敲打着彼此。树皮的形状扭曲起来，纹路就像……惊惧的人脸"}
{"time": 1761886990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "654331270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"是魔物...\""}
{"time": 1761887071, "type": "recv", "message_id": "664546151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“啊啊？”忍不住叫出了些声音，“整片树林...？都是魔物？这种事...”那现在该怎么办..."}
{"time": 1761887116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "513890988", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看有几只"}
{"time": 1761887240, "type": "recv", "message_id": "613667604", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "起码树都扎着根，也不全是树精。离得近且长着脸的也就两株"}
{"time": 1761887272, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3111884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "松了口气，“我们绕开吧...”"}
