{"time": 1761902592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "218570582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（活在哪）"}
{"time": 1761902597, "type": "recv", "message_id": "856409316", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1948332304]\"好啦，妈妈。如果不考虑过程，感觉我们倒像是一起野营了一次\""}
{"time": 1761902637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1828719486", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "拍拍身上刚刚在林子里沾的灰"}
{"time": 1761902647, "type": "recv", "message_id": "335691343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1948332304]\"好啦，妈妈。如果不考虑原因，感觉我们倒像是一起野营了一次。\""}
{"time": 1761902775, "type": "recv", "message_id": "427652887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过呢...想到这样的日子还要持续到安定下来，啊～么...\"伸手扫扫头发上沾染的尘埃，\"但是踩到蛇这种事...真是不要再有了...幸好这次蛇先生没有咬我...\""}
{"time": 1761902798, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316685275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“你倒是想得开……我们连吃的都没带多少。充其量是越野吧？”她莞尔“说起来……看到妈妈这个样子……你不奇怪？”"}
{"time": 1761902983, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1197940099", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们晚上是去附近的那个村子休息吗？”"}
{"time": 1761902993, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1611333395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“希望那边不要也在征兵”"}
{"time": 1761903099, "type": "recv", "message_id": "418190013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"作为外来者，可能还算好?\"其实也不清楚，呼出口气，整个人靠向妈妈，\"虽然很想问清楚啦，不过感觉刚刚不是时候呢...\""}
{"time": 1761903142, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999634775", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉记得，妈妈养我的时候应该不比舒茉现在大多少...真是的...这么多年都瞒着舒茉。\""}
{"time": 1761903781, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1411672539", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要是天亮前能到就好了……嘛，倒也不是有意瞒你”她干脆把你背起来走“这么些年也没有非得我动手的情况嘛”"}
{"time": 1761904129, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903871069", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...就当是讲故事?\"脑袋搭在她的肩膀上，\"十六岁的妈妈在做什么?和爸爸怎么遇见的?怎么选择在这里养舒茉的?\"好奇心满满"}
{"time": 1761904321, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1935335105", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "凑上去也听听，自己本身就挺喜欢听故事是"}
{"time": 1761904325, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574042316", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "凑上去也听听，自己本身就挺喜欢听故事的"}
{"time": 1761904395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1012640976", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我要是说一些好俗套的故事）"}
{"time": 1761905753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532036206", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（会骂我吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1761905890, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42042905", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(16岁能有什么惊心动魄的故事)"}
{"time": 1761905902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "976706541", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(看看)"}
{"time": 1761905968, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1684813658", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(看看)"}
{"time": 1761907032, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1959688963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(故事呢)"}
{"time": 1761907043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "327318369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不急）"}
{"time": 1761907045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "272155687", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（在看比赛）"}
{"time": 1761908962, "type": "recv", "message_id": "648935920", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“16岁的时候我还没出道呢……”她低头看路“不过那时候我已经被转手两次，是我学武的第四年了。第一次是六岁的时候，因为家里实在揭不开锅，为了开源节流，我被卖给赫顿玛尔的一户不孕不育的普通人家里。过了五年，诺斯玛尔爆发了瘟疫，我们离那边近，结果只有我自己活了下来……后来和养父母关系不错的一间武馆收留了我，几个师兄师姐能上擂台，馆长也经常带他们一起吃饭——那时候我刚从有人在意变得无人关心，就想着，啊，要是我也能上擂台，是不是就会不一样了？”"}
{"time": 1761909251, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2016782173", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“后来就，边打杂边看边练，慢慢的就发现，好像染的那场小病弄得我痛觉不太敏感，拉筋和练童子功都很方便……起步的时候很顺畅，所以17岁的时候，我给自己虚报了年龄，去打出道战咯”"}
{"time": 1761909590, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1042082756", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"啊...妈妈以前是原来是做这个的吗...感觉好酷诶...\"不过抱得更紧一些，那些几经转手的事情...\"妈妈那时候一定也很不安吧...\""}
{"time": 1761910012, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1812438468", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“还好还好啦”她这么说着，不知道是不是在安慰你“倒也没人压榨我”"}
{"time": 1761910725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556613769", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "尝试用自己的体温温暖她，“嗯...之后就是遇见了爸爸吗？”浅浅笑"}
{"time": 1761911863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "808825866", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没那么快没那么快，那时候应该是他认识我但我还不认识他……刚开始的时候，碰到的大部分都是同辈，不过起步比我早的没几个，所以自然是赢多输少，算个小黑马嘛。后来开擂台的人注意到了我”"}
{"time": 1761911931, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1714090546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "静静听"}
