{"time": 1761935235, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093189166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] (～)"}
{"time": 1761935252, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219781205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1761935319, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1047113676", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1893766499]汉斯一副“很奇怪吗？”的表情"}
{"time": 1761935395, "type": "recv", "message_id": "274204953", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以之后叔叔和阿姨就归隐了？”"}
{"time": 1761935418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590518309", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "嘟着嘴，\"毕竟爸爸看上去一直都是古板又传统嘛。\"在妈妈背上抱紧她，\"嘿嘿...\""}
{"time": 1761935790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1368010218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“他只是很少说话嘛”舒蕾笑笑“总之那天喝了不少，具体说了哪些记不清了”"}
{"time": 1761935820, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1423238221", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就记得他和我说，能不能跳槽”"}
{"time": 1761935895, "type": "recv", "message_id": "997470846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"经纪人诶...\"在妈妈背上回头看向父亲，停不住笑容\"爸，你说妈妈和那个据说更漂亮的选手，哪个更好看?\""}
{"time": 1761936517, "type": "recv", "message_id": "223061270", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“客观来说，还是那个选手好看一些”他看起来居然在认真考虑"}
{"time": 1761936542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "787215354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？”没想到叔叔居然会说出这种的发言"}
{"time": 1761936678, "type": "recv", "message_id": "81889525", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“实话实话”他耸耸肩“为什么要要求她是最好看的？”"}
{"time": 1761936699, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442054787", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那是喜欢，又不是选美……啊当时不是这么说的就是了”"}
{"time": 1761936708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1275165867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看舒蕾怎么说"}
{"time": 1761936725, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010758032", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...?\"掩面轻笑，摇晃母亲的肩膀。"}
{"time": 1761936855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582768068", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“切……当时还不如实话实说。我又不瞎”"}
{"time": 1761936972, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1669500355", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“所以后面呢，后面呢”很期待接下来发生了什么"}
{"time": 1761936984, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573532292", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"真是的，当初追妈妈的时候和现在不是一套话术。\"回头做个鬼脸，\"爸爸这些年越活越过去了。\""}
{"time": 1761937228, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788237278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“所以我说，有空拍马屁不如陪我喝两杯……他倒真敢陪，还说要帮我买单。我当然没答应，自己的粉丝诶，怎么能让我买单……其实那时候他也没说很多，都是我一边在倒苦水，一边和他碰杯……总之那天晚上我们都没出那个酒吧”"}
{"time": 1761937348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "294445776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我是无所谓，他倒是第二天就被解雇了。当时我还不知道他是哪来的……直到看到报纸，上面是我和老对头经纪人一起倒在吧台上的合照……”"}
{"time": 1761937394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1961207268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，听起来叔叔阿姨的酒量都蛮好的啊”"}
{"time": 1761937457, "type": "recv", "message_id": "281024116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"瞪一眼伊恩，\"什么意思?\""}
{"time": 1761937512, "type": "recv", "message_id": "765201536", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我喝不过她”汉斯摇头“准确地说不是喝不过，是喝完会昏迷更久……总之合作上之后，喝的越来越多了”"}
{"time": 1761937518, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999051501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=281024116]“没什么意思”偷笑一下“毕竟舒茉不是也没醉么”"}
{"time": 1761937583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783436730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我顶不住，就开始研究醒酒汤了”"}
{"time": 1761937901, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841609509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"难怪爸爸说自己最会做醒酒汤。\"感叹完之后眯上眼，\"那伊恩说，舒茉醉了吗？\""}
{"time": 1761937923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404934633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“肯定没醉啊”"}
{"time": 1761938360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2023380906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哼，你知道就好。\"转头靠在母亲肩膀上，\"舒茉肯定没醉，对吧妈妈。\""}
{"time": 1761938715, "type": "recv", "message_id": "251470184", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“咳咳……这种东西，切忌勉强哦，酒只是情绪的附赠品”"}
{"time": 1761938842, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1362063296", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那爸爸妈妈当时还天天喝。\"头发垂落在晚风里，\"后面果然还是在那边待不住?\"蹭一蹭脸。"}
{"time": 1761938956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "531293695", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，两个都有前科的人搭伙，怎么都干不下去的啦”"}
{"time": 1761939155, "type": "recv", "message_id": "747930294", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“后来被排挤得比赛都接不到，反正本钱也攒够了”"}
{"time": 1761939216, "type": "recv", "message_id": "672368335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（困了💤）"}
{"time": 1761939263, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319711278", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（晚安）"}
{"time": 1761939287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10662053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(晚安。)"}
{"time": 1761939740, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1214546506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...后面就是舒茉出生了吧？\"咬着指尖，\"那我们现在就是回那个城市吗？妈妈的故乡。\""}
{"time": 1761940143, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1303030637", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“多少还算有几个靠得住的人……但愿”"}
{"time": 1761940378, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359301116", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...总感觉会更复杂啊...到时候...\"不过不知道除了去那里还能去哪，\"唔...要是让妈妈再被卷入那种恶性事件里...\"握紧拳头，\"舒茉不会饶了他们的。\""}
{"time": 1762095111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1033639981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来这边）"}
{"time": 1762095118, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1284110887", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（四十个小时了好像）"}
{"time": 1762095172, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664678935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "()"}
