{"time": 1762106652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "97756679", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（贼变态）"}
{"time": 1762106669, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803478503", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1359301116]“呀，小孩子家说什么饶不饶的……事到如今也没什么恨不恨的，毕竟有你们在我就很满足了”"}
{"time": 1762106700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1617408400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(今年lpl成绩不行，但是音乐可以，将功抵过)"}
{"time": 1762106747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "96774919", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是，如果那些家伙还记得的话...\"鼓着脸颊，\"肯定还要找上妈妈的。\""}
{"time": 1762106766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "305589245", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=6EED96B62C5D102A25DD382939C7CD69.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhR-dkyenuPR3tL510MO5C8To7mXGBiG0wog_wooq8vInofUkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQvkCAWInKpVzyiQ7jG_FsUXoCTiaCAQJuag&amp;rkey=CAQSMPFgrljsHqzPR4aVVRq1U-9x1LeYg9HnydftniGPfq4_LjzhsbjqQlprXor_KXTrVg,file_size=174470]"}
{"time": 1762106786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1733033573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这么多年了，应该大概也许不会记得了吧...”"}
{"time": 1762106889, "type": "recv", "message_id": "517266889", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“记不记得不好说，不过大家都退役了，已经没有利益纠葛了吧……大概”她走到现在终于开始有点喘“喔，到这边就有点热了……”"}
{"time": 1762107051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "417231823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我们要不不去那么远的地方吧...\"帮妈妈揉揉肩膀，\"唔...热的话妈妈放我下来，我自己走啦。\""}
{"time": 1762107078, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1056394322", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“能影响天气的魔物...完全想象不到会是什么样子..”"}
{"time": 1762107117, "type": "recv", "message_id": "650300342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我记得好像究极老的版本，冰那个法师是四十多级的）"}
{"time": 1762107260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1477845664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=417231823]虽说是柔道家，但肩膀在发力的时候当然是硬的。森林中偶有细微的绿光晃过，大概是萤火虫\n“不去那么远的话……赫顿玛尔附近倒是也能落脚啦”"}
{"time": 1762107355, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1542162143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过赫顿玛尔是不是格兰之森附近啊...会不会还是有危险”"}
{"time": 1762107372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990825674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"爸爸妈妈好不容易过上这种稳定的生活，要是回去又被一些坏家伙捣乱的话...\"对着空气挥挥拳头，\"当然还是不回去的好。\""}
{"time": 1762107551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297906169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“好啊，那就……换个村子……嗯，舒茉和伊恩希望下一站有什么？”"}
{"time": 1762107592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1803056645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我都可以啦”只要舒茉在身边，稍稍将视线看向舒茉"}
{"time": 1762107642, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606147848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（说正事呢（）"}
{"time": 1762107652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "179500075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（又不是点菜）"}
{"time": 1762107728, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498067776", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“硬要说的话...希望可以让魔法变强”"}
{"time": 1762107742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "974411582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...不会那么容易被魔物盯上?首先要稳定吧？\"放下脑袋思考，\"然后，最好有一个能教我怎么用魔力的好老师...这样...当然，这个没有也可以啦，反正不能去那种会让妈妈卷入恩怨的地方。\""}
{"time": 1762107777, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644359663", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那我要推荐你们一个神奇的地方）"}
{"time": 1762107786, "type": "recv", "message_id": "846286214", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（叫GBL教（）"}
{"time": 1762107853, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1558209501", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，魔法师公会总部就在西海岸哦？你们两个都这么感兴趣的话”"}
{"time": 1762107921, "type": "recv", "message_id": "259578131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=846286214]（先不谈gbl教有个隐世的设定，天帷巨兽哪里安全了（）"}
{"time": 1762107959, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1589638188", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（bgl教和天帷巨兽又没关系（）"}
{"time": 1762107990, "type": "recv", "message_id": "681037366", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（而且天帷巨兽是中立生物。此外你没发现天空之城都还没出现吗（）"}
