{"time": 1762131748, "type": "recv", "message_id": "148158892", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2093876988][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “但舒茉不是能制造雾气么，从某种角度来说，是不是已经算操控天气了”"}
{"time": 1762132220, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1219288754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1252219916] 舒茉说话）"}
{"time": 1762132243, "type": "recv", "message_id": "189460730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“我说的明明不是这种程度吧?”闭上眼，“当然是...可以一人灭一城？起码要这种程度才行。”"}
{"time": 1762132270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1630853201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嘶.........听起来有点吓人啊”"}
