{"time": 1762132335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "290723326", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（当然会这么想）"}
{"time": 1762132424, "type": "recv", "message_id": "809416064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哇啊，千万不要……”舒蕾咳了咳“舒茉变成大魔头的样子……好难想象”"}
{"time": 1762132605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "636419530", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“不是这个意思啦...”手放到母亲脸上搓搓，“是有这种程度的实力，唔...感觉这种描述有些夸张？嘛嘛，手里没有剑和有剑不用是两回事吧？”"}
{"time": 1762132783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1072297825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉去求学的话，我也要和舒茉一起去”"}
{"time": 1762132869, "type": "recv", "message_id": "717479612", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“说是这么说嘛，但是感觉我们一家子都不太适合，唔……变得太厉害？毕竟都是会上头的类型”"}
{"time": 1762133111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2127467033", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“难道伊恩还能不去吗？”语气里带着些笑意，“嘛，一般情况下舒茉还是很冷静的，只有忍不了，实在忍不了的时候哦？真的。”"}
{"time": 1762133437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "550135135", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉忍不了的时候...我也会帮舒茉的”"}
{"time": 1762133595, "type": "recv", "message_id": "288891446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“真的吗？”语气慢悠悠，“下午在店里对峙的时候，伊恩可是一点都没帮我。”"}
{"time": 1762133632, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1770309997", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“帮忙也分很多种的么”挠挠头"}
{"time": 1762133702, "type": "recv", "message_id": "178679437", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“那帮上了哪一种？”在母亲背上回过头，微微眯着眼，颇有些皮笑肉不笑"}
{"time": 1762133755, "type": "recv", "message_id": "711549023", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“对不起....我只是感觉如果打起来的话，舒茉的处境会更危险.....”"}
{"time": 1762133855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "927777352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，当时我也差点打算回头先按住你就是了”舒蕾轻轻开口“暴力抗征麻烦可不小……”"}
{"time": 1762134045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "42023442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“...情绪爆发开之后...当时我什么也思考不了...”抬头看看月亮，“嗯...不过现在我也不后悔。”语气虽然轻但是坚定。"}
{"time": 1762134425, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1752403895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"有时候还是得稍微冷静一下的，不过舒茉这样也挺好的....\""}
{"time": 1762134453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3216543", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“当时我想的也是...就算失败了，到时候也只会抓我一个...”轻声呢喃，只要我在乎的人都没事，舒茉怎么样都好，心中稍微念一念，“好...好吗？”"}
{"time": 1762134472, "type": "recv", "message_id": "953618803", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你没发现舒蕾还是抗了吗.jpg）"}
{"time": 1762134638, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1242285043", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉出事的话，你在乎的人也不会开心的....自己的安危也很重要的“"}
{"time": 1762134807, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449955839", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...嗯...\"轻轻回应，\"但是当时妈妈不也动手了吗？明明说要按住我。\""}
{"time": 1762135173, "type": "recv", "message_id": "130222342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我知道我的分寸在哪里嘛，哪怕追责起来也不会有人受伤”"}
{"time": 1762135489, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1292671607", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"说这种话可没用。\"软软地靠在她背上，不想动弹，\"不过我不冷静的时候...有伊恩劝劝我倒也不错啦。哈～\"打个哈欠"}
{"time": 1762135532, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1690715156", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"嗯，我会努力的...\""}
{"time": 1762135558, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041079608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"舒茉困了吗\"自己之前昏迷了一段时间倒是感觉还好"}
{"time": 1762135680, "type": "recv", "message_id": "425293056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有点...\"反正妈妈背着自己，睡一会也没什么...吧？\"嗯...困了...\""}
{"time": 1762135981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1634619009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（骑个车）"}
{"time": 1762136004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1494540463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“那，睡一会也没关系。还得走两个小时吧”"}
{"time": 1762136161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "271024867", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...那妈妈还要背我两个小时?\"甩甩头试图让自己清醒一些，\"那舒茉自己走...\""}
{"time": 1762136346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937833962", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“背着你还快些啦。你还没行李重……”"}
{"time": 1762136515, "type": "recv", "message_id": "169475999", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...怎么这么说啦...舒茉是不是太瘦了?\"虽然这么说，不过听完母亲的话倒是很安心地趴下身子，脑袋搭在肩膀上，闭上眼。"}
{"time": 1762136738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1848099835", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（听起来可以skip了）"}
