{"time": 1762160785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "447085608", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这看起来不像旅店啊，好像是个仓库？不过为什么大半夜这么亮”"}
{"time": 1762160845, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2040901834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "里头还传出持续不断的机械传动声，和啪滋啪滋的声响"}
{"time": 1762161045, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902054694", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "不过光芒看起来并不稳定，忽明忽暗"}
{"time": 1762161253, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146670812", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？是个工厂吗？这么晚还在上班？”"}
{"time": 1762161260, "type": "recv", "message_id": "871635515", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "呼吸均匀，暂时还没有醒的迹象。"}
{"time": 1762161296, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1794860303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（首先我会说电力没有普及）"}
{"time": 1762161387, "type": "recv", "message_id": "490880749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来……不像旅店”舒蕾扭头去环顾村里其他的房间——很可惜，没有其他还亮着的屋子了"}
{"time": 1762161701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1909579250", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“要不，敲下门问问吧”"}
{"time": 1762161947, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1537047651", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“敲了恐怕也……不是适合睡觉的地方吧”舒蕾有些迟疑“这么亮，怎么合眼”"}
{"time": 1762162093, "type": "recv", "message_id": "587693521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "就在你们踌躇的期间，门里啪滋的声音大了起来，能听见一个压低了声音但还是紧张满满的小女生的惊呼“呼啊——”"}
{"time": 1762162130, "type": "recv", "message_id": "411967129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过我们如果想休息的话...只能在这了吧”"}
{"time": 1762162275, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1766181177", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "随后亮光突然闪灭了，能听见什么金属制的东西掉在地上的声音"}
{"time": 1762162298, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1541936387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我去问问吧”"}
{"time": 1762162303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1569715093", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "上前准备敲门"}
{"time": 1762162464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2030900918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（别准备（）"}
{"time": 1762162493, "type": "recv", "message_id": "651366837", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看叔叔和阿姨没说什么，就敲门了"}
{"time": 1762162708, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2048183495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "凉薄的铁门发出些脆响，里头安静了一阵，没发出声音"}
{"time": 1762162795, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1471045572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“有人吗.. 我们是迷路的旅者，可以收留我们一晚上吗”"}
{"time": 1762163596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1834977971", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "里头的人似乎活过来了，你听到走动的声音，不过也只是堪堪靠近了一点点“旅人？这时候？诶，我这边没地方住人的……你们从哪来的？”\n听起来稚气刚脱，带着些许戒备"}
{"time": 1762163623, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1944816074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看向舒蕾，看看她怎么说"}
{"time": 1762163645, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1721781851", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我不想左右脑互搏（）"}
{"time": 1762163763, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1779630380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我们从月湖村出发的”她想了想“打算去赫顿玛尔，试了条新路……如果这里不方便的话，村里还有旅店吗？”"}
{"time": 1762163808, "type": "recv", "message_id": "434435989", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "阿姨不愧是靠谱的成年人啊"}
{"time": 1762163819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "841294448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1762163903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "285586385", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没有，这村子根本没人会来旅游”里头重新亮起了橘黄色的光，这次看起来确实是火光了“一般来人都是在村民家借住……”"}
{"time": 1762164305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "799591533", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我们会给钱的”舒蕾如是说"}
{"time": 1762164336, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102455821", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“睡地板我们也不介意的...”"}
{"time": 1762165331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "979409589", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(怎么还没人摇醒我的)"}
{"time": 1762165364, "type": "recv", "message_id": "273866823", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（看你一副不想醒的样子）"}
{"time": 1762165409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1300861373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=102455821]“钱……”里头的人纠结着什么“可是我这里也没有躺的下的地板了啊”"}
{"time": 1762165433, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1801284982", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“算了，一个人的位置努努力应该还可以……”"}
{"time": 1762165991, "type": "recv", "message_id": "182421556", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(没喊我怎么醒喵)"}
{"time": 1762165997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "190721011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "([CQ:at,qq=1040972910] )"}
{"time": 1762166015, "type": "recv", "message_id": "580828520", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我喊你吗？）"}
{"time": 1762166028, "type": "recv", "message_id": "183392935", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“但我们人好像有点多...有四个人”"}
{"time": 1762166212, "type": "recv", "message_id": "783814444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“四个肯定……没办法啦”里头的人小心翼翼地拉开门，那是个个子不高的女生，看起来不比你们两个高，苹果红的头发扎着单侧马尾，看起来像带梗的樱桃。仓库里……确实杂乱到几乎没法下脚。机械零件、草稿、各种晶块堆得到处都是"}
{"time": 1762166390, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1175093090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(魔道?)"}
{"time": 1762166402, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093660197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我知道你r的是啥了)"}
{"time": 1762166406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "731153650", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（是的）"}
{"time": 1762166406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1605969378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我睡外面其实也无所谓，稍微收拾一下的话，也许可以多挤下一个人？”"}
{"time": 1762166497, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1798655945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“看起来确实只有地板……那在里面和外面好像也没什么区别……”"}
{"time": 1762166552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1283119493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“外面风大吧...舒茉和阿姨睡里面应该好一点...我和叔叔可以睡外边。。。”"}
{"time": 1762166657, "type": "recv", "message_id": "145775148", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（叔叔：so？）"}
{"time": 1762166676, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761719819", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（男子汉大丈夫（）"}
{"time": 1762166724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1180585711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还看不出谁体质高吗（）"}
{"time": 1762166809, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707999017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我说都是里面三个女孩子安全点）"}
{"time": 1762166850, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792170349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是你没有帮别人做决定的立场对不对）"}
{"time": 1762166868, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1020292357", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我只是提建议）"}
{"time": 1762167279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1388635482", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1283119493]“我这里倒是有疏水布和支架，临时撑一个小棚子倒是没问题”"}
{"time": 1762167287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1938819011", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "女孩如是说"}
{"time": 1762167335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1920592090", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢你....”拿出自己钱袋，掏出50银币递给她"}
{"time": 1762167583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1806154526", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她从那堆小山般的材料里扒拉出一块军绿色的大布，看起来沾了些灰，但拍拍总比地面干净。又不知道从哪抠出两块磁石，把幕布一边吸在仓库外的金属架子上，算是固定了一半"}
{"time": 1762167693, "type": "recv", "message_id": "763064201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1920592090]和往常不一样，舒蕾倒是没拦着你掏钱。而女孩看到银币的时候眼睛明显在发光，朝你伸出手“嘿嘿，那我就不客气了……”"}
{"time": 1762168101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1695901344", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说动静也不小，吧）"}
