{"time": 1762168116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814404781", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1762168137, "type": "recv", "message_id": "225210850", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "微微睁开眼，脑袋还是有些迷糊，“啊...到了吗？唔...”"}
{"time": 1762168264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "811806424", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，刚到……不过没有旅馆住呐……”舒蕾用脑袋抵一抵你“只能睡仓库”"}
