{"time": 1762168403, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1836105488", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"眯着眼享受一些母亲的摆弄，\"有地方睡就好...舒茉没关系的...\""}
{"time": 1762168452, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1701609105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那打扰小姐了...，对了，小姐怎么称呼，我叫伊恩”"}
{"time": 1762168551, "type": "recv", "message_id": "170020904", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“比打扰村里其他人好些嘛，反正我昼夜颠倒惯了……我叫玲玲”"}
{"time": 1762168588, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665455646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...\"此刻才算真的清醒了一些，听见伊恩的问话，看见眼前人，\"啊...玲玲小姐好～\"拖着语调，带着掩饰不了的"}
{"time": 1762168596, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1433997666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "困倦"}
