{"time": 1762168628, "type": "recv", "message_id": "649684593", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那个环节）"}
{"time": 1762168785, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2080401674", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=665455646]“嗯……我收拾点地方出来吧。晚上……算了，今晚就不鼓捣了”她后半句小声嘟囔，开始帮忙清理场地"}
{"time": 1762168953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1090974843", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈，放我下来吧...我现在醒了不少...\"伸手捂着自己的嘴，打哈欠，\"呼呼...\""}
{"time": 1762170059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1274506212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不用那么醒，还能接着睡到天亮”"}
{"time": 1762171239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1442507083", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不行啦...舒茉要帮忙清理一下才行...\"还是困困地，\"妈妈...都背我好久了...\""}
{"time": 1762171366, "type": "recv", "message_id": "133452269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2080401674][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 上去帮帮忙“我来帮你吧，可以吗”征求一下意见，万一那些东西不能碰，惹她生气就不好了"}
