{"time": 1762192131, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1376834792", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“能大范围烛火的东西”她看了看房间中间的一根，几乎可以算尖塔的东西。上面如藤蔓般挂着许多管道，又沿着章鱼足般的管道连向房间四角"}
{"time": 1762192205, "type": "recv", "message_id": "29282555", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（代替烛火（）"}
{"time": 1762192406, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1924037864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来是爱迪生）"}
{"time": 1762192491, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1085382963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好厉害啊”不由得感叹道"}
{"time": 1762192629, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1006269865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那你现在进展怎么样了”有些好奇"}
{"time": 1762192724, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1309077884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哇哦——\"发出感叹，\"这个好厉害。\""}
{"time": 1762192803, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1720860138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"但是...看上去就很需要很多能量源啊？\"皱眉，鼓鼓脸颊，对着妈妈伸手"}
{"time": 1762193080, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1034105811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“现在……完全不稳定，离能用还早得很”"}
{"time": 1762193127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1297977816", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那祝你早日成功”"}
{"time": 1762193179, "type": "recv", "message_id": "269165047", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯，大家都有这种灯光用的话，就不用点烛火了。\"手还伸着，等着妈妈捞自己"}
{"time": 1762193196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "990449594", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=269165047]（干嘛，要睡觉了都）"}
{"time": 1762193245, "type": "recv", "message_id": "300770595", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(等她抱啊)"}
{"time": 1762193499, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1712802549", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“疏水布和支架在哪里，玲玲小姐，我自己去外面慢慢搭吧，就不麻烦你了”"}
{"time": 1762193549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "441375065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=269165047]她伸手抱起你“呀……这么黏妈妈，以后去了学校怎么办？”"}
{"time": 1762193608, "type": "recv", "message_id": "687194633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1712802549]（？）"}
{"time": 1762193621, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1639979001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1806154526]（？）"}
{"time": 1762193627, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606313773", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（对不起）"}
{"time": 1762193908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "911325367", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=441375065]\"没关系嘛...就是因为之后不能天天跟着妈妈，现在这段时间才更应该...\"脑袋搭在她肩膀上，打哈欠"}
{"time": 1762194191, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2025470454", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看她收拾差不多了“多谢玲玲小姐收留我们了，我也先去休息了”转身准备去临时棚子那里"}
{"time": 1762194224, "type": "recv", "message_id": "84225031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=911325367]“好啦，该休息了。明天估计还得继续走……”"}
{"time": 1762194254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "751407938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "打了个哈欠，走了好多路，好累，感觉要站着睡着了，一坐下来睡意瞬间涌了上来"}
{"time": 1762194317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897276391", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...伊恩早点休息。\"眼皮慢慢合上，在母亲怀里再度安眠"}
{"time": 1762194409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "546636811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“晚安..舒....茉”用最后的意识说完这句话，就彻底昏睡过去了"}
{"time": 1762194660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1181017040", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看起来玲玲没有继续捣鼓那些机械，晚上除了偶有螺丝从零件堆里掉下来和几声猫叫，再无别的声响"}
{"time": 1762194734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "502610202", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "次日清晨"}
{"time": 1762194792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1954763994", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "今天倒是醒的很早，虽然意识清醒，不过身上有些沉重，无法摆脱这种疲惫感，\"呃...\"睁眼看看妈妈"}
{"time": 1762194814, "type": "recv", "message_id": "960848365", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "脱离了森林魔物的影响范围，早晨还是有些热"}
{"time": 1762194843, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1474553842", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "偶尔的睡个懒觉，虽然地板很硬，但完全不想起床"}
{"time": 1762194930, "type": "recv", "message_id": "301805238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1954763994]还睡着，你很少看到她比你醒的晚"}
{"time": 1762195203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "577361074", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "伸出手揉揉妈妈的脸颊，心里莫名有点踏实的感觉，自己真的已经离开了..."}
{"time": 1762195376, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1785730645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "偶有人路过仓库外面，但是似乎也无人对你们提起兴趣，各自做自己的事去了"}
{"time": 1762195429, "type": "recv", "message_id": "491421053", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "见母亲父亲和伊恩都没醒，悄悄起身，出门去镇子上看看。"}
{"time": 1762195774, "type": "recv", "message_id": "412342172", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（困了 睡.jpg）"}
{"time": 1762195888, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2063108218", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(笑了，现在是舒茉的单人冒险环节。)"}
{"time": 1762197637, "type": "recv", "message_id": "498392124", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "镇子比未白村小得多，只有一半多点。有人挎着装着各种手工制品和作物箩筐，沿着村路向外走去，看起来是赶集。玲玲也在其中"}
{"time": 1762197792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1083279666", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "本来想追上她，但是自己跟她也不熟...悄悄跟在人群后面，慢悠悠看看镇上的集市是什么情况。"}
{"time": 1762197857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1612945979", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "到了村口依旧没人停下，目光所及也看不到摊子……大概在很远的外边，也许是几个村子共用一个集市也说不定"}
{"time": 1762197982, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1404417219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"见状拦住附近的一个妇女问问，\"阿姨，这赶集要走多远啊?\""}
{"time": 1762198200, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1032544094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔？谁……啊集市，这次近，也就二十多分钟的路”她挎着一筐红薯，回答你的同时脚下也没停"}
{"time": 1762198282, "type": "recv", "message_id": "401315980", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "想了想，时间好像也算赶得上?趁着大家还没醒，一路小跑过去，打算给他们买点东西。"}
{"time": 1762198612, "type": "recv", "message_id": "540455633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "沿途稍有些尘土飞扬，有些大户会让牛拉着拖车，但看不到能载人的马车。走了十几分钟，远远地就能看见一个规模不小的市集，二十几个颜色各异的帐篷挤在一起，像个蘑菇园"}
{"time": 1762198738, "type": "recv", "message_id": "443364708", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"尽量让自己没什么存在感，毕竟算是第一次单独赶集，沿着入口往吃口逛一圈，看看除了日用品之外有没有什么合适的装饰品，消耗品。"}
{"time": 1762199132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1144692664", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "毛巾、袋子等目前急需的用品自不必说，也有卖锅碗瓢盆和小刀之类铁器的。餐食集中在最外层一圈，烤红薯和煎饼的香气令你食指大动。的确有三个铺子专门售卖装饰品，看起来以稀有金属和矿石制品居多，当然原材料也有售卖，玲玲也在这附近"}
{"time": 1762199447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357396354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "买好急需的日用品，同时买几个红薯和煎饼，走到装饰品那边仔细看看，同时偷偷观察玲玲在买什么。\n自己要买的明确目标是翡翠制作的飘雪手环和挂坠，思考了一会，再找一个鸡血石做的手链。"}
{"time": 1762200351, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1529266975", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "玲玲拿了好几块巴掌大、几乎不透明的银白色石头。说是石头，看她在手里掂量的样子，密度完全不输金属。"}
{"time": 1762200399, "type": "recv", "message_id": "736340797", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=357396354]成品自然价值不菲，单件的报价就来到99银"}
{"time": 1762200505, "type": "recv", "message_id": "378938138", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"这样的话，要把钱全花完啊...最后摇了摇头，只付款了一个飘花的手镯。时间过了很有一会了，拿着食物日用品和手镯往回赶。"}
{"time": 1762200534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "393192625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(总不能路上打劫我吧。)"}
{"time": 1762200543, "type": "recv", "message_id": "882228001", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(希望没有)"}
{"time": 1762200548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1291294133", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（那确实没有）"}
{"time": 1762200700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043726120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "玲玲的采买结束得也快，篓子里除了矿物和一人份的早餐外就没装其他。回程的时候她终于注意到你“啊，你也来了？喔，刚刚都没注意到你”"}
{"time": 1762200787, "type": "recv", "message_id": "880408006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...我看姐姐挑得很认真，就没有打扰...\"既然她搭了话，\"姐姐买的白色石头是什么?\""}
{"time": 1762201270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2013112387", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“喔，这个”她从框里拿起其中一块，往另一块上轻轻敲了敲，两者之间便有细微的电弧接上“是银色小镇的特产，白明石”说到这些小物件她反倒有解释的欲望“蕴含光属性的魔力，我在研究用这个来替代传统的核心，来给电机供能。如果还能弄明白储能机制就更好了”"}
{"time": 1762201348, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125252952", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...玲玲小姐是很厉害的魔法师吗？\"问这个问题的时候不免有些心生期待，\"可以教舒茉魔法吗？\""}
{"time": 1762201371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "78489317", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(明天见，是世界上最美好的话语。\n明天见)"}
{"time": 1762201382, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035080707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（没意见）"}
{"time": 1762216873, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1053233075", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2125252952]“没有很厉害也不是魔法师啦”她摇头，一侧马尾随着一起抖起来“虽然确实会用点基础魔法，但是我是学者，不是那种魔法师”"}
{"time": 1762219207, "type": "recv", "message_id": "474288375", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "不由得有些失望，不过强装没事，语气带上点强加的欢快\"原来是这样，但是舒茉觉得姐姐比那些魔法师要厉害得多啦。\"脚下稍稍加快点脚步，如果他们醒了太久没看见自己..."}
{"time": 1762219280, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211682078", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（[CQ:at,qq=1040972910] ）"}
{"time": 1762219732, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2072117392", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谢啦，我也觉得。虽然主流魔法师总能搞出些大场面啦，但是大部分都在依葫芦画瓢嘛”她似乎对你的话很受用，追在你后面“而且也没哪个魔法师愿意住仓库”"}
{"time": 1762220101, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505991524", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不仅如此...姐姐的发明终有一天会改变这个世界。\"现在倒是没什么困意，不过昨天也没洗澡，身上有些不太清爽，\"舒茉是这么相信的。\""}
{"time": 1762220127, "type": "recv", "message_id": "342312934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（愿意住仓库的魔法师怎么还不说话）"}
{"time": 1762220262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818908566", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1762220427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1149411544", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "伸个懒腰，饱饱的睡了一觉"}
{"time": 1762220456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1910042646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不知道舒茉醒了吗，不过先去洗个脸吧"}
{"time": 1762220815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1115363618", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=505991524]“呀……也没那么厉害”她双手绞在身前，看着脸有些红，但是有些神采奕奕“我只是那么多学者之一……啊对了，舒茉想学魔法来着，打算做什么？”"}
{"time": 1762220822, "type": "recv", "message_id": "688390546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看一眼叔叔醒了没"}
{"time": 1762220839, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177602880", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（方便起见就当没醒（））"}
{"time": 1762220864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1173808955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好的）"}
{"time": 1762220902, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1263878493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "那动静就小一点，舒茉她们睡里面，自己也不好确认"}
{"time": 1762220956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675465378", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "大概收拾一下，就在仓库门口找个地方坐下，等大家都醒来"}
{"time": 1762221064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "101852703", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1115363618]\"嗯...我也没有什么远大的理想啦。\"把自己买的东西抱在身前，深吸一口气，\"舒茉想保护自己在乎的人...为此需要变得很厉害很厉害才行。\""}
{"time": 1762221122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1016837438", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1910042646]村子附近当然会有水源，盥洗不成问题，但能否直饮成疑。仓库的门半掩着，里头安安静静"}
{"time": 1762221445, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1937032691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "不太敢进去，万一看到什么就不好了，还是就在外面乖乖的等吧"}
{"time": 1762221548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "205257489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=101852703]她没发表什么见地，只是附和道“嘛，太远的事我也没想过，能把手头这点事做好就好咯”她掂了掂篮子，镇子已经在眼前了"}
{"time": 1762221766, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1844882397", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"呼...\"调整一下呼吸，希望父母，还有伊恩，都没有醒才好。"}
{"time": 1762221848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "901776731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "到了.jpg。看起来只有伊恩醒了"}
{"time": 1762221912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1555372553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看到玲玲和舒茉一起回来，有些疑惑，不过还是先打个招呼吧“早上好啊，舒茉，玲玲”"}
{"time": 1762221944, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1505154360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（话说我发现好像只有我自我介绍了）"}
{"time": 1762221981, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1689928289", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“两位这是去哪了”好奇"}
{"time": 1762222047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2094617159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"给你买吃的去了。\"把抱在胸前的红薯和煎饼放下来，递到他面前，\"你挑吧。\""}
{"time": 1762222132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1067630844", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么，马皇后）"}
{"time": 1762222289, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1355173955", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？那谢谢舒茉了...”挑一颗红薯拿走，大早上怎么就有好事发生，好开心"}
{"time": 1762222380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1008606571", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "留一个红薯一个煎饼放在旁边的桌子上，\"等爸爸醒了，伊恩提醒他吃一下吧。我先去看看妈妈。\"自己拿起个小一点的烤红薯，一边剥开外壳一边提着剩下的进屋。"}
{"time": 1762222589, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2104657483", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（算好事吗）"}
{"time": 1762222660, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1882390159", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”慢慢剥着红薯的皮"}
{"time": 1762222677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1111321120", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后小口小口的吃着"}
{"time": 1762222958, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873082958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "红薯外硬内软，远没有你们吃过的果酱和蜂蜜那么甜。但是对跋涉半晚、甚至昨天晚饭都没吃的你们来说这远比蛋糕诱人得多\n舒蕾还闭着眼睛躺着，防备性地蜷缩着"}
{"time": 1762223188, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1707629166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "放下手里拎着的食物，不免有些玩心，鼓着脸颊坐到她身边，把剥开壳的红薯慢悠悠放到她的鼻尖"}
{"time": 1762223439, "type": "recv", "message_id": "604354226", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（使用擒拿就知错了）"}
{"time": 1762223600, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1533378598", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(擒一下试试)"}
{"time": 1762223677, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1691069232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "舒蕾的脸无意识后仰避开热源，随后肩膀撞上另一块杂料“唔……”她皱着眉头睁开眼"}
{"time": 1762223751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1152782721", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "眼疾手快另一只手遮住她的眼睛，同时拿开手里的红薯，\"妈妈还能再休息一会啦。\""}
{"time": 1762224704, "type": "recv", "message_id": "813833269", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（原来）"}
{"time": 1762224710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1288844445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（原来）"}
{"time": 1762224737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "211105690", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "（原来）"}
{"time": 1762224805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1827605370", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1152782721]“舒茉？”她有些艰难地睁开眼睛，用手再揉了揉才算能视物，头发有些凌乱“早上好……几点了？感觉睡了好久……”"}
{"time": 1762225006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1162537171", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"舒茉也不知道。\"轻声回应，移开自己的手，\"呀...妈妈要是还困的话，就再睡一会嘛。我已经买回来了早餐。\"镯子还在自己的衣兜里。"}
{"time": 1762225147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1193126118", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不睡了不睡了……”她甩了甩脑袋，很快坐正。看起来已经没有昨天的凌厉，倒是碎碎念起来“买了早饭？记得先洗漱喝水……哦，还住在别人的地方……得早点收拾……”"}
{"time": 1762225279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "867310692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"鼓了鼓脸颊，伸手戳戳她的脸，从怀里把飘花的翡翠镯子递到她手边，\"别说这些了，妈妈先试试看啦。\""}
{"time": 1762225529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1375245629", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……啊？”她看清了之后很快醒了过来“这……你买的？这、多少钱？”"}
{"time": 1762225606, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2139951639", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1111321120]看起来玲玲也不急着进去，可能是因为里面有人了，也可能是因为她昨晚根本没睡，现在靠仓库门的另一侧一边咬着烧饼一边打哈欠"}
{"time": 1762225692, "type": "recv", "message_id": "146884740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"昨晚没睡好吗？怎么看起来没有什么精神的样子\""}
{"time": 1762225790, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1877208407", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“没睡啊”她说得理所当然“反正今天也要赶集……睡了不一定起得来”"}
{"time": 1762225792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1699859462", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1375245629]\"不贵不贵。\"把镯子塞给她，\"现在也不能反悔了吧？就算妈妈这么说...\"转过身背朝着妈妈，\"这几天都没有好好打理头发，妈，帮帮我啦。\""}
{"time": 1762226262, "type": "recv", "message_id": "814516644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1877208407][CQ:at,qq=825734198] \"额....\"不知道该怎么回答了“玲玲小姐平时晚上都不怎么睡吗”"}
{"time": 1762226305, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1969180112", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1699859462]“呀，真是……”她硬生生噎回去扫兴的话，把镯子拿在手里“我是觉得舒茉比我适合戴着这个。你看，我的手不知道什么时候就有粗活要做……”"}
{"time": 1762226441, "type": "recv", "message_id": "507664421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=814516644]“问这个干嘛……？”她有些奇怪地歪头看你一眼，但是还是回答了你“困了就睡，不困或者睡不着就不睡呗”"}
{"time": 1762226527, "type": "recv", "message_id": "3891806", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听起来不太健康的样子，不过毕竟也不熟，也不好多说什么“没什么，只是感觉和我常见的作息有些不同，比较好奇”"}
{"time": 1762226710, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1337243136", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=3891806]“习惯就好……哦对了，你们缺热水吗？你们缺热水吧”她想到了什么"}
{"time": 1762226711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "53215469", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1969180112]\"唔...\"不转头，仰躺到她怀里看着她扭扭脑袋撒娇\"舒茉有妈妈给的首饰了。妈妈又不老，还这么漂亮年轻，戴手镯怎么了？\""}
{"time": 1762226773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1603634610", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”仔细想想已经好久没喝水了“确实有点渴了，那拜托玲玲小姐了”"}
{"time": 1762226799, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2042246592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有没有可能是让你们洗澡的）"}
{"time": 1762226805, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590188789", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file={3AF7AA7F-9E54-1315-944B-5BEB575633BA}.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://gchat.qpic.cn/gchatpic_new/0/0-0-3AF7AA7F9E541315944B5BEB575633BA/0,file_size=6939]"}
{"time": 1762226812, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138904380", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然喝的也有）"}
{"time": 1762226816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316222087", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（那确实也口渴了）"}
{"time": 1762226906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1041006615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“别拜托”她打起了点精神“给钱就行，喝的1银币一人，要洗澡的话，4银币一人”"}
{"time": 1762227007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "91567056", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“看起来玲玲小姐真的很缺钱了”虽然自己积蓄也没多少了，不过还是掏出20银币递过去"}
{"time": 1762227016, "type": "recv", "message_id": "644737624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“四个人的份....”"}
{"time": 1762227139, "type": "recv", "message_id": "208357222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不不，这不是缺不缺的事情”她摇头“本来就该这样吧，虽然我这里不如旅店，但是东西不该明码标价吗？”"}
{"time": 1762227197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1054246628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "把钱放在她手上“我也没什么意见，那玲玲小姐快去忙吧”"}
{"time": 1762227286, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1797918660", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=53215469]“好嘛好嘛……”她抿了抿嘴，戴上手镯伸到你眼前晃了晃“怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1762227453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "914823128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1054246628]“忙什么？”她伸手给你指了指仓库另一面的一个明显是后来搭建的隔间“那里面就能洗，按下红色按钮就能加热，自己调”"}
{"time": 1762227464, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1830165353", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1797918660]\"嘿嘿...很好看啦，爸爸还说那个谁比妈妈好看，怎么可能嘛。\"直起身子，伸手弹弹自己的头发，\"妈...头发帮帮...\""}
{"time": 1762227492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160201426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊....那饮用水呢”"}
{"time": 1762227549, "type": "recv", "message_id": "570598711", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“仓库里有水壶，希望你们有杯子”"}
{"time": 1762227718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1010244237", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有，有吗，自己身上应该基本属于什么都没带，不过算了，先去洗个澡吧"}
{"time": 1762227726, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1449235163", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1830165353]“好嘛，但是不沾水有点难梳开……有的都结上了”她拨弄了一番，简单地理顺了些，不过看起来依旧没什么光泽“有个洗漱的地儿就好了”"}
{"time": 1762227897, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322725575", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘛，这种时候也不奢求更好条件啦。\"拉着她站起身，\"红薯或者煎饼...\"把自己剥了壳的递给她，自己拿个煎饼小口小口吃。"}
{"time": 1762227906, "type": "recv", "message_id": "6891369", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那你跟舒茉她们也说一声吧，我也不怎么方便进去“"}
{"time": 1762227938, "type": "recv", "message_id": "764714180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "然后转身去她指的那个地方，研究一下怎么放热水"}
{"time": 1762228133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "322074699", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行”她差不多吃完了早饭，回家一样推开了仓库门“那个，伊恩？是叫这个吧，他帮你们付了热水钱。仓库背面的房间里可以洗澡，怎么用让他告诉你们吧。然后桌上……哈啊……有水壶，也付过了，想喝自己倒吧”"}
{"time": 1762228317, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1089816071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶诶...\"眨眨眼，\"伊恩付过了?能冒昧问一下，多少钱吗？\""}
{"time": 1762228407, "type": "recv", "message_id": "519952909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "以前洗澡热水都是自己烧的，这种按个按钮就可以加热，确实蛮神奇的，是魔法吗"}
{"time": 1762228427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1267374125", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“四个人一共20银啦”"}
{"time": 1762228460, "type": "recv", "message_id": "17296981", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（吃个饭）"}
{"time": 1762228509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2100472683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"这家伙...\"点点脑袋，\"我出去喊爸爸起床，妈妈再休息一会吧。\"跑出去喊父亲，再去隔间那边看看，\"伊恩在里面吗？\""}
{"time": 1762228599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "614506331", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=764714180]墙壁高处挂着一个横过来的大概一米多长的圆筒，上面确实有个红色按钮。圆筒下面伸出两根水管，在末端又合为一根。两根水管上各自还有一个把手"}
{"time": 1762228690, "type": "recv", "message_id": "733240303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(热水器?)"}
{"time": 1762228701, "type": "recv", "message_id": "50216422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（怎么了（）"}
{"time": 1762228815, "type": "recv", "message_id": "541241852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(唉现代科技)"}
{"time": 1762228821, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947258131", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(那我坦克车呢)"}
{"time": 1762228826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "8761642", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(什么时候搓出来)"}
{"time": 1762228831, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780885199", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（现代在哪）"}
{"time": 1762228836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1622639310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（魔法驱动）"}
{"time": 1762228862, "type": "recv", "message_id": "10111489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(也对吧)"}
{"time": 1762229074, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1638941948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2100472683]“嗯...不过我还没开始洗，舒茉要先洗吗”"}
{"time": 1762229283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "438528692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不用啦，伊恩先洗吧，舒茉洗的话要好久诶...\""}
{"time": 1762229310, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1154480573", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=614506331][CQ:at,qq=825734198] 按下红色按钮，等待水加热"}
{"time": 1762229326, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928765929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"洗好了待会喊我就好。\"说完先去解决早饭的事情。"}
{"time": 1762229339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1118294861", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好!”"}
{"time": 1762229456, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1507951268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "按下之后也没有什么特殊的声响，不过桶身一侧亮起红色的纹路，你能感觉到其中有魔力流动。大概两分钟后红光熄灭，不过这版本桶身周围已经能看见阵阵热浪了"}
{"time": 1762229584, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459106493", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "坐回母亲身边，一边打理自己的发梢，\"嗯...说起来舒茉的头发是不是太显眼了?...明明爸爸妈妈都不是...\""}
{"time": 1762229609, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1028283829", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好厉害...玲玲小姐跟隐世高人一样”脱衣服放在一旁，然后打开把手慢慢调整放水，等水温合适了，开始洗澡"}
{"time": 1762229851, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1792624152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1459106493]“嘛，妈妈也搞不清楚为什么啦。或许舒茉足够特别？”她眨眨眼，也顺着你的头发“不过，万一哪天舒茉走丢了，我就能很轻松地找到你了”"}
{"time": 1762229867, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1841417054", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1028283829]（你带衣服了吗）"}
