{"time": 1762246292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1429218782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好像是通过魔法实现的，很厉害”"}
{"time": 1762246383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "825922420", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "水桶上亮起红色光纹，水又在加热"}
{"time": 1762246421, "type": "recv", "message_id": "472190948", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那舒茉先洗吧，我走了”松开手，然后转身离开，顺便看看那两个圆圆的是什么"}
{"time": 1762246481, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530957415", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "原来是两枚金币"}
{"time": 1762246492, "type": "recv", "message_id": "926285091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "怪不得不让自己保存.."}
{"time": 1762246574, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881250352", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "关上门，\"呼...\"慢慢脱掉越野穿的衣服，身体轻松了许多，放点水出来打湿头发。拿肥皂仔细打满发丝，然后再打满全身，放出热水冲洗。哼着随便的小调子，能洗热水澡竟然会这么幸福..."}
{"time": 1762246611, "type": "recv", "message_id": "818868121", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但是自己受了这么多帮助，有些受之有愧，但还回去舒茉肯定不会要的...罢了，自己少花一点好了，剩下的给舒茉买点什么算了"}
{"time": 1762246734, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153482834", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去找阿姨问问下来的行动吧，她应该也醒了"}
{"time": 1762247248, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2110213669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "洗完澡，感觉整个人又活了过来，仔细擦干身上的水。但是头发变得很重，一时自己有些弄不干，好在今天拿的是衬衣，直接盘起来。穿上衣服出门，待会找妈妈帮忙擦一下。"}
{"time": 1762247306, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1352372419", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（我走的是不是好像太慢了）"}
{"time": 1762247312, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893319230", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "去找舒蕾"}
{"time": 1762247324, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1225557911", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（可能是她洗的太快了）"}
{"time": 1762247331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1630686964", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我好困，不知道为什么）"}
{"time": 1762247514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2026575683", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1893319230]舒蕾在仓库里吃着早饭，她看到了你，点了点头“等汉斯也洗漱好，我们就打算继续走了。”"}
{"time": 1762247563, "type": "recv", "message_id": "233496810", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(我可以待会再出来。)"}
{"time": 1762247583, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1110446152", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“oh好，阿姨，有多的杯子瓶子吗”"}
{"time": 1762247696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1879336434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她摇摇头“暂时用汉斯的吧……附近应该有卖的。之后早晚要有的，不如趁早看看”"}
{"time": 1762247737, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1649775393", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好，谢谢阿姨”倒杯水喝喝，然后找个地方坐下等舒茉了"}
{"time": 1762247942, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2051334918", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "过了一会，才推开门进来，头发盘在脑后，衬衣的肩部有一点点湿，一边开口一边开口，\"妈...帮我擦一下头发啦。\""}
{"time": 1762248483, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1528138446", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2051334918]“嗯……怎么样？好用吗？”她让你在她面前坐下，挥挥手让汉斯先去洗，从行李中掏出一匹亚麻色毛巾，把你瀑布般的蓝发解放开来，再一点点擦干"}
{"time": 1762248696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1922255333", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一会我们就准备走了，不好在这边久呆……最好能找到马车”她总想着安排“你早上买这些的地方在哪里？”"}
{"time": 1762248752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1893764350", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"离这里有十几分钟，似乎是附近几个村子的集会。\"眯着眼一脸享受，\"咦，妈妈不洗吗？\""}
{"time": 1762249043, "type": "recv", "message_id": "893879521", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"妈妈自己也去洗一下不就好了?\"对着伊恩眨眨眼，\"我还是第一次用这种方式洗澡，好方便。对不对，伊恩。\""}
{"time": 1762249081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "713919970", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然要啊，算在一会里”她捏捏你的耳朵。玲玲推门走了进来，坐在唯一的桌子前的唯一的椅子上，看起来一副快睡着的样子，不过还是有精神表达好奇心“你们，打算去哪？我看你们带的东西挺多的……”"}
{"time": 1762249300, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1033860143", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"去西边?哦，姐姐知道镇子上哪里能买到马车吗？\""}
{"time": 1762249564, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1573527244", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“唔哦，张口就是买……难道说，你们其实很有钱？”她看起来兴趣足了点“银色小镇是附近最大的镇子，那里可能有吧”"}
{"time": 1762249885, "type": "recv", "message_id": "138262298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，其实自己不太清楚家里有没有钱，但是要去那么远的地方，怎么看都只能买吧...看向母亲，等着她的意思。"}
{"time": 1762250470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1607691709", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=893879521][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “嗯..确实很神奇，阿姨也去试试吧”"}
{"time": 1762250519, "type": "recv", "message_id": "508866655", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1033860143][CQ:at,qq=1252219916] “买马车也....那是不是还得雇个车夫”"}
{"time": 1762250602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2015888765", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那是不是太麻烦了...舒茉现学!\"挺起胸膛，扬着脑袋信誓旦旦开口"}
{"time": 1762250656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1619164814", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“....感觉不如直接租一辆马车好了，租来的马车应该也有车夫”"}
{"time": 1762250828, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1093583907", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"沉吟一下，似乎也有道理?但是自己不太清楚具体有多远，\"我们离西海岸远吗？\""}
{"time": 1762250900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1613082275", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且养马也蛮麻烦的吧...除非舒茉可以用魔法召唤一匹马出来”"}
{"time": 1762251055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "463158426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我哪里会这种东西...\"看着自己的手心，\"昨天之后...我连自己有什么能力都遗忘了...真是，代价不菲...\""}
{"time": 1762251525, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1511553065", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过我也不后悔就是了。\"露出轻松的笑容，\"至少我们都到了这里。\""}
{"time": 1762251542, "type": "recv", "message_id": "695246229", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...多亏了舒茉啊”"}
{"time": 1762251816, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1325086042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过要是每次都这样...舒茉一辈子都厉害不起来呢...\""}
{"time": 1762252034, "type": "recv", "message_id": "316373123", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉已经很厉害啦”"}
{"time": 1762252217, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1565791884", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...其实我也不知道当时还能做什么...\"深深叹口气，\"什么都做不到..."}
{"time": 1762252471, "type": "recv", "message_id": "115729324", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉很努力啦...多亏了舒茉，我们人才这么齐...不是吗？”"}
{"time": 1762253541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270254848", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"虽然是这么说...\"拍拍胸口，\"嗯...这种事我也不想再来一次了。\""}
{"time": 1762254989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1990544470", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（睡着了）"}
{"time": 1762255038, "type": "recv", "message_id": "255406302", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "()"}
{"time": 1762255050, "type": "recv", "message_id": "193728943", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（）"}
{"time": 1762255218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580665105", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...”舒蕾还在这里，也不好意思多说些什么"}
{"time": 1762255413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "904024197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "等待母亲做决定。"}
{"time": 1762255940, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1945133235", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（别急）"}
{"time": 1762255948, "type": "recv", "message_id": "574516754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还，没复活）"}
{"time": 1762260029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "544475417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,file=DC6AE826C374EAC9B09A9555AB3C9D6F.jpg,sub_type=0,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhTYXYdfrvVKY6he3_Upkpsjyjq9ohjytAsg_woo3LWUmMLYkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQadmY6SmW17qURq6aucXxUHoCRSuCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMHCjz5TFrbrkx0paXesGFvfdYMJQUx8TCkckmEfY8RWZ2VNopAcCljJIEkT3uw0v_g,file_size=186994]"}
{"time": 1762260030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1421278572", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1762260049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "746554737", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（阿格莱雅走进星穹好像没了）"}
{"time": 1762260055, "type": "recv", "message_id": "461432825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（然后pv名字也改了）"}
{"time": 1762260056, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590876104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（？）"}
{"time": 1762260059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1208555271", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（厉害）"}
{"time": 1762260197, "type": "recv", "message_id": "408992273", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1093583907]“还是挺远的吧，坐上马车也得走个四五天”舒蕾想了想“走路不现实啦。不过只有有一站能坐上马车，后面应该就都能坐上了”"}
{"time": 1762260222, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1040756562", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(厉害)"}
{"time": 1762260276, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1527602354", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...那得看看有没有过去的马车...洗漱完我们就出发吧。\""}
{"time": 1762260277, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2141555360", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“原来，你们要去西海岸？”玲玲转过来，下巴搭在椅背上"}
