{"time": 1762262776, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2143325394", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯....”有点不太想放手，反正阿姨好像也没说什么的样子"}
{"time": 1762262813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "937010592", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"伊恩没放开的话，自己当然随便他，\"我已经把东西收拾好了，走吧妈妈。\""}
{"time": 1762262978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "505998082", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯……哎，先去集市吧”她一手一个把你们从地上拽起来"}
{"time": 1762263060, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1224553616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嘿嘿...\"妈妈没说什么呢...自己也不打算点破，\"嗯，走吧。\""}
{"time": 1762263552, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1546999705", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“走吧..”反正阿姨没说什么，自己也没什么心里负担"}
{"time": 1762274266, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102510442", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(团呢"}
{"time": 1762274270, "type": "recv", "message_id": "602240553", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（今晚又没有了吗）"}
{"time": 1762274279, "type": "recv", "message_id": "48355744", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（有的）"}
{"time": 1762274288, "type": "recv", "message_id": "253672014", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是我在享受按摩仪）"}
{"time": 1762274299, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1864679716", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（等会吧，反正不在粥也不在1）"}
{"time": 1762274673, "type": "recv", "message_id": "481220967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“行了，该拎的拎上……舒茉早上去过了，那就请你带个路？”看起来汉斯已经把东西收拾好了，防水布也卷好还回去了。舒蕾拎起最大的那份包裹，叉着腰看着你们"}
{"time": 1762274711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1725604168", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "\"我也帮忙拿一些吧\""}
{"time": 1762274747, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1709795417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "显然你不说也没人打算让你空手"}
{"time": 1762274756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1530290591", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "一共四个包，刚刚好"}
{"time": 1762274920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092980641", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "用空着的手接过一个包，背在背后"}
{"time": 1762275046, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1740694132", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "接过分给自己的，稍稍点头，走在前面。"}
{"time": 1762275273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "105531507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "虽说舒蕾没有说什么，但感觉在他们两面前牵手这种事，还是感觉背后有些流着冷汗，走在后面也就算了，但舒茉得带头...最终还是松开了手"}
{"time": 1762275322, "type": "recv", "message_id": "572186094", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "最人挤人的时期已经过去，返程的人比过去的人多。有些清空了商品的店铺已经在卷铺盖——主要是卖餐食的。服装、药品、日用品、装饰品大多还有些剩"}
{"time": 1762275427, "type": "recv", "message_id": "582828958", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"到啦。\"伊恩松开手的时候倒也没说什么，\"嗯...\""}
{"time": 1762275656, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1692849736", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“想想……要买的东西”舒蕾自己琢磨着“鞋袜，驱蚊液……还要打听那个银色小镇在哪，吧。”"}
{"time": 1762275813, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2115380238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那我去问问好了。\"找找早上买过首饰的商铺老板，问问她银色小镇的事情，或者最近有没有车队去西海岸。"}
{"time": 1762275838, "type": "recv", "message_id": "629345791", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我去买几件衣服和日用品吧...等下在哪集合？”"}
{"time": 1762276052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "266496739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2115380238]“银色小镇，我们一会收摊就回去了”对方随口解释“你们，以前没来过吧。”"}
