{"time": 1762277318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573113506", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1452318937]\"嗯...\"对这种地方稍微有些好奇，确认里面没人之后走进去坐下，\"唔唔...阿姨好?\"试探着开口"}
{"time": 1762277409, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1936028691", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（艾莉丝？）"}
{"time": 1762277415, "type": "recv", "message_id": "482537934", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1141311842]“哦？”他饶有兴趣地看了看你“她刚刚没看，但是早上来过一次，看了两款拿了一款，感兴趣？”"}
{"time": 1762277453, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1289866740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...我们是好朋友啦，另一款是哪个”"}
{"time": 1762277521, "type": "recv", "message_id": "345001771", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，要开始当神棍了吗）"}
{"time": 1762277749, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386049310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=573113506]“你好”她的声音彬彬有礼，听起来并不衰老。面纱后面的肤色颇深“迷茫的孩子……我看得出来。”"}
{"time": 1762277875, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1791840027", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"一时不知道该不该坐下，\"唔...\"虽然自己确实很迷茫，\"您知道我是谁吗？\""}
{"time": 1762277882, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1585840966", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1289866740]“好朋友可不会买首饰”他话语带着几分揶揄，手指指向了那枚红得耀眼的手链“这个”"}
{"time": 1762277960, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1153404417", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“很漂亮呢，怎么卖”"}
{"time": 1762278292, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1064150147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1791840027]“喔……真是个不妙的问题”她把手放在水晶球上，你发现她发丝间探出三角形的耳尖“你在乎的是自己的名字，还是身份？不过，那些不重要……重要的是，你把它们看得多重要？”她根本没回答你"}
{"time": 1762278374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1359498320", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1153404417]“这种料子可不好找，红色的比绿的蓝的都罕见”他对你伸出两根手指“两个金币”"}
{"time": 1762278461, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1654967938", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哈哈...便宜点，现在集市上人也没多少，我不买，说不定就没什么人买了”"}
{"time": 1762278477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1501262669", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你居然会砍价了）"}
{"time": 1762278479, "type": "recv", "message_id": "135877204", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“而且也不是只有你一家卖首饰吧”"}
{"time": 1762278508, "type": "recv", "message_id": "556893882", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1064150147]\"诶...舒茉就是舒茉啊...我只是想知道阿姨知不知道...\"有点不好意思地低下脑袋，\"毕竟占卜未来...舒茉也是第一次见到...\""}
{"time": 1762278598, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1606743634", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "准备先砍一刀狠的，然后在慢慢商量“70银币怎么样”"}
{"time": 1762278792, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2111708342", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1606743634]“哈哈，不卖”他立刻变了脸色，刚笑完的脸硬的和大理石一样“也就是我脾气好，换个店已经把你丢出去了。我看你就没想买，来消遣的”"}
{"time": 1762278836, "type": "recv", "message_id": "450012924", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我说你卖200也是在消遣我，我打听过了，你卖给别人根本不是200”"}
{"time": 1762278855, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046017859", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你打听在哪了）"}
{"time": 1762278864, "type": "recv", "message_id": "152296863", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（骗他啊）"}
{"time": 1762278896, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1207694268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（砍价不就是这样）"}
{"time": 1762278920, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1469928753", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（他又不知道我是不是真的打听过了）"}
{"time": 1762279044, "type": "recv", "message_id": "895060554", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=556893882]“我从不回答客人知道答案的问题”她笑了笑“相反，我只会问客人知道答案的问题。比如……你为什么来这？”"}
{"time": 1762279125, "type": "recv", "message_id": "689779538", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“总之两枚金币这种价格就不要糊弄我了”"}
{"time": 1762279148, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1572800830", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=895060554]\"...有些好奇...\"注意力放在她的耳朵上，\"阿姨刚刚说的是什么意思...我的身份怎么了？\"眨眨眼，\"我不就是普通女孩吗？\""}
{"time": 1762279152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1108436246", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我就不信市面上只有你卖这种类型的”"}
{"time": 1762279203, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1906227517", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=450012924]“一分钱一分货，这种好货你在整个集市都找不着能比得上的”他居高临下地睨视着你“光进料子就花了150银。不诚心要就别问了”"}
{"time": 1762279244, "type": "recv", "message_id": "714893364", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我就去其他店看看喽”"}
{"time": 1762279283, "type": "recv", "message_id": "793467327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“随你的便，再回来就不是这个价了”"}
{"time": 1762279311, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1275314298", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“随你，我不可能花那么高的价格来买的”"}
{"time": 1762279374, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1566838323", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1572800830]“是么？”她又笑了，把水晶球往前推了推，示意你把手放上去"}
{"time": 1762279447, "type": "recv", "message_id": "210310947", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "转身准备去集市其他地方逛逛"}
{"time": 1762279462, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1081623448", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉好像要过幸运的样子了）"}
{"time": 1762279523, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1301170339", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1566838323]按她说的把手放在水晶球上，心里倒也没什么期待，不过看见尖耳朵...有些兴奋，今天能见到精灵吗?"}
{"time": 1762279607, "type": "recv", "message_id": "761240400", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1081623448]（你会发现我之前说几家首饰店都是银色村庄来的（）"}
{"time": 1762279630, "type": "recv", "message_id": "388508006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（呵呵，合起伙来坑我是吧）"}
{"time": 1762279639, "type": "recv", "message_id": "337159692", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哦，原来我没说）"}
{"time": 1762279653, "type": "recv", "message_id": "959401343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是银色村庄确实背靠矿山）"}
{"time": 1762279670, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1621523224", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=388508006]（但是你一上来就一副要拿来求爱的样子）"}
