{"time": 1762279719, "type": "recv", "message_id": "380399456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好中规中矩）"}
{"time": 1762279756, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860521965", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "确实还有那么一家别的珠宝店。但里头找不到鸡血石的制品"}
{"time": 1762279783, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017662651", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“老板，你听过鸡血石吗”找他打听打听"}
{"time": 1762279806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1156497101", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（什么叫听过）"}
{"time": 1762279823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873362686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“老板，鸡血石的行情怎么样啊”找他打听打听"}
{"time": 1762279994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1338646107", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1301170339]你的手搭在水晶球上，比室温稍凉，光滑而温润。“想象一下……你的前路吧。比如……要往何处去，长成什么样子……还有要成为谁？”"}
{"time": 1762280111, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1570501718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=873362686]“鸡血石？有阵子没见过了。你……呃，客人想要红色的首饰？这里倒是有几件石榴石的”"}
{"time": 1762280218, "type": "recv", "message_id": "893269009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1338646107]嗯...要去西海岸...成为比现在厉害很多很多，可以用自己的魔法保护很多很多人...尤其是自己的家人的人...成为谁...?舒茉不就是舒茉吗？哦...还有一件事...雾气...笔记本...是什么?\n手心搭在水晶球上"}
{"time": 1762280290, "type": "recv", "message_id": "486576277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎？我有一块鸡血石的话，老板会花多少钱收”"}
{"time": 1762280335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1179489688", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "根据那件饰品的样子，描述一下大概的成色"}
{"time": 1762280408, "type": "recv", "message_id": "466522582", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=893269009]水晶球上靠近你手掌的部分因为温度凝出些许灰蒙蒙的水汽。随后水汽像是渗进水晶球里了一半，整颗球内部都变得灰白起来"}
{"time": 1762280435, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1696785279", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1179489688]（呃）"}
