{"time": 1762282742, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1900959739", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1694065554]接过来，\"嗯...谢谢姐姐...\"虽然自己也不知道这东西管不管用...\"姐姐能教我魔法吗？\""}
{"time": 1762282994, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978748445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1900959739]“不客气，讨个吉利的话，收你127银币好了”她眨眨眼“可惜，作为暗精灵，我只会些许夜视的皮毛”"}
{"time": 1762283039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1675385959", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1709803377]（我一想到你一会还要跟他的车）"}
{"time": 1762283054, "type": "recv", "message_id": "162017255", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（hhh）"}
{"time": 1762283135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "165303546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这笔钱自己付的话...咬着牙把钱付了，\"夜视?可以教我吗？\""}
{"time": 1762283477, "type": "recv", "message_id": "231973084", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“只需要一些小小的仪式……画出特定的阵法，向夜晚献上祈愿和魔力便可。先祖会庇佑你的”她把水晶球挪开，桌布上被底座压着的地方，确实有一个图阵"}
{"time": 1762283602, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780617811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点脑袋，把这种阵法记下来，\"谢谢姐姐...姐姐再见。\"出去找妈妈"}
