{"time": 1762304900, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1772769902", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉，好巧啊，一回来就正好遇到了你”"}
{"time": 1762305146, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1071891303", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"心里在想着刚刚的事，\"伊恩...我刚刚遇见精灵了哦...\""}
{"time": 1762305177, "type": "recv", "message_id": "528547460", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“哎，舒茉运气这么好啊，为什么我只碰到了奸商”"}
{"time": 1762305195, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2056675707", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"不过...\"从头到尾说一下占卜的事情，虽然遇到精灵很开心，但是花了一个多金币的钱...还是有点不太舒服..."}
