{"time": 1762305689, "type": "recv", "message_id": "89861445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他80手你，转手就160起卖）"}
{"time": 1762305771, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1664457956", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...伊恩打算买什么诶?\"抿着唇，不知道自己是不是上当了，\"我是不是被骗了?\""}
{"time": 1762305848, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1887905628", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“一些小玩意而已，没什么特别的，至于舒茉有没有被骗...反正现在叔叔阿姨好像也没回来，你带我也过去看看吧”"}
{"time": 1762306051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "980584426", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...伊恩想去看看吗？唔...\"真的被骗的话，不是显得自己很呆...\"算了算了，钱都付过了...\""}
{"time": 1762306265, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1928330006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我对这种东西，也蛮感兴趣的，说实话”"}
{"time": 1762306372, "type": "recv", "message_id": "886105967", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...\"看妈妈还没回来，带着伊恩找过去看看"}
