{"time": 1762315370, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2059771327", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（如果伊神没有嫖我一个648的话，我上半年还充的起月卡）"}
{"time": 1762315380, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1663152404", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（伊神还没还你吗（））"}
{"time": 1762315388, "type": "recv", "message_id": "128030752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（也对，伊神的经济情况）"}
{"time": 1762315391, "type": "recv", "message_id": "640500150", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他押金还欠着呢（）"}
{"time": 1762315393, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1583681661", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(还没，我欠龙哥好多)"}
{"time": 1762315413, "type": "recv", "message_id": "931180013", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(龙哥的恩情还不完啊)"}
{"time": 1762315418, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600533759", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（感觉不管每个月的什么时候见他，他余额都不超过50）"}
{"time": 1762315450, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079849456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(正常，因为我是周结，你每个月见我的时候都在周末)"}
{"time": 1762315548, "type": "recv", "message_id": "23383599", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2120607171]他们手上各自多了个小包裹，看起来是些出行的用品。舒蕾看你过来，从包里摸出一个小瓶子，在你身上喷了些带着植物清香的水雾“回来了？这个驱蚊提神的，现在还有蚊虫呢”"}
{"time": 1762315592, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998365638", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“怎么样，买了什么？”"}
{"time": 1762315605, "type": "recv", "message_id": "827493243", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“买了件衣服....”"}
{"time": 1762315652, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1883293742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"把自己占卜店买了个熏香的事说了出来，但是伊恩那个就没有提"}
{"time": 1762315662, "type": "recv", "message_id": "215649811", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就一件？”舒蕾睁大了眼睛，似乎看了眼舒茉“钱不够吗？”"}
{"time": 1762315716, "type": "recv", "message_id": "177682340", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...为什么只买一件?\"自己也没想到，\"伊恩不多买几件吗？\""}
{"time": 1762315804, "type": "recv", "message_id": "873311412", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（哎，我说2000的弓皮放别的黄金裔比放主角顺眼多了）"}
{"time": 1762315823, "type": "recv", "message_id": "601037588", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“一件就够用了吧.......钱当然够用啊”"}
{"time": 1762315835, "type": "recv", "message_id": "897631731", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我平常花钱比较省吧...”"}
{"time": 1762315927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "609473626", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=897631731]“一件也太少了”舒蕾摇头“……破了脏了怎么办？也不是这么省的”"}
{"time": 1762315964, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1138122875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好吧...那我再买一件”"}
{"time": 1762315978, "type": "recv", "message_id": "118251560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1883293742]“占卜……”她听到头两个字的时候面色就古怪起来"}
{"time": 1762315980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "983524395", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“稍微等下我，抱歉了”"}
{"time": 1762315989, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479508025", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "转身去再买件衣服吧"}
{"time": 1762316029, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1978091238", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "低着头不敢看妈妈，\"她说舒茉的身边会遭遇厄运...买了之后会好一些...\""}
{"time": 1762316039, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1298535675", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=118251560]听完整个过程她才叹口气“下次果然还是得跟你一起走……这种东西十个里头可能有一个真的，但是剩下九个肯定是假的……”"}
{"time": 1762316132, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1590142128", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"假的?\"瞪大眼睛，\"可是阿姨是精灵...精灵应该真...真的吧...?还有水晶球..\""}
{"time": 1762316383, "type": "recv", "message_id": "16926031", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“不知道……”舒蕾和汉斯对视一眼，有点无奈地摇头“算了……我也说不明白真假。运气这种事情说不清道不明……那个熏香，让我闻闻看？”"}
{"time": 1762316470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "290072864", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "把熏香递给妈妈，\"舒茉被骗了吗？\"语气低落"}
{"time": 1762316616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "409051740", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "她接过熏香，细闻了闻“没闻过类似的味道……搞不清楚，说不定确实是精灵族有的东西吧……舒茉能在其中感觉到魔力吗？”"}
{"time": 1762316648, "type": "recv", "message_id": "768450770", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "确实没做过这种尝试，说到底自己真的能感知到魔力什么的吗...完全不知道从什么地方下手"}
{"time": 1762316953, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1079737877", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我...我不太懂，没试过...\"等着伊恩回来...?"}
{"time": 1762316992, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1941522142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你可以简简单单过个灵感）"}
{"time": 1762317020, "type": "recv", "message_id": "511174421", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "。rd+3"}
