{"time": 1762317113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1614133166", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "确实有很微弱的魔力。不过与运气或灵魂有没有关系？"}
{"time": 1762317226, "type": "recv", "message_id": "727032232", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1479508025]买完了.jpg"}
{"time": 1762317287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1412228261", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "这种东西...现在的自己当然完全理解不了，\"有一点点魔力...不太懂具体是什么。\"这么回答妈妈"}
{"time": 1762317392, "type": "recv", "message_id": "370151623", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“起码不是用什么随处可见的草调的地摊货”她拍拍你的肩膀“说不定是真的呢”"}
{"time": 1762317651, "type": "recv", "message_id": "375791742", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"靠在她身上，\"舒茉不清楚啦...但是涉及到这种事情，总有些担心...是不是下次也会被骗...\""}
{"time": 1762317824, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1735572335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“一般来说没到花钱的那步就不至于被骗……”汉斯冷不丁插一句“……不过至少作为学费来说不算多”"}
{"time": 1762318047, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1319840977", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"...\"不知道该说什么，这也不是127，还额外搭上了一个金币...缩在母亲怀里不想动弹了。"}
