{"time": 1762333161, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1778434528", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "自己虽然之前跟这个老板有矛盾，不过现在说出来大概只会添麻烦吧，默不作声"}
{"time": 1762333227, "type": "recv", "message_id": "948075615", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（其实不止一个人啦）"}
{"time": 1762333230, "type": "recv", "message_id": "168827654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "“嗯...”走到谈好的老板面前，“老板好~”笑容明朗"}
{"time": 1762333340, "type": "recv", "message_id": "160797986", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“哦，我看你们等挺久了？”他坐在车夫的位置上“大概六七公里吧，不算很远”"}
{"time": 1762333384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "815418119", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好～谢谢老板。我们四个人带着四个包，价格这么算～\""}
{"time": 1762333624, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1580173560", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "他扭头看了看三辆车的情况“车上大概只能挤下两个人。按一个人5银算，你们安排吧。其他人只能步行了吧”"}
{"time": 1762333711, "type": "recv", "message_id": "975164713", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“呃...我走吧，舒茉和叔叔坐车？”考虑到舒蕾身体比较好，这样建议道"}
{"time": 1762333718, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1986261987", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好的，谢谢老板。\"利落把钱付了，回去跟爸妈和伊恩说明情况，\"嗯...伊恩和爸爸先上去休息吧。\""}
{"time": 1762333729, "type": "recv", "message_id": "515045748", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我和妈妈走走路，后面再换?怎么样。\""}
{"time": 1762333754, "type": "recv", "message_id": "194966423", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“舒茉去坐车吧...我想走路”"}
{"time": 1762333884, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1232785006", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（让男来了全让了）"}
{"time": 1762333957, "type": "recv", "message_id": "998434104", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（letme？）"}
{"time": 1762333997, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2070220358", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我说不如把行李全放上去四个人一起走路得了（））"}
{"time": 1762334004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2096349906", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"抱着妈妈的手臂，\"这可是我们母女两的独处时刻，伊恩别掺和啦，快去上车。昨天没休息好吧?\""}
{"time": 1762334069, "type": "recv", "message_id": "36610434", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我昨天睡得挺好的，那舒茉和阿姨一起坐车也可以吧”"}
{"time": 1762334239, "type": "recv", "message_id": "287858489", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"中间换一下不就好了?\"瞪一眼伊恩，笑容有些僵硬"}
{"time": 1762334335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1889903287", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不如加点钱让马夫下来走（））"}
{"time": 1762334384, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1035656009", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "看看叔叔怎么说"}
{"time": 1762334437, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1043820963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（别管叔叔了）"}
{"time": 1762334534, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2028240546", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "汉斯一副事不关己的样子，已经先跟着车走了"}
{"time": 1762334553, "type": "recv", "message_id": "465832321", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大概是默认了自己步行"}
{"time": 1762334743, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1127640042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（我今天中午在想，下一次爆该是什么表现形式）"}
{"time": 1762334752, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1865633645", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（想了想，该cos卫宫士郎了）"}
{"time": 1762334852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1975047346", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（也是仓库战神）"}
{"time": 1762334903, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1270908895", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(厉害)"}
{"time": 1762334933, "type": "recv", "message_id": "760332051", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"看爸爸对自己的提议完全不上心，\"哼...\"赌气地拉着妈妈上车"}
{"time": 1762335192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2134197410", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嘛，两位男士好好加油啦？”舒蕾倒是也不客气，不如说她要是下定决心按自己的想法来，人选都轮不到你们讨论"}
{"time": 1762335318, "type": "recv", "message_id": "32340954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "上车之后径直缩进母亲怀里，\"唔唔...舒茉说的话一点用都没有...真是的...\""}
{"time": 1762335478, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1348340038", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“也不能这么说，我不是来了么？不过你们两个半斤八两吧”她搂住你的肩膀，背对着前路。已经完全没了逃难的紧张感"}
{"time": 1762335576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1840846147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"总有些咽不下这口气，但是又无可奈何，斜靠在母亲肩上，\"接下来就是考虑怎么去西海岸了...\""}
{"time": 1762335613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "503516277", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "跟在汉斯旁边默默的走着，和他也不知道说些什么，索幸专心走路了"}
{"time": 1762335773, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1302804718", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "(现在几点来着)"}
{"time": 1762335791, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2129967196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（正午吧）"}
{"time": 1762335907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1679415088", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"有点困...\""}
{"time": 1762336004, "type": "recv", "message_id": "74333335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1679415088]“嗯……应该能眯一会？不打算换班的话就能更久了”"}
{"time": 1762336166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "204806310", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"从早上就起来走了两个来回，靠着她眯起眼，睡一会"}
{"time": 1762336303, "type": "recv", "message_id": "48523430", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=503516277]约莫过了一个多小时。汉斯突然开口跟你说“你走累了的话，我去问问能不能租车夫的位置？”"}
{"time": 1762336339, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2046420782", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我还好啦...没有多累，叔叔不用担心了”"}
{"time": 1762336706, "type": "recv", "message_id": "100579389", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我知道没到那个份上”他想了想说法“但是休息不是犯罪”"}
{"time": 1762336806, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2002309624", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“真不用啦，叔叔，而且马车上挤，我感觉走路更自在一点”"}
{"time": 1762336979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304259852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2002309624]“嗯……你自己把握就好”他见状也不再多说，埋头走着。饶是速度不快，过了这么久，也快该走到了"}
{"time": 1762337284, "type": "recv", "message_id": "34789963", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "一开始你几乎以为那是座雪山，银白的山峰反射着贝白色的日光，天空和山体的交界处被模糊了。直到太阳开始染上红色，你才看出来那山远没有一开始想的那么高。银色村庄栖伏在山脚下，像裙裾旁俯卧的宠物"}
{"time": 1762337316, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364295142", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“好白的山”"}
{"time": 1762337490, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1554649108", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "大概这就是村子的得名吧。靠着这样的山，当然也不需要别的名字"}
{"time": 1762337529, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2066859901", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "有些好奇为什么这么白，不自觉的走快了一些，想一探究竟"}
{"time": 1762337829, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1561357444", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "上面没有植被，恐怕甚至没多少土层"}
{"time": 1762337908, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1653795747", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "看起来有些营养不良的山体裸露在云天之下，不过显然离村子还有些距离"}
{"time": 1762338135, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1128345949", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "睡得倒是相当安稳这会"}
