{"time": 1762338863, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1780306175", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“舒茉睡迷糊了？”舒蕾上手揉了揉你的脸“这儿是银色村庄，要来找马车……不是银色马车”"}
{"time": 1762339049, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1114133314", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦哦...\"继续眯上眼，\"还是好累...\""}
{"time": 1762339059, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2032866057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "靠着妈妈的肩膀，还是不想动"}
{"time": 1762339077, "type": "recv", "message_id": "834559507", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虚b（）"}
{"time": 1762339084, "type": "recv", "message_id": "533056752", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（虚b（）"}
{"time": 1762339100, "type": "recv", "message_id": "386439498", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（虽然确实虚）"}
{"time": 1762339264, "type": "recv", "message_id": "428151057", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "银色村庄看起来和未白村差不多大，大多数建筑的北面都涂成了深色，南侧则各有各的偏好。此外要说有什么区别，就是农田显著少，村中干道有一条岔口直接走出村落，连向群山"}
{"time": 1762339367, "type": "recv", "message_id": "341424646", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "行至村中，他停了车，似乎到此为止了“就到这里吧”"}
