{"time": 1762356916, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1017122894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1727003093]（就是你动吧（）"}
{"time": 1762356927, "type": "recv", "message_id": "446671894", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不是你叫她？）"}
{"time": 1762356943, "type": "recv", "message_id": "76565545", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（舒蕾在旁边为什么会轮到我叫）"}
{"time": 1762356954, "type": "recv", "message_id": "594584196", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（因为叫过一次了）"}
{"time": 1762357051, "type": "recv", "message_id": "547630805", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（但是我在车下不知道啊，我只能等，然后等一段时间看她们还没下来，才轮的到我叫，那这段时间舒蕾在干什么 挂机吗（）"}
{"time": 1762357064, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1892319768", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（敞篷车）"}
{"time": 1762357067, "type": "recv", "message_id": "213018205", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（你难道）"}
{"time": 1762357070, "type": "recv", "message_id": "792648633", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（看不见吗）"}
{"time": 1762357167, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2079307577", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好吧）"}
{"time": 1762357192, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1203236411", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "在车下摇摇舒茉“别睡了，到目的地了，小懒虫...”"}
{"time": 1762357234, "type": "recv", "message_id": "348314840", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（诶，那我会告诉你）"}
{"time": 1762357238, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125754037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他在打三角洲）"}
{"time": 1762357309, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1097151893", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（哎，你说的有事原来是打三角洲吗，那是不是意味着之后dnd的时候你就不玩fps了？）"}
{"time": 1762357585, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2055491212", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:image,summary=&#91;动画表情&#93;,file=40C86C76A6CE554D49FDE686F897D4ED.jpg,sub_type=1,url=https://multimedia.nt.qq.com.cn/download?appid=1407&amp;fileid=EhRMeC3ZWIcpGVYSEm4XcHLbpO0KsxiLuwIg_woot_Suzq3bkAMyBHByb2RQgL2jAVoQHw9X9SaKYkcaTT7X2HZysXoCXOOCAQJneg&amp;rkey=CAESMDkfmXCSoAPas1Z0zEn9gXWVzs6PTrlaGecYLz4jbMu8dGKN5Uyx8aY0U4wQDkMMSQ,file_size=40331]"}
{"time": 1762357739, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1962186042", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1203236411]\"诶...\"此刻倒是清醒了一些，\"到哪了?\""}
{"time": 1762357753, "type": "recv", "message_id": "642504580", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“已经到了银色村庄了”"}
{"time": 1762357767, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1857879464", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...好吧...\""}
{"time": 1762357883, "type": "recv", "message_id": "907403754", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1857879464]“早上醒太早了？还是……前一天的事？”舒蕾微皱着眉，带着勉强的微笑“舒茉没事吧？”"}
{"time": 1762357911, "type": "recv", "message_id": "73768846", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哈～早上醒了太早了，还走了两个来回。\"伸个懒腰"}
{"time": 1762357923, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2125244379", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "听到舒蕾的话也不免担心起来“有感觉到不舒服吗”"}
{"time": 1762358086, "type": "recv", "message_id": "72764169", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"倒也可以啦...我现在只是好像有点忘了自己之前会什么了。\""}
{"time": 1762358152, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2037353017", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=907403754]（哎，打这段字错过了长夜月的变身cg）"}
{"time": 1762358166, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1860583559", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（搞得我现在不知道长夜月和三月七是什么关系（）"}
{"time": 1762358209, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1947709509", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=72764169]“忘了会什么……？”舒蕾有些疑惑“是指魔法？”"}
{"time": 1762358232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "349612909", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=2037353017](你理解为里人格就行了)"}
{"time": 1762358394, "type": "recv", "message_id": "86345194", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "(你理解为里人格就行了)"}
{"time": 1762358431, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1092642335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=1947709509]\"嗯...魔法。\""}
{"time": 1762358576, "type": "recv", "message_id": "935789335", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"之前似乎摸到了一点新的魔法的边沿，现在忘记了...\"叹口气，\"昨天之后...\""}
{"time": 1762358616, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1136668474", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“我还以为牧师小姐就已经治好了……看来去西海岸还有别的事得一并解决啊”舒茉无奈地摸摸你的额头"}
{"time": 1762358794, "type": "recv", "message_id": "364279313", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"没事啦，只是遗憾的话...没什么关系。\"从车上起身，跳下车舒展一下，\"唔...雪山吗？\""}
{"time": 1762358825, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1395930774", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不是啦，只是石头的样子”"}
{"time": 1762358961, "type": "recv", "message_id": "999392532", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“嗯，那边是银白山。不过那些石头大部分是方解石，里头的矿场是白银村庄的支柱。还有小姐们，我想你们得下车了”老板回过头来，清了清嗓子"}
{"time": 1762359030, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2117926730", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"诶...\"一时没有理解过来，稍微过了一会才理解那原来是石头，\"哦哦...\"把车上的行李提下来，刚刚睡醒还是有些疲惫感。"}
{"time": 1762359164, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1393564954", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我来吧...”看舒茉没什么精神的样子，帮她拿着她那一份行李"}
{"time": 1762359302, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1536037801", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"放开手，双手揉揉自己的眼眶，\"我也没事啦...待会问问有没有马车去西海岸...老板知道镇上的行商都在哪吗？\""}
{"time": 1762359434, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1984604283", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“要找商行？找高的建筑就是了”车子没为你们停留太久，很快往山的方向去了，似乎把你们放在了大路上。你们提着几大包行李，在人流中有些促狭"}
{"time": 1762359514, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1903333625", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那我们快走吧...”"}
{"time": 1762359538, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2106586587", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（好像忘了件事，不过不急）"}
{"time": 1762359541, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1415161778", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（还有机会）"}
{"time": 1762359618, "type": "recv", "message_id": "406473686", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯嗯...如果今天还有机会的话。\"看了看镇上的建筑，往最高的走，\"也许今天就能搭上车\""}
{"time": 1762359907, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1788365070", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "红砖白梁，宽门深堂。这村子里最高的建筑不出意外地也靠在西侧，离赫顿玛尔最近的方向。这儿的建筑普遍比小农经济为主的未白村精致一个档，也宽大一个档。此时正是下午，来往的人不算少"}
{"time": 1762359912, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1463108644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯...能越早出发越好”"}
{"time": 1762359979, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1902224201", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“不过话说这好像还是我第一次来其他镇子”"}
{"time": 1762360007, "type": "recv", "message_id": "842963855", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"嗯...\"其实不太懂应该在这种地方怎么问...或者说做什么，进去看看，陌生人人来人往，身体不自觉靠向母亲。"}
{"time": 1762360081, "type": "recv", "message_id": "351759422", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "至少，在宽敞的大厅中央，侍者站的台子很显眼"}
{"time": 1762360232, "type": "recv", "message_id": "905683495", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“emmm，我去问问吧”"}
{"time": 1762360254, "type": "recv", "message_id": "357914825", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"我...我也去...\"下定决心，跟着一起"}
{"time": 1762360273, "type": "recv", "message_id": "48120611", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，那我们一起吧”去侍者那里"}
{"time": 1762360287, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2119300875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“就当锻炼一下？没什么难的，以后还有很多机会”"}
{"time": 1762360360, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1479859071", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"那个...今天有去西海岸的队伍吗...\""}
{"time": 1762360371, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1726044662", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "在台前，小声询问"}
{"time": 1762360540, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1440958219", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“是说……去西海岸，是吗？”身着青衣的侍者确认到“抱歉，路途遥远，迈腾商会没有直达的路线。不过只要到了赫顿玛尔，便有更多选择”"}
{"time": 1762360577, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102544147", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"哦...\"自己对于这种距离其实没有什么概念，看向伊恩"}
{"time": 1762360599, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1453505349", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这样啊....那可以直接租一辆马车吗”"}
{"time": 1762360700, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1808746373", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“当然可以，缴纳完押金，在契约期内将马车归还给任意一处分会即可”"}
{"time": 1762360751, "type": "recv", "message_id": "448224777", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“叔叔，两种选择的价格分别大概是多少”"}
{"time": 1762360925, "type": "recv", "message_id": "829643445", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“从这里到赫顿玛尔，单程每人1金。如果这些行李都要带走的话，得再多30银。如果是租赁，押金是15金，带保险。租金按日结算，每天1金”"}
{"time": 1762360977, "type": "recv", "message_id": "984250719", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（一般来说押金几乎和买下来差不多了吧）"}
{"time": 1762361087, "type": "recv", "message_id": "755078841", "deleted": true, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“这边到西海岸的话，大概要几天”"}
{"time": 1762361108, "type": "recv", "message_id": "532345343", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（就，你没发现）"}
{"time": 1762361116, "type": "recv", "message_id": "812511064", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（他们在西海岸没分部吗）"}
{"time": 1762361122, "type": "recv", "message_id": "608170251", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（不然为什么到不了）"}
{"time": 1762361133, "type": "recv", "message_id": "539797828", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（oh）"}
{"time": 1762361138, "type": "recv", "message_id": "102282654", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（好吧）"}
{"time": 1762361184, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1170521729", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那好像跟着队伍去更划算一点”"}
{"time": 1762361196, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1311190640", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"唔...那似乎还不如坐车去?\""}
{"time": 1762361331, "type": "recv", "message_id": "591324749", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“我们去跟叔叔阿姨说一下吧”"}
{"time": 1762361346, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2124185109", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“去赫顿玛尔，不过三日旅途。如果几位没有能熟练驾驭马车的人选，我个人的确推荐前者”"}
{"time": 1762361357, "type": "recv", "message_id": "791856945", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“谢谢叔叔”对侍者告谢"}
{"time": 1762361470, "type": "recv", "message_id": "656606073", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点点头，\"今天有已经排好的车次吗？\""}
{"time": 1762361696, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1459895648", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“有，不过马车不行夜路，晚饭后出发的班次会在最近的村落先过夜……那边的条件可不如这边一般好”他循循善诱"}
{"time": 1762361819, "type": "recv", "message_id": "720118048", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“自己租马车，如果雇车夫的话，是怎么样的价格”"}
{"time": 1762361826, "type": "recv", "message_id": "948895180", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"好吧...那我们明天走，几点在哪里出发?\""}
{"time": 1762361852, "type": "recv", "message_id": "573963636", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=720118048]（那不就是跟车么）"}
{"time": 1762361874, "type": "recv", "message_id": "304522929", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（显然只会更贵啊）"}
{"time": 1762361956, "type": "recv", "message_id": "28898456", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "[CQ:reply,id=948895180]“最早的话，明早八点。车辆牌号会写在乘车凭证上”"}
{"time": 1762362052, "type": "recv", "message_id": "41605197", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“那谢谢叔叔了”"}
{"time": 1762362063, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1332658300", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "点头表示清楚明白，回去和父母说明此事"}
{"time": 1762362268, "type": "recv", "message_id": "2001304463", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“谈完了？”舒蕾收回打量大厅的目光“原来还有这么有钱的村子……哦，谈得怎么样？”"}
{"time": 1762362335, "type": "recv", "message_id": "986396151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“嗯，说路途遥远..我们得先去赫顿玛尔，再从那边转”"}
{"time": 1762362379, "type": "recv", "message_id": "480853798", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"明天早上八点...一人一个金币，算行李加三十银。\""}
{"time": 1762362484, "type": "recv", "message_id": "665912644", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "门口快步走进一个行色匆匆的年轻人，视若无睹地从你们几人中间的狭缝蛮穿过去，直奔前台，把舒蕾说到嘴边的话挤了回去"}
{"time": 1762362509, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1076150127", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“？”感觉这人有点没礼貌"}
{"time": 1762362591, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1095060037", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "但也懒得跟他计较"}
{"time": 1762362604, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1905554268", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（感觉突然说🐴都似了有点暴力）"}
{"time": 1762362613, "type": "recv", "message_id": "455336852", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（但是感觉很适合开支线诶）"}
{"time": 1762362658, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1674858865", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"咦...\"这人怎么行色匆匆的，注意听他要说什么"}
{"time": 1762362857, "type": "recv", "message_id": "154833151", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "“希诺斯，快……发公告，调集人手物资……”他喘着粗气“矿井深处……呼……元素精灵，在暴动……”"}
{"time": 1762362980, "type": "recv", "message_id": "739807875", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "（虽然适合插支线，但我们怎么接呢（）"}
{"time": 1762363006, "type": "recv", "message_id": "27254616", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（很简单啊，人手不够的话村子今晚就会被冲烂（）"}
{"time": 1762363104, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1881766091", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“听起来好像很严重的样子...”"}
{"time": 1762363113, "type": "recv", "message_id": "1600508129", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1252219916"}, "sender": {"id": "1252219916", "name": "千成之愿"}, "message": "\"元素精灵?\"瞪大眼睛，\"怎么舒茉走到哪都会出事...呃，今天我们能走吗...\""}
{"time": 1762363147, "type": "recv", "message_id": "59139492", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "825734198"}, "sender": {"id": "825734198", "name": "草食龙"}, "message": "（鱼死网破，今晚就走？）"}
{"time": 1762363160, "type": "recv", "message_id": "964185222", "deleted": false, "dect": {"host_id": null, "group_id": "1020481325", "user_id": "1040972910"}, "sender": {"id": "1040972910", "name": "划船不靠桨の233"}, "message": "“应该很难吧...说不定人手都被调走抵抗了”"}
